window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2901,"title":"Chapter 2901 - Divine Phoenix Blood (2)","paragraphs":["He involuntarily looked at the Shadow Phoenix.","There was no doubt that the bird enjoyed the taste of Feng Wu’s blood.","He had a bad feeling.","If the Shadow Phoenix liked Feng Wu’s blood that much, it was very possible that he couldn’t control it with Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood anymore.","Therefore, he took out the pendant.","It had been smeared with the True Phoenix Blood, so he whispered at the Shadow Phoenix, “Come back! Come back!”","The Shadow Phoenix rolled its eyes at Sheng Changtian again.","Feng Wu grinned at the Shadow Phoenix. “Do you want to come with me?”","She was luring the Shadow Phoenix to her side.","“Feng Wu, how dare you?!” Zuo Qingluan ground her teeth.","She hadn’t been so sure before, but she was certain now.","Feng Wu had indeed recovered her True Phoenix Blood, and it might even have been upgraded.","Otherwise, the Shadow Phoenix wouldn’t betray her!","The Shadow Phoenix stared at Feng Wu and hesitated.","Its instinct told it to follow its heart and to go with the person with better blood.","However...","The Shadow Phoenix glared at Zuo Qingluan. “Why don’t you have Divine Phoenix Blood?!”","It then went back into the pendant.","It used the common language, so everybody heard those words.","They also saw how much the bird disliked Zuo Qingluan.","“Divine Phoenix Blood?”","“Did I hear that correctly?","“‘Why don’t you have Divine Phoenix Blood?’ So, the person who has it is...”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Everyone had curious and shocked expressions.","The audience, the team members and even the referees were astonished.","Feng was amazed, too.","Divine Phoenix Blood?","The one and only Divine Phoenix Blood?","One might find the True Phoenix Blood in another country, but not the Divine Phoenix Blood.","The Divine Phoenix Blood was so important!","Your Royal Highness, you have to marry her!? Feng looked at Jun Linyuan.","That news would excite many people!","All young talented men would want to marry her!","Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood was nothing in comparison!","Sensing Feng’s excitement, the crown prince raised his chin and gloated.","My girl! Mine!","Feng rolled his eyes.","When are you going to tell her, then?","The crown prince looked away.","At the same time, Sheng Changtian finally realized what had happened and pointed at Feng Wu. “You...”","His hand was trembling.","Feng Wu asked, “Me what?”","“You really have Divine Phoenix Blood!”","Feng Wu said, “I guess so.”","Sheng Changtian said, “Don’t you know for sure?”","Feng Wu said, “How? Who can verify it?”","That was true.","She was the only person who had Divine Phoenix Blood. Who else could verify it for her?","However...","“I think you have it.” Sheng Changtian stared at her."]},{"number":2902,"title":"Chapter 2902 - Divine Phoenix Blood (3)","paragraphs":["That was the only reason the Shadow Phoenix would abandon the True Phoenix Blood for Feng Wu’s blood.","“Your blood is more precious than True Phoenix Blood!” Sheng Changtian added.","Feng Wu said, “Are you sure you want to say that? Miss Zuo will cry.”","Sheng Changtian looked at the audience and saw Zuo Qingluan’s livid face.","Ah!","He finally recovered from his initial shock.","Then, he realized something more serious.","He and Feng Wu were in the middle of a battle!","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Shall we continue?”","Continue?","Without the Shadow Phoenix, Sheng Changtian didn’t stand a chance.","He had taken enough of a beating from Feng Wu.","He looked at his own team and had a bitter taste in his mouth.","Why did he have to be the last player?","Why did he have to take responsibility?","The Military Academy students looked at him with conflicted feelings.","Sheng Changtian looked at them again, but no one made a sound.","He then turned to the referees.","He didn’t dare look at the crown prince because he felt so ashamed.","If he had defeated Feng Wu, he would have run up to His Royal Highness to wait for some compliments.","But now, he felt he had disappointed the crown prince.","Both Chu Yun and Gongshu Hongzhu sat there with livid faces.","They didn’t take the defeat well.","Finally, Sheng Changtian turned to Feng Wu.","Taking a deep breath, he said, “I know I’m not as capable as you, but I may still have a chance! Bring it on!”","The next second, Feng Wu moved.","No one knew how, but she did move.","Why were they so sure?","Sheng Changtian was in the air already.","Feng Wu had kicked him in the stomach. He looked like he was folded in half when he flew backward and landed with a loud thump.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Feng Wu was such a legend!","In her airy red dress, she looked as pretty as a picture.","Sheng Changtian lay there for a long while, and Feng Wu smiled.","She said, “I was born to be brilliant.”","Everybody was amazed by her casual tone.","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu looked just as brilliant as the sun.","She would shine even if some people didn’t want to see her.","Feng Xun was the first to stand up and start clapping.","The applause sounded like a tidal wave.","The Imperial College students copied Feng Wu and shouted at the Military Academy, “We were born to be brilliant.”","Feng Wu was their sun!","Jun Linyuan felt happier than if he had won a battle himself. He couldn’t stop smiling.","He was so proud of her.","Gongshu Hongzhu apologized, “Your Royal Highness, we lost the competition. We’ve let you down, so please punish us.”"]},{"number":2903,"title":"Chapter 2903 - Wrap Up","paragraphs":["Gongshu Hongzhu apologized, “Your Royal Highness, we lost the competition. We’ve let you down, so please punish us.”","Jun Linyuan raised his head. This was the first time that he met Gongshu Hongzhu’s eyes.","He frowned and seemed bewildered.","What did he have to do with this?","Gongshu Hongzhu was in tears. “Your Royal Highness, we’ve lost the competition. Please punish us however you see fit.”","The crown prince patted him on the shoulder. “No, you did a great job.”","Gongshu Hongzhu felt so touched. They had let His Royal Highness down, but His Royal Highness had comforted him. He wasn’t as cold as other people claimed that he was!","I’m his biggest fan!","After sending Gongshu Hongzhu away, Jun Linyuan turned his gaze on Feng Wu again.","He rubbed his chin and couldn’t stop smiling.","His girl was awesome!","That little speech she gave in the arena was amazing!","The crown prince’s eyes twinkled as he let his imagination run wild.","When Feng Wu turned around to receive the audience’s cheers, she looked stunning.","The most beautiful girl was right there on the stage!","A girl wasn’t of much use if she only had a pretty face.","If a girl was talented, she would be considered an expert cultivator.","What if someone was both beautiful and talented?","How should she be described?","Feng Xun couldn’t think of any words either. He just clapped his hands and cheered loudly while he showed off his sister.","The ordinary students around him rarely had a chance to talk to a young lord, and they were thrilled.","“She really is my sister! We’re very tight!”","He showed off his sister to every student nearby, even those sitting behind him.","Feng Wu looked at Gongsun Mu.","Only then did Gongsun Mu realize what had happened.","Gosh!","They had won the competition!","Feeling relieved, he turned to Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness?”","However, His Royal Highness was still lost in his girl’s beauty.","“Your Royal Highness?” Gongsun Mu had never seen Jun Linyuan like this before.","The crown prince wasn’t pleased when he was disturbed.","Gongsun Mu immediately said, “Your Royal Highness, all five games are over. Shall we announce the final result?","Jun Linyuan looked toward the stage.","The pretty girl was looking at him.","Well!","He immediately put on a serious face.","Gongshu Hongzhu thought, “His Royal Highness is on our side. I’m sure he’ll just say the competition is over and let everybody go home.”","Of course, the crown prince wouldn’t deprive his girl of her glory.","He rose to his feet and walked toward the stage.","What?","Gongshu Hongzhu was dumbfounded. He didn’t understand why the crown prince couldn’t make the announcement from his seat."]},{"number":2904,"title":"Chapter 2904 - We’re the Champions!","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was intrigued when Jun Linyuan headed for the stage.","What was he doing?","When she looked at Jun Linyuan in confusion, the crown prince felt rather shy. He raised his chin and wouldn’t meet Feng Wu’s eyes.","He liked her, but he wasn’t going to let her see it.","Those who had a secret crush on someone would understand, but not Feng Wu.","She sighed inwardly when she saw his expression.","She thought, “He’s not going to give me trouble again, is he?”","Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu stood side by side.","They looked as pretty as a picture from all angles.","Their heights matched well.","They were equally beautiful and elegant.","...","Neither would be able to find anyone else that could match their beauty.","They belonged to each other.","There was no other choice.","Their beauty took everybody’s breaths away.","“They...”","“They look so...”","“They have to be a couple! I won’t accept anything else!”","“That’s right! We’re ready for a beautiful love story!”","The audience was already making up stories for Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan and choosing names for their babies.","They had forgotten that this was still a competition.","The award was supposed to be handed out.","Feng Wu frowned a little.","What were these people talking about?","Didn’t they know what Jun Linyuan was like?","If they didn’t stop now, Jun Linyuan would destroy everything on the stage.","She wasn’t alone in her thoughts.","Gongshu Hongzhu and Chu Yun felt the same way.","So did Sheng Changtian and his teammates.","They felt no one could defile the crown prince like this and was sure he was going to be furious.","Hadn’t Feng Wu enjoyed enough of her five minutes of glory?","Those people couldn’t wait to see the crown prince lose his temper.","With the crown prince’s sharp ears, he could obviously hear all the discussion.","However, he just stood there and let people talk without saying anything to Feng Wu.","Only Feng knew what he was thinking, but there was nothing the old man could do.","How frustrating!","Feng Wu felt rather embarrassed.","So, she urged Jun Linyuan, “Your Royal Highness? Your Royal Highness? Shouldn’t you announce the result now?”","Why was he just standing there?","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and didn’t seem too pleased.","Feng Wu wondered what she had done.","The crown prince rolled his eyes, but he had to announce the result.","“Dynasty Team has won the competition.”","“Wow!!!”","Finally!","The Dynasty Team members were over the moon.","They jumped and cheered in excitement, and many people even burst into tears.","They had waited for this victory for too long.","They looked at one another in disbelief.","Their team had won, but they hadn’t fought a single battle themselves.","“We won! We won!”","“Feng Wu made it possible! She defeated all five opponents!”","Their happy voices filled the air."]},{"number":2905,"title":"Chapter 2905 - Aren’t You a Know-It-All?","paragraphs":["The crown prince seemed more relaxed when he saw how thrilled the students were.","When they were done celebrating, Jun Linyuan cleared his throat.","Immediately, everybody quieted down.","The teenagers that had been screaming and crying at the top of their lungs returned to their seats and sat down properly, waiting for the crown prince’s instruction.","“Ahem.” Jun Linyuan turned around to face Feng Wu.","Standing together, they looked as pretty as a picture.","Many girls almost couldn’t control their impulse to scream.","Feng urged the crown prince in his head, “Just say it!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say a word.","Feng almost couldn’t stand it anymore.","Feng Wu looked curiously at Jun Linyuan. “Well...”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’ve been working hard for the past five years, and today is the day you shine. You did a great job, Feng Wu.”","He then patted her on the shoulder as if he was her senior.","Feng Wu said, “Why are you so serious all of a sudden?”","It made her want to blush...","Feng was almost in tears.? Your Royal Highness, do you want to get married and have babies? Stop stalling!","I’m not being snobbish, but she has the Divine Phoenix Blood!","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu, thinking,? Be grateful! So many people can’t even get me to look at them. You should be celebrating now!","Feng Wu was speechless.","She saw that Jun Linyuan was getting at something, but he wouldn’t get to the point.","So, she asked directly, “Do you have something to say to me?”","The crown prince froze like a cat whose tail had been stepped on, and his earlobes turned pink.","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","She wondered if the crown prince was in love with her and wanted to tell her that.","Was her battle so amazing that even Jun Linyuan was impressed?","Feng Wu said, “Are you in love...”","“In your dreams!” Jun Linyuan rapped her forehead with his knuckle. He was so exasperated that he used a little too much force, and Feng Wu was almost in tears.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She decided she had the wrong idea. Obviously, the crown prince would never be in love with her!","She dismissed the idea in her head.","However, she didn’t think Jun Linyuan would be dumb enough to fall for Zuo Qingluan.","Wait. Zuo Qingluan! The True Phoenix Blood!","Feng Wu looked in Zuo Qingluan’s direction, and her pupils contracted.","“Where’s Zuo Qingluan?” Feng Wu turned to Jun Linyuan and asked in an interrogative tone. “She has to pay for what she did to me! Where is she?”","When Jun Linyuan showed up, Feng Wu couldn’t help but look at him.","He was like the sun. When he was around, everything else disappeared.","Jun Linyuan shook his head innocently. How would he know where Zuo Qingluan was? That woman didn’t deserve his attention at all.","Feng Wu stomped her foot. “I wouldn’t be so angry if she only lent her True Phoenix Blood to Sheng Changtian, but we saw that Shadow Phoenix in the Secret Essence Mine earlier!","“If that Shadow Phoenix has something to do with the collapse, so does Zuo Qingluan!”","She glared at Jun Linyuan. “You’re the chief referee. Why didn’t you keep an eye on her? How could you let her escape? Aren’t you supposed to be a know-it-all?!”","Ssss —"]},{"number":2906,"title":"Chapter 2906 - My Eyes Were on You","paragraphs":["So many people were watching them.","There were the referees and the students and teachers from both schools.","They were shocked when they heard what Feng Wu said.","They knew Zuo Qingluan had been working with Sheng Changtian, but could she have something to do with the collapsed Secret Essence Mine?","They had yet to recover from the shock when they heard Feng Wu interrogate the crown prince.","They thought their hearts had stopped.","Interrogate the crown prince?!","Had Feng Wu lost her mind? Did she forget who she was after winning the competition?","Didn’t she know who she was talking to?","How could she scold His Royal Highness?","He was like God!","The crown prince lost his temper when he heard what Feng Wu said.","Feng Wu rested her hands on her waist and shouted, “Answer me! How could you let Zuo Qingluan escape? Why didn’t you keep an eye on her?”","Jun LInyuan said angrily, “I was too busy watching you!”","Feng Wu said, “Why did you look at me?!”","Jun Linyuan bellowed, “You’re so pretty! Where else am I supposed to look?!”","Feng Wu took a deep breath and was about to shout back when she realized something.","Why was everybody so quiet?","She looked around.","The referees, members of the two teams, and the audience were all watching them in astonishment.","These people were so blown away that they didn’t know where they were.","They were in a trance-like state.","Feng Wu finally realized what she and Jun Linyuan had blurted out.","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Was it too late to explain now?","Feng Wu turned to Jun Linyuan for help.","The crown prince also realized what he had done.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","But his ears had turned pink.","Feng Wu said, “Well, don’t worry about it. Zuo Qingluan couldn’t have gone very far. She has to be in the city, right?”","She tried to resolve the embarrassing situation.","However, the crown prince only gave her a dirty look and walked off the stage.","Feng Wu said, “Wait! Your Royal Highness! Your Royal Highness!”","What would other people say about her now?","She wanted to stop the crown prince, but Jun Linyuan walked so fast that he was soon out of sight.","Feng wanted to cry.","He prayed in his head, hoping the silly young couple would be struck by lightning.","With Jun Linyuan gone, Feng Xun couldn’t stay either.","Although he knew Boss Jun had only just bickered with Feng Wu and wasn’t really mad, Boss Jun, he and Xuan Yi usually went everywhere together, so they couldn’t let Jun Linyuan leave on his own.","Feng Wu and Xuan Yi waved at Feng Wu and followed the crown prince out.","Feng Wu was speechless.","What else could she say?","She couldn’t understand why the decisive crown prince could be so childishly grumpy.","Actually, it wasn’t a surprise. Things had always been like this...","Gosh..."]},{"number":2907,"title":"Chapter 2907 - Show Off (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was dumbfounded. She had no idea how long Jun Linyuan would stay angry.","Gongshu Hongzhu and Chu Yun also left after that.","Sheng Changtian and his team members followed suit.","They didn’t want to get caught because it would be so embarrassing.","However —","Their escape plan failed.","Students of Imperial College stopped them at the gate.","“You can’t leave yet.” Chen Ziyun led the others and blocked the way.","The people behind him still looked dazed because of the astonishing conversation they had just heard.","“We lost the competition. What more do you want?” Sheng Changtian bellowed.","He was so frustrated.","Not only did his team lose the competition, his teammates were all badly wounded.","Imperial College had won, and their players didn’t have a scratch on them.","“Nothing. We just want to show you to our principal’s office. We need to talk about what happened today.” Chen Ziyun chuckled.","He knew Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t get away.","The crown prince was very angry now and would need to vent that anger somewhere.","Sheng Changtian and his team didn’t want to go to the principal’s office, but the teachers and students of Imperial College didn’t give them any choice.","Students of the Military Academy didn’t know what to think of Feng Wu.","When the crown prince went up the stage, they wanted to accuse Feng Wu of stealing the spotlight.","When Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu stood together, they thought Feng Wu was the evil woman who wanted to seduce the crown prince.","However...","When they saw their interactions on stage, those who had been in a relationship before immediately saw what was going on. Even those who had never had a boyfriend or girlfriend were impressed.","Only a blind man wouldn’t be able to see what was happening.","Students of the Military Academy hated Feng Wu, but they knew the crown prince was in love with her, so they didn’t dare offend her. However, they couldn’t bring themselves to fawn on her either.","How annoying!","Out of sight, out of mind. The Military Academy students ran off as fast as they could.","Chen Ziyun didn’t try to stop them. He enjoyed seeing how defeated these people looked. It was a hilarious contrast to their arrogant demeanor last year.","The Imperial College students considered Feng Wu the brightest star in the school.","“She’s from our school!”","“She’s an Imperial College student!”","“I feel so proud to be in the same school as her!”","“She was in Class E when she first came here, and that was only a few months before.”","They kept looking back at Feng Wu when they left because they didn’t want to part from such beauty.","Ye Han was in a daze.","She had been defeated multiple times.","However, she had only lost to Feng Wu in terms of cultivation achievements until now, which was why she could still fight back before.","What she had just witnessed shattered all her hopes.","She felt she didn’t deserve to be Feng Wu’s opponent.","Everything she had done so far seemed so childish and ridiculous."]},{"number":2908,"title":"Chapter 2908 - Show Off (2)","paragraphs":["If Shan Jingfei saw this...","“Better that she didn’t. If she did, she would probably lose all hope,” thought Ye Han.","Chaoge was so happy as she led the other girls toward Feng Wu.","“Let’s go.” She tugged at Ye Han’s sleeve.","Ye Han usually would be the first to criticize Feng Wu, but she had the highest respect for that girl now.","She walked a few steps behind Duan Chaoge and watched Chaoge hug Feng Wu. Feeling so inferior, she didn’t dare move closer.","Feng Wu looked at her in bewilderment.","Why did Ye Han look so humble?","“Ye Han, what’s the matter?” Feng Wu asked. “Do you not feel well?”","Ye Han was almost in tears.","She was horrible to Feng Wu, but Feng Wu didn’t hold any grudge against her. Feng Wu had such a superior status, but she still treated everybody like her equal. Ye Han decided Feng Wu, instead of Zuo Qingluan, was the one she should support.","“Feng Wu, I’m on your side!” Ye Han waved at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was confused. “What?’","Ye Han said, “I’ll place my bet on you and His Royal Highness! Please kick Zuo Qingluan’s ass!”","Feng Wu’s mouth fell open.","Before she could say anything, Ye Han blushed and ran off, feeling so embarrassed for having expressed her admiration for her idol.","Feng Wu said, “Hey! Stop!”","But Ye Han had already run out of sight.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She tried to explain to the others, “There’s nothing between Jun Linyuan and me! Please believe me!”","Chen Ziyun patted her on the shoulder. “Xiao Wu, don’t. You’ll only sound like you’re trying to cover something up.”","Sun Yu said, “Xiao Wu, we’ll think you’re making up stories.”","Chu Qu said, “Xiao Wu, please go on. We don’t mind your stories.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Although she was secretly pleased to be associated with Jun Linyuan, she would insist that she only had the tiniest bit of feeling for him.","It was so complicated that she would rather throw some punches.","She still had to take revenge. She didn’t have time for puppy love!","Her mission was to revive her beautiful master.","Feng Wu said, “I don’t care what you say. I’m not going to admit it!”","Not everybody was happy after the competition.","Imperial College won a generous award, and Military Academy almost lost everything.","The Military Academy wanted to keep it a secret, but Imperial College wouldn’t let that happen.","Therefore, they started telling everybody about it.","They even spread the news inside Military Academy and to people outside the campus.","The news wouldn’t have spread so fast if it was only a battle between the two schools.","However, the Divine Phoenix Blood was involved.","What an exciting piece of news!","Before long, all the major families heard about Feng Wu’s Divine Phoenix Blood.","The imperial palace was no exception.","Who were the main players in the empire?","There were nine families, four forces, and two schools.","As soon as they learned the news, they were all blown away!"]},{"number":2909,"title":"Chapter 2909 - Show Off (3)","paragraphs":["The nine families were the families of Gongshu, Dugu, Zuo, Fang, Long, Hua, Gongsun, Xuanyuan, and Tao.","Feng Wu had dealt with most of them. Some were her friends, and some were her enemies.","The four forces were Firmament Palace, the Sumeru Temple, the Shadowless Sect, and the Beggars’ Gang.","They each had their own territory in the empire, but they all had a branch in the imperial capital.","When the news spread in the capital city, it was soon delivered to the other corners of the empire, as if it had grown wings.","The common folk were only amazed at the existence of the Divine Phoenix Blood, and they went about their own business after that.","That wasn’t the case with the major families and forces.","They were influential players for a reason.","Most of their backgrounds went back thousands of years.","Their favorite thing was to keep valuable information to themselves and only share it within their inner circles.","The Divine Phoenix Blood was one such example.","The common folk were just amazed for a while, but the major forces knew something scarier.","Back then, the ruler of the continent was the honorable Master Mu.","He had the Divine Phoenix Blood.","They had just found out that Feng Wu had the same bloodline. That meant Feng Wu would have an unbelievable future.","Even if she didn’t achieve great things, her offspring would be more than likely to have the bloodline.","Holy crap!","Who wouldn’t want to marry such a girl?","There was no question about that.","No matter what kind of grudge a force might have held against Feng Wu before, their first reaction now was to send her a marriage proposal.","Feng Wu had no idea of her impact on most of the influential forces in the empire.","She also had no idea that people all over the empire were going to send her the most valuable gifts to win her heart.","They didn’t believe she was engaged to the crown prince, because if that were the case, the crown prince would have announced it already.","Moreover, wasn’t Zuo Qingluan, the crown prince’s fiancee?","Either way, they would send Feng Wu proposal gifts first.","No force wanted to be left behind.","...","Feng Wu didn’t know anything about that.","Because of her great contribution, Imperial College gave her a week off so that she could go home and take a break.","Gongsun Mu told Chen Ziyun after Feng Wu left, “If we don’t let her go home, no one will be there to make His Royal Highness happy. When His Royal Highness isn’t happy, he’ll probably lash out at us.”","Hence, Feng Wu returned to Feng manor.","She was shocked before she even set foot inside.","Since when did they get so many visitors? Nobody ever came to the Feng family.","Why was there red silk draped over the front gate?","Feng Wu saw Feng Yanfeng greeting the guests outside the front gate in a fake humble tone. “Xiao Wu isn’t half as good as you say. Divine Phoenix Blood? There’s nothing special about that. It’s only slightly better than True Phoenix Blood.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","What a familiar scene.","When she was five and still a little genius, her uncle used to do this. He might sound modest, but nothing could hide the big smile on his face.","Feng Wu shook her head.","Instead of using the front gate, she returned to Fallen Star Yard by jumping over the wall."]},{"number":2910,"title":"Chapter 2910 - Show Off (4)","paragraphs":["The white fairy stared at Fairy in astonishment.","She knew about Master Phoenix, and she knew Chu Tianxiao was Feng Wu’s third senior brother and that Master Mu was Feng Wu’s master. However, she never thought the girl would have Divine Phoenix Blood!","How could anyone be so lucky?","Was she really the Chosen One?","The white fairy gave Feng Wu an envious glance before walking away.","Feng Wu said, “White Fairy...”","The white fairy shouted without looking back, “I need a moment to calm down!”","That was how any ordinary person would react.","Feng Wu shrugged; she knew the white fairy was just having a grumpy moment, and would soon go back to normal.","The whole world seemed to have been agitated by her Divine Phoenix Blood, and Fallen Star Yard was the only safe haven.","Her beautiful mother was as innocent as ever.","Chaoge still trusted her unconditionally.","Uncle Qiu and Granny Zhao were still hardworking people, and Qiuling spared no effort in her cultivation.","The imperial palace.","“What?!”","Emperor Wu almost fell off his chair when he heard the news.","Master Gao, the eunuch, nodded with a smile. “Your Majesty, the news is everywhere. They all know that Miss Feng Wu has the unique Divine Phoenix Blood!”","Emperor Wu’s eyes became frighteningly bright.","He grabbed Master Gao’s arm so hard that Master Gao thought his bones would crack.","The emperor was no longer a young man, but he moved so fast.","“What did you say? The Divine Phoenix Blood? My precious daughter-in-law has that bloodline?!","“Are you sure?!” Emperor Wu’s eyes sparkled.","Master Gao suspected that if he said no, His Majesty would break his neck.","There was a bright smile on Master Gao’s face.","“Your Majesty, of course I’m sure. The crown prince’s future wife has the Divine Phoenix Blood. Imagine how bright their children will be.” Master Gao chuckled.","Emperor Wu jumped to his feet.","He put his hands behind his back and paced around in the spacious study.","The Divine Phoenix Blood?","For real?","My family is so blessed!","Is it true? Can it be a lie? ?thought the emperor.","“Summon the crown prince!","“Find people who watched the competition. I want people from both schools!” Emperor Wu rubbed his hands and took a deep breath as he tried to calm his pounding heart.","Ordinary people thought the Divine Phoenix Blood was just a more impressive bloodline than the True Phoenix Blood.","The influential forces knew Master Mu had that bloodline.","Only the imperial family knew the secret of that bloodline.","OMG!","Emperor Wu was so excited.","People from both schools arrived before the crown prince did.","Emperor Wu talked to them in person.","From their statements, Emperor Wu was almost certain that his daughter-in-law indeed had the Divine Phoenix Blood."]},{"number":2911,"title":"Chapter 2911 - Marry Her","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu was so happy that he didn’t think about what the people he summoned would think.","Gongsun Mu was obviously happy for Feng Wu, but the Military Academy wasn’t so happy.","Gongshu Hongzhu felt uneasy.","He said, “His Majesty seemed happy.”","Chu Yun said, “Happy? Try over the moon!”","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “I offended Feng Wu before.”","Chu Yun said, “So did I.”","They looked at each other and wanted to cry.","“What have we done?”","Nobody cared about Zuo Qingluan right now.","After getting the evidence he wanted, Emperor Wu was more thrilled than when Jun Linyuan was born.","“Where is the crown prince? Why hasn’t he arrived?” Emperor Wu was tired of waiting.","Master Gao arrived, panting. “Your Majesty...”","He had run as fast as he could.","“Where’s Jun Linyuan? Where’s that brat?” Emperor Wu’s face darkened.","Master Gao said, “His Royal Highness said he’s not coming.”","Emperor Wu’s eyes widened. “Does he want to get married or not?!”","Master Gao said, “Well, I think I know the reason.”","He told the truth. “His Royal Highness was displeased as soon as I mentioned Miss Feng Wu. According to Feng, His Royal Highness quarreled with Miss Feng Wu.”","Emperor Wu was exasperated.","He pointed at Master Gao with a shaking finger. “How can he quarrel with her now? Is he stupid? Do you know how urgent things are?”","Emperor Wu felt like he couldn’t breathe.","Master Gao patted him on the back to help him take deep breaths.","Emperor Wu was so flustered.","“Does that brat know what the Divine Phoenix Blood means?","“Has he realized that other forces will know too?","“Does he know how many people will want to marry her?!","“How can he be in a bad mood? He doesn’t have that right!”","Emperor Wu paced around in the study. “Get him here! I don’t care if you have to tie him up! I’m issuing an imperial edict. I’m going to make their engagement official!”","Although the engagement had always existed, it had been kept a secret. He was going to make it public now.","Everybody would know it!","Master Gao frowned. “Your Majesty, His Royal Highness says if you announce the engagement, he’ll break it off.”","What?!","Emperor Wu almost fainted.","That brat used to nag him about marrying the girl into the imperial family. What was he doing now?","Master Gao said, “Your Majesty, you know the way His Royal Highness is. Maybe he has his own plan.”","Emperor Wu had to breathe deeply to curb the impulse to slap Jun Linyuan.","“That idiot! I promise you that all nine families and four forces have sent out messengers, and they’re headed for the capital as we speak!”","Master Gao said, “Your Majesty, no one in the younger generation is as excellent as His Royal Highness.”","Emperor Wu said, “What about the older generation?”"]},{"number":2912,"title":"Chapter 2912 - Tease","paragraphs":["Master Gao said, “What?”","Emperor Wu said, “Those families don’t just have outstanding younger members. Some of the middle-aged members are equally impressive! What if Feng Wu prefers a mature man? What should we do?”","Master Gao said, “What?”","Emperor Wu said, “Forget it. You won’t understand.”","He left the room, looking for someone that he could talk to.","“Who should I go to?","“Empress Dugu, then. She’s the most considerate person.","“She used to have some disagreements with Feng Wu, but she’s been saying many good things about that girl. She must like Feng Wu a lot now.”","So, Emperor Wu went to see Empress Dugu.","Empress Dugu was quite happy recently, probably because Feng Wu hadn’t been around to upset her.","However —","“Divine Phoenix Blood?” Empress Dugu ground her teeth, feeling as sick as if she had swallowed a fly.","“Yes, the Divine Phoenix Blood! Isn’t it great? She’s our daughter-in-law!” Emperor Wu said proudly.","Empress Dugu thought, “Go away! I don’t want that daughter-in-law!”","Seeing Empress Dugu’s frozen smile, Emperor Wu frowned. “Didn’t you say you’ve reconciled with Xiao Wu? You said you did something you weren’t proud of, too. I thought you liked that girl.”","Empress Dugu didn’t know what to say.","Like that girl?","When Feng Wu joined Imperial College, Empress Dugu thought she wouldn’t be back for a few years. That was why Empress Dugu played the good wife and said those things.","But now, she could only scream in her head. When talking to her husband, she had to fake a smile and pretend to be the good wife that she was supposed to be.","“That’s great news. What a lovely girl.” Empress Dugu’s smile looked more like a grimace.","Emperor Wu should have noticed it, but he was too absorbed in having such an amazing daughter-in-law that he failed to discern the empress’s emotions.","He feigned a modest tone. “Don’t say that. Our Xiao Wu is only slightly better than your niece.”","Empress Dugu wanted to roll her eyes.? If you weren’t smiling so broadly, I would actually believe you!","Although she knew Emperor Wu was showing off to her and complimenting Feng Wu by belittling Zuo Qingluan, she still had to agree with everything he said.","Empress Dugu felt as if she was being slapped repeatedly.","She decided she would never forgive Feng Wu.","Was Emperor Wu going to stop when he saw Empress Dugu’s expression?","No.","Emperor Wu wasn’t a considerate person.","He smiled at Empress Dugu. “My mother has been in poor health recently. Come with me. Let’s tell her the good news. Maybe she’ll feel much better.”","Empress Dugu was almost in tears and gave Emperor Wu a pleading look.","Emperor Wu found it suspicious. “You don’t look happy. Do you still have objections about Feng Wu?”"]},{"number":2913,"title":"Chapter 2913 - Precious Teenage Girl","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu found it suspicious. “You don’t look happy. Do you still have objections about Feng Wu?”","“No!” Of course Empress Dugu couldn’t admit her jealousy. That would mean she had been telling lies until now.","The emperor could allow mistakes, but he wouldn’t tolerate lies.","She put on the most professional smile. “Your Majesty, I’ll come with you.”","The empress dowager resided in Cining Palace.","She hadn’t been feeling well these days and had been spending most of her time in bed.","Granny Lan asked gently, “Your Majesty, shall we summon Miss Feng Wu to have a look?”","The empress dowager darted a stern look at her.","Granny Lan was on Feng Wu’s team, but she wasn’t the empress dowager’s only maid.","Granny Zhu moved closer and said, “Firmament Palace has great doctors, and Miss Zuo Qingluan is their sacred lady. I’m sure she’s wonderful.”","The empress dowager didn’t say yes, but she didn’t say no either.","Of course, she knew what Zuo Qingluan could do.","She used to like the girl, but the girl seemed to have her secret agenda, so the old lady didn’t like her that much anymore.","Seeing that the empress dowager didn’t say no, Granny Zhu moved closer and whispered, “Not only is Miss Zuo Qingluan a great doctor, she’s also very pretty. Most importantly, she’s the only one with True Phoenix Blood in our empire.”","Granny Lan frowned. “With the True Phoenix Blood, she’s indeed more efficient in her cultivation, but...”","The empress dowager favored Granny Zhu recently, so Granny Zhu glanced at Granny Lan and went on, “Your Majesty, you’ve been lying in bed all the time. I don’t think there’s anything wrong with your health. I think you just have nothing to do.”","The empress dowager’s face darkened. What was she supposed to be doing then?","Granny Zhu said, “Your Majesty, if His Royal Highness gets married and has a baby, you can watch the baby running around in the palace. Cining Palace will be so much more lively!”","The empress dowager was persuaded.","That was so true!","Baby Jun had been the most amazing boy. He was so handsome and so smart that the most arrogant elders had to recognize his capability!","If he had a baby...","The empress dowager said, “Only the most beautiful and precious girl can have Baby Jun’s child!”","Granny Zhu smiled. “Of course. Your Majesty, His Royal Highness already has an excellent bloodline. If the mother also has an outstanding one, it’ll be a perfect match!”","The empress dowager’s eyes lit up.","Granny Lan lowered her head and smiled wryly.","Everything Granny Zhu said was to bring up Zuo Qingluan and her True Phoenix Blood.","Granny Lan felt sorry for Feng Wu. She would be perfect if she hadn’t lost her True Phoenix Blood. What a pity.","Granny Zhu took the empress dowager’s hand. “Your Majesty, which girl in the Junwu Empire do you think has the most precious bloodline?”"]},{"number":2914,"title":"Chapter 2914 - Find Baby Jun a Divine Phoenix Blood Wife","paragraphs":["The girl with the most precious bloodline?","The first name that popped into the empress dowager’s head was Feng Wu.","Deep down, she was convinced by Feng Wu’s medical skills, but she didn’t want to admit it.","Moreover, she didn’t like Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan being close to each other, which was why she was hostile toward the girl.","The second name was Zuo Qingluan.","The empress dowager frowned. “Are you referring to Zuo...”","“Yes, Your Majesty! It’s Miss Zuo Qingluan! She has the True Phoenix Blood, which makes her the girl with the most precious bloodline!” The Zuo family must have paid Granny Zhu generously. She sang Zuo Qingluan’s praises whenever she could, trying to make Zuo Qingluan the perfect candidate.","“Zuo Qingluan, is it?” The empress dowager knew Zuo Qingluan had the True Phoenix Blood.","She also knew how rare and outstanding that bloodline was, but she still felt something was missing.","“Your Majesty, do you not like her?” Granny Zhu asked tentatively.","The empress dowager frowned and spoke her mind. “There’s nothing wrong with Zuo Qingluan, but I just feel...”","She pictured Zuo Qingluan standing by Jun Linyuan’s side, and something didn’t feel right.","“Something’s still lacking.” She shook her head.","Granny Zhu panicked a little. “What’s lacking?”","The empress dowager shook her head. “I don’t know, but Zuo Qingluan isn’t good enough for Baby Jun!”","Granny Zhu smiled wryly. “Your Majesty, His Royal Highness is unique. Yes, the True Phoenix Blood isn’t good enough. Only the Divine Phoenix Blood is.”","The empress dowager’s eyes lit up. “Divine Phoenix Blood? Are you saying a girl has that bloodline? Where is she?”","Granny Zhu said, “Your Majesty...”","The empress dowager no longer felt sick.","She said, “I know why I don’t like Zuo Qingluan. I know what the problem is!”","What problem?","Granny Zhu and Granny Lan looked at the empress dowager.","Meanwhile —","They heard footsteps outside.","“His Majesty the emperor and Her Majesty the empress are here!”","The empress dowager looked up to see Emperor Wu, who was followed by the reluctant Empress Dugu.","She immediately got out of bed.","As soon as Granny Zhu and Granny Lan helped her into her shoes, she ran toward Emperor Wu.","“You’re here!” The empress dowager looked thrilled.","“I finally figured it out!” The empress dowager held Emperor Wu’s hands in excitement. “I know what kind of girl Junjun should marry!”","She was so agitated that she was almost incoherent. “Zuo Qingluan won’t do it! She’s not good enough for Baby Jun! Listen to me.","“We must find Baby Jun a girl with the Divine Phoenix Blood!” The empress dowager clutched Emperor Wu’s hands. “Do you hear me? She has to have the Divine Phoenix Blood!","“Only the Divine Phoenix Blood is good enough for Baby Jun!","“Anything else would be an insult!","“Do you hear me? Answer me!”","The empress dowager was perplexed when she saw the strange look in her son’s eyes."]},{"number":2915,"title":"Chapter 2915 - It’s Feng Wu","paragraphs":["The empress dowager was perplexed when she saw the strange look in her son’s eyes.","Emperor Wu felt conflicted.","The empress dowager had been doing everything in her power to sabotage the marriage. If she knew what she was doing...","Emperor Wu wanted to laugh.","He wanted to tease the old lady.","He knew the answer, but he wouldn’t tell her.","Instead, he said, “Mother, the Divine Phoenix Blood is so hard to come by.”","The empress dowager glared at him and snorted. “I’ve made up my mind. Only the Divine Phoenix Blood is good enough for Junjun!”","Emperor Wu said, “Well, we do have True Phoenix Blood.”","The empress dowager said, “No, that’s not good enough.”","She glared at Emperor Wu. “Why won’t you give me a straight answer? Have you forgotten that Junjun is your son? He has to marry a girl with the Divine Phoenix Blood! There’s no other option!”","Behind Emperor Wu, Empress Dugu looked upward, trying to ignore the conversation.","She wished she couldn’t hear anything.","Emperor Wu fought back his urge to laugh. He held his mother’s hands and led her toward the bed. “Mother, if that’s your request, there’s only one candidate.”","“There is one?!” The empress dowager stared at Emperor Wu in disbelief.","Emperor Wu said, “Yes.”","The empress dowager asked, “Where is she? Which family is she from? Why are you still here? Send her a marriage proposal!”","Emperor Wu cleared his throat.","The empress dowager frowned. “Answer my question! How old is she? Is she too young?”","Emperor Wu stopped his mother before she let her imagination run wild.","“She’s here in the Junwu Empire, and she’s 14,” Emperor Wu announced.","“Nonsense!” The empress dowager threw off Emperor Wu’s hands and sat down on the bed. “Stop teasing me!”","Emperor Wu chuckled. “Don’t you believe me?”","The empress dowager said, “No.”","Emperor Wu said, “I’ll let the empress tell you who the girl is.”","Empress Dugu wished she was somewhere else.","Emperor Wu glanced at Empress Dugu. “Tell my mother who the girl is.”","Empress Dugu felt so frustrated.","The empress dowager said, “I don’t want her niece! Not in a million years!”","Empress Dugu felt even more frustrated.","Emperor Wu smiled proudly.","“Dugu, tell my mother who has the most precious bloodline.”","It was like asking Empress Dugu to slap herself.","She decided to get it over with.","She took a deep breath and said that name.","“Feng Wu!”","She was so loud that it almost made the empress dowager jump.","Huh?","She didn’t catch the name. “What Wu?”","Emperor Wu laughed. “Mother, she said Feng Wu!”"]},{"number":2916,"title":"Chapter 2916 - How Dare They?","paragraphs":["It was Feng Wu!","Emperor Wu couldn’t feel any happier when he said those words.","He successfully shocked his mother.","She turned around and stared at Emperor Wu.","It took her a while to find her voice. “What did you say?”","Emperor Wu laughed. “Mother, didn’t you say you want Junjun to marry a girl with the most precious bloodline? You don’t need to search anymore. She’s right over there at Feng manor.”","The empress dowager rolled her eyes at Emperor Wu. “I don’t believe you!”","Emperor Wu said, “You don’t have a choice now.","“Feng Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood, which is what you were asking for.”","The empress dowager wouldn’t believe it.","She asked for the Divine Phoenix Blood, and her son immediately found it for her.","“I’ll never believe it!” The empress dowager snorted.","Emperor Wu said, “Mother, it doesn’t matter. Everybody else believes it because it’s the truth.”","The empress dowager glared at him.","She didn’t believe it at first, but both the emperor and the empress had said so, and the empress dowager felt uneasy. She told Granny Zhu and Granny Lan, “Ask around and see what this is about!”","They were her oldest maids, so she trusted them.","She was holding on to her last bit of hope.","It was such a struggle.","She couldn’t imagine that Feng Wu could have the Divine Phoenix Blood.","If that was true, she would be utterly humiliated.","She turned the prayer beads in her hands and said a silent prayer.","Empress Dugu gave her a pitying look.","She wished the empress dowager would stop being in denial and end this nonsense. She was going to explode.","Granny Zhu and Granny Lan soon came back.","Granny Zhu looked very pale and seemed to have lost all hope.","Granny Lan, on the other hand, was in high spirits.","The empress dowager asked Granny Zhu first. “What have you learned? Tell me!”","Granny Zhu said, “Well...”","The empress dowager had a bad feeling and turned to Granny Lan.","Granny Lan nodded at her.","She couldn’t be any clearer.","Boom!","The empress dowager felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her mind went blank.","She pointed at Emperor Wu. “Is Feng Wu really...”","Emperor Wu nodded solemnly. “Yes, mother. Feng Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood. No one’s bloodline is as precious as hers.”","It was such a blow to the old lady.","The girl had the most precious bloodline...","The empress dowager’s lips trembled. “I need some time to think. Leave me alone now!”","Emperor Wu paused after taking a few steps. “Mother, I received news that most of the nine families and four forces are interested in the Divine Phoenix Blood. They’re all coming to the imperial capital with their marriage proposal gifts. You won’t have much time to think.”","The empress dowager shouted, “How dare they?!”"]},{"number":2917,"title":"Chapter 2917 - The Crown Prince","paragraphs":["The Zuo family.","Everything was fine at first when Zuo Qingluan returned home.","However, when news of Feng Wu’s Divine Phoenix Blood spread, she sensed the change in people’s attitudes.","From her parents and uncles to the older generations and the servants, everybody was giving her looks which reminded her of how things had been like five years ago.","“Why is Feng Wu better than you in everything?","“You both have the True Phoenix Blood. Why aren’t you as good as she is?","“Why can she learn everything in an instant? Why are you so stupid?!","“Why...”","The memory nearly gave Zuo Qingluan a nervous breakdown.","She couldn’t stand those words five years ago, and now that she had risen so high, she tolerated them even less.","It was worse than being cut repeatedly with a blunt knife.","The first person she went to see was her grandfather, and she would never forget the look he gave her.","He couldn’t have seemed more disappointed. “Leave. I don’t want to see you again.”","Did he give up on her because she didn’t have the Divine Phoenix Blood?","She couldn’t accept it.","“Feng Wu, I hate you!”","Zuo Qingluan smashed everything in her place, but that still wasn’t enough. She wanted to tear down all the walls.","She couldn’t be bothered to set up a barrier this time, so everybody could hear the noise of her kicking and throwing things around.","Many servants were so scared that they stopped what they were doing and looked at Zuo Qingluan’s courtyard.","Right now, Zuo Qingluan was lashing out at the jade pendant.","She believed Shadow Phoenix was responsible for her defeat.","“How could you do that to me?","“Are you my Shadow Phoenix or not?","“How could you betray me at the last minute?!","“She doesn’t even have the True Phoenix Blood!","“Her Divine Phoenix Blood must be fake!","“You bastard! You betrayed me!”","Zuo Qingluan smashed the pendant on the ground.","The pendant cracked, and the Shadow Phoenix emerged. It glared at Zuo Qingluan and wanted to swallow her whole.","Its eyes were bloodshot red.","There were flames in its eyes!","Zuo Qingluan was intimidated. It seemed she had offended the bird.","Shadow Phoenix didn’t show Zuo Qingluan any respect. “What did you say? Her blood is better than yours, and it’s somehow my fault?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Shadow Phoenix said, “I’ve put up with you for so long! Everybody thinks you’re this perfect girl, but you’re horrible when the door is closed! You’re so fake!”","Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded. She didn’t know Shadow Phoenix could be so mean.","Shadow Phoenix went on. “I can’t stand your worthless blood anymore! Don’t bother me again! I don’t want your True Phoenix Blood!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","She was so proud of her True Phoenix Blood, but Shadow Phoenix made it sound like it was nothing!","Just then, she heard some noise outside.","“His Royal Highness is here!”","“OMG! Why is His Royal Highness here?”","“Is the rumor true? Is he really in love with Miss Qingluan?”"]},{"number":2918,"title":"Chapter 2918 - Threat","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan’s fans all believed the rumor that Jun Linyuan was madly in love with her.","The rumor came from Zuo Qingluan herself.","She had been furious when she heard, “Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world, and Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land.” She waited and waited, but nobody wrote similar things for her, so she had to come up with something on her own.","“Qingluan’s heart belongs to Jun Linyuan.” That was what the fans said.","Of course, only Zuo Qingluan and Tongque, her chambermaid, knew where that had come from.","Hearing Jun Linyuan’s name, Shadow Phoenix immediately ran back to the pendant and hid inside.","“You can’t see me. You can’t see me...”","His Royal Highness?","Zuo Qingluan was intrigued.","Is he here to comfort me after seeing what Feng Wu did to me?","Zuo Qingluan was exasperated when she saw the mess she had made.","Jun Linyuan arrived before she could clean up.","He stood in front of Zuo Qingluan like a heavenly god.","He was tall, handsome and irresistibly charming. However, his eyes were cold.","The temperature around him seemed to drop.","The energy emanating from him was terrifying.","He was invincible!","Anybody would see him as a god!","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t keep her eyes off him.","He was the man of her dreams.","She would sell her soul to the devil to have him.","That was how much she loved him.","The next second, Jun Linyuan’s sword was at her throat.","The tip of the blade was millimeters away from her skin.","The blade was so sharp that it cut her loose hair when the wind blew.","Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded.","She had never imagined meeting Jun Linyuan like this.","She was madly in love with him; how could he treat her like this?","“Your Royal Highness...”","Zuo Qingluan’s parents arrived at that moment and were shocked to see what was going on.","It took away what little hope they had.","They had hoped that the Zuo family would rise again because of the crown prince’s love for Zuo Qingluan.","However, the crown prince was so angry that he wanted to kill their daughter.","“Your Royal Highness, what’s going on? What did I do?”","Zuo Qingluan’s voice shook.","She had always been an elegant and unapproachable girl, but she was a mess now.","She cried so hard that the front of her dress was wet.","Something was falling apart inside her.","It was too painful to breathe.","“Your Royal Highness, why are you doing this? Why are you pointing your sword at me?” Zuo Qingluan was confused. “Did I do something wrong?”","Jun Linyuan frowned.","A woman’s tears would only work on the man who cared for her.","He couldn’t care less if Zuo Qingluan cried her eyes out.","He cut to the chase. “You wanted to kill her.”","Her? Who was he referring to?","Zuo Qingluan’s parents might not know the answer, but she did.","The crown prince was talking about Feng Wu, the girl she hated the most.","Zuo Qingluan finally realized something."]},{"number":2919,"title":"Chapter 2919 - He Doesn’t Kill Women","paragraphs":["Shadow Phoenix cringed when it heard the conversation and buried its head deeper into its wings.","It prayed that the scary crown prince didn’t know what it had done.","Zuo Qingluan looked into Jun Linyuan’s eyes and wept. She was heartbroken.","“Do you want to kill me because of her? How could you...” She looked like she was going to fall apart.","Jun Linyuan found her reaction idiotic.","Her tone only made him angrier.","Zuo Qingluan’s father was very anxious.","Although his daughter didn’t have the Divine Phoenix Blood, her True Phoenix Blood could still be useful.","He said, “Your Royal Highness, if you want to kill someone, you can kill me. Qingluan is just a child. Please don’t let this incident damage your love.”","Their love? The crown prince’s face darkened.","He hadn’t said anything, but it didn’t mean these people could treat him like an idiot.","“How dare you harm my woman. Do you think I’m blind?”","What a statement!","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were sitting on the wall. Hearing this, they smiled in satisfaction and clapped their hands.","Finally! They had been waiting for this moment for so long!","It was a pity that Feng Wu wasn’t here, but this was good enough.","While they were thrilled, it was the worst news the Zuos had heard in their life.","Those words meant that Jun Linyuan had nothing to do with Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan’s parents immediately looked at her.","Wait!","Didn’t Zuo Qingluan say the crown prince was so in love with her that he wouldn’t marry anybody else?","What the crown prince just said was completely different.","What was going on?","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t care how anybody else looked at her now. Filled with sorrow, she asked Jun Linyuan, “How can you do this to me? Jun Linyuan, you’ve betrayed me!”","Blue veins popped on the crown prince’s forehead.","He wanted to kill Zuo Qingluan right now, but he never killed women.","How annoying!","Zuo Qingluan had been misleading the public for so long that even Feng Wu had misunderstood their relationship.","Therefore, the crown prince decided to solve the problem once and for all.","He grew impatient.","Of course, he wasn’t going to explain it to Zuo Qingluan.","He glanced at Feng Xun, who immediately took the hint.","Feng Xun froze a little. It turned out that he wouldn’t be allowed to just sit on the fence and watch.","Jun Linyuan had a habit of challenging people in the middle of the night.","After so many years, Feng Xun learned to react quickly.","He jumped off the wall, stood next to Jun Linyuan, and stared at Zuo Qingluan.","If Feng Wu hadn’t been born, Zuo Qingluan would have been an excellent choice.","However, she was nothing in comparison to his sister!","Feng Xun glanced at Zuo Qingluan. “Qingluan’s heart belongs to the crown prince, is it? The sacred lady of Firmament Palace is a very good writer.”","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened."]},{"number":2920,"title":"Chapter 2920 - The Truth","paragraphs":["She stared at Feng Xun. “I don’t know what you’re talking about. It’s late. Please leave. I need to rest!”","“You’ll have all the time to sleep when you die. Miss Zuo, would you like to rest now or forever?” Feng Xun asked casually.","He was doing it for her sister.","“You!” Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Xun. “What do you mean? Are you going to kill me?”","Feng Xun crossed his arms. “Zuo Qingluan, I just don’t understand. Aren’t you ashamed of all the rumors you’ve been spreading?”","Rumors?","Zuo Qingluan’s parents looked at each other, and both had a bad feeling.","Zuo Qingluan’s face turned red, but Feng Xun wasn’t going to waste this opportunity.","He pressed on.","“You spread the rumor about being in a relationship with Boss Jun.","“You said he was madly in love with you.","“You said he would marry you and no one else.","“You lied about having Boss Jun at your birthday party!","“You lied about being Boss Jun’s fiancee!”","...","Feng Xun wasn’t just saying those things off the top of his head. He had taken out a large piece of paper, and was reading the contents from top to bottom.","Zuo Qingluan felt dizzy.","She yelled at the top of her lungs, “Those aren’t rumors! It’s the truth!”","Her parents were falling apart.","Those were all rumors.","Zuo Qingluan had been lying to them all along.","Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Xun.","She hated this man.","“Where did you get that?” Even Zuo Qingluan couldn’t remember all the things she had done.","Feng Xun clapped his hands, and a person walked out of the shadows.","It was Tongque, Zuo Qingluan’s chambermaid.","She was the only maid Zuo Qingluan trusted.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Tongque in disbelief. “You betrayed me.”","Tongque bowed to Zuo Qingluan and said calmly, “Zuo Qingluan, there’s something you should understand. I wasn’t supposed to be your maid.","“I was a student at Firmament Palace, just like you. I helped you once out of kindness, but you found me useful and forced me to become your maid.”","Zuo Qingluan glared at Tongque. “That was for your own good!”","Tongque laughed. “My own good? Should I thank you for spending my life serving you?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say. She ground her teeth and said, “So, you hate me. Is that why you betrayed me?”","Tongque shook her head. “Young Lord Feng pays me better. That’s all.”","Zuo Qingluan was so angry that she couldn’t speak a word.","She suddenly thought about Feng Wu and her friends.","Would Qiuling or Chaoge betray Feng Wu in a situation like this? No, they wouldn’t.","Zuo Qingluan thought she was going to faint. She ground her teeth and kept saying, “Jun Linyuan said he would marry me! He said those words!”","Feng Xun stared at her.","“Don’t pass out just yet. Answer my question first.” Feng Xun asked curiously, “Can you tell me why you have this idea that Boss Jun likes you and will marry you?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “He said so himself!”","The crown prince wanted to kill this woman and stop her ranting.","However, Feng Xun was more patient. He felt he was getting closer to the truth."]},{"number":2921,"title":"Chapter 2921 - Stubborn Zuo Qingluan","paragraphs":["Feng Xun said, “You keep saying Boss Jun will marry you. Why don’t any of us know that?”","Zuo Qingluan snorted and looked away.","Her parents were almost in tears. They pleaded, “Young Lord Feng, please stop asking her. She’s so upset.”","Would Zuo Qingluan talk her way out of it again?","Feng Xun said, “No, I won’t stop.","“She’s spreading rumors about Boss Jun all the time, and that has affected Boss Jun’s reputation. I’m not going to stop just because you asked. You think too highly of yourself!”","After scolding Mr. and Mrs. Zuo, Feng Xun turned back to Zuo Qingluan.","“Boss Jun could have married Feng Wu a long time ago, but because of you, she still won’t believe his feelings for her. Zuo Qingluan, it’s all your fault!”","What?","Feng Wu?!","Zuo Qingluan’s parents were astonished.","Zuo Qingluan glared at Jun Linyuan. “Did Feng Wu steal you away from me?!”","Jun Linyuan lost his temper.","He didn’t like so many words. He wanted to kill someone.","Seeing Jun Linyuan clench his fists, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi immediately stopped him.","“Boss Jun, please don’t get mad. The most important thing is to get an answer.” After that, he could kill whomever he wanted.","After calming Jun Linyuan down, Feng Xun turned to Zuo Qingluan. “What makes you think Boss Jun is yours?”","“He said he would marry me!” Zuo Qingluan insisted.","Feng Xun asked, “When and where did he say that? Who else heard him?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “He said those words, and that’s the truth! He gave me a token, too!”","A token?","Feng Xun glanced at Jun Linyuan, but Jun Linyuan was utterly confused.","He couldn’t remember any tokens.","“Bullshit!” Feng Xun stared at Zuo Qingluan. “If you don’t tell me today, no one can protect you.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “What? Are you going to kill everybody?”","She was confident that they wouldn’t do that.","The Zuo family was one of the nine major families.","Right now, the head of the family was cultivating in one of the courtyards at the back. He was also Zuo Qingluan’s grandfather, and Zuo Qingluan didn’t think he would let Jun Linyuan kill her.","Feng Xun lost his temper, too. “Are you going to tell me or not?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I’m the crown prince’s woman, dead or alive!”","Jun Linyuan said, “Die, then!”","He wouldn’t show her any mercy.","“Your Royal Highness!” Mr. Zuo was scared out of his wits when he saw Jun Linyuan raise his sword.","Until today, he had considered himself the crown prince’s future father-in-law. He thought Jun Linyuan was madly in love with his daughter!","What Jun Linyuan was doing now suggested otherwise.","Mr. and Mrs. Zuo finally saw the truth.","Jun Linyuan didn’t like Zuo Qingluan at all.","He never had.","The whole thing was a rumor, which had probably come from Zuo Qingluan herself."]},{"number":2922,"title":"Chapter 2922 - Old Mr. Zuo","paragraphs":["The blow was so hard that Zuo Qingluan’s parents seemed to age 20 years in a matter of minutes.","“Boss Jun, Boss Jun...” Feng Xun and Xuan Yi stopped the furious Jun Linyuan. “Calm down. If someone has to kill her, it has to be Xiao Wu. She’ll be angry if you do it for her.”","Feng Xun knew only Feng Wu’s name would work.","He was right —","Jun Linyuan only calmed down when Feng Wu was mentioned.","Zuo Qingluan’s parents lost all hope.","What did they hear? Feng Wu?","Was the crown prince really in love with Feng Wu?","They looked from Zuo Qingluan to Jun Linyuan, and Mrs. Zuo fainted, unable to take the blow.","Mr. Zuo felt like fainting, too.","First of all, nothing was going on between the crown prince and Zuo Qingluan.","Second, the crown prince was in love with Feng Wu.","Feng Xun stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Are you sure you won’t tell me?”","Zuo Qingluan proudly held her ground and wouldn’t say a word. She believed these people couldn’t do anything to her.","She wouldn’t tell them what they wanted!","Where did she get that confidence?","Feng Xun suddenly got it. “Do you think your grandfather will help you? Zuo Qingluan, wake up. Your family is giving up on you.”","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Feng Xun in disdain.","Her parents might abandon her, but her grandfather would never do that, nor would the other senior members of the family.","She had the True Phoenix Blood.","She was a valuable asset!","Although the old man had told her not to show her face again, she decided it was only an angry outburst. She was sure her grandfather didn’t mean it.","“Your grandfather, is it?” The crown prince looked around and nodded. “You’re right. You wouldn’t have made so much trouble for me without his support. That reminds me of something.","“The Zuo family has been abusing their power in the imperial capital because you think he will always save the day for you. Good.” Jun Linyuan headed in another direction.","“Boss Jun, where are you going?” Feng Xun realized something wasn’t right.","Jun Linyuan said, “I’m going to kill someone.”","Feng Xun said, “Holy sh*t!”","That didn’t bode well, so Feng Xun and Xuan Yi ran after Jun Linyuan.","Mr. Zuo and his wife, who had just woken up, were terrified.","Jun Linyuan was heading for one of the courtyards at the back of the manor, where old Mr. Zuo lived.","Zuo Qingluan also felt uneasy.","“Let’s go!” Mr. Zuo’s voice was trembling. “Is His Royal Highness going to fight my father? Move faster!”","It only took Jun Linyuan an instant to get there.","He landed in the courtyard and pointed his sword at the old man.","Old Mr. Zuo was making tea.","With his capability, he could hear everything going on in the other courtyards.","However, he still sat here and sipped his tea, which showed how confident he was.","“Your Royal Highness, it’s been a while.” He ignored Jun Linyuan’s sword.","It was as if the crown prince was an unreasonable child.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes glinted coldly.","Old Mr. Zuo was a great cultivator.","He had made a name for himself before Jun Linyuan was born. After so many years, no one knew what his cultivation level was now."]},{"number":2923,"title":"Chapter 2923 - For Her","paragraphs":["“Sit.” The old man gestured at a chair.","The others arrived at that moment.","Mr. Zuo was relieved to see the seemingly peaceful scene.","He thought his father would solve the problem.","He threw a dirty look at Zuo Qingluan, utterly disappointed by his daughter.","Jun Linyuan didn’t sit down, and his Sky Destroyer was still pointed at the old man.","“Zuo Chengfeng, bring it on!”","The old man had an air about him, but that didn’t affect the crown prince.","Jun Linyuan had come here because he knew killing Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t be enough.","Everybody knew Feng Wu had the Divine Phoenix Blood now, and they all had their own plans.","If they couldn’t have her, they would try to destroy her. Jun Linyuan knew all the dirty tricks those forces would use.","Therefore, he came to see Zuo Chengfeng, the head of the Zuo family.","He would punish the old man as a warning to others.","Jun Linyuan hid his emotions so well that apart from Feng, no one knew what he wanted.","To Zuo Chengfeng, it was only a petty conflict over a girl. He only cared about the big picture, and this incident was nothing.","However, Jun Linyuan considered Feng Wu to be more important than his own life.","Zuo Chengfeng said casually, “Your Royal Highness, there’s no need to get angry.”","Jun Linyuan smirked. “Zuo Chengfeng, I’m challenging you!”","When he made that challenge official, the incident was no longer a laughing matter.","It was serious.","Zuo Chengfeng’s hands trembled a little and he nearly spilled his tea. He looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment. “Are you serious?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Yes.”","Zuo Chengfeng asked, “Why?”","Jun Linyuan said, “To set a precedent.”","The old man was furious.","However, he was as shrewd as he was capable, so he soon saw what Jun Linyuan meant.","He seemed to understand why Jun Linyuan was so persistent.","Zuo Chengfeng frowned. “Is it because of her?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Yes.”","He could confess his feelings for Feng Wu in front of other people, but when he was with Feng Wu, he was still a shy boy.","Zuo Chengfeng put down his teacup. He couldn’t understand it.","“Jun Linyuan, cultivators come by generations. You are the young generation, but you’re capable enough to be ranked among the middle-aged and old generations.”","Mr. Zuo, Emperor Wu, and Feng Yanfeng belonged to the middle-aged generation, but Jun Linyuan had long surpassed them.","Zuo Chengfeng asked sincerely, “There are only a handful of cultivators in the Junwu Empire that are as capable as us.","“I don’t understand. Is it worth it to have this public fallout over a girl?","Jun Linyuan said affirmatively, “I can destroy the world for her.”","Unfortunately, Jun Linyuan had never said those words to Feng Wu.","Feng Xun and the others were outside the transparent barrier. They could see what Jun Linyuan and the old man were doing, but they couldn’t hear anything the two people inside said.","What a pity. No one else would know what Jun Linyuan had just said."]},{"number":2924,"title":"Chapter 2924 - Threaten Everybody","paragraphs":["Zuo Chengfeng didn’t expect to get such an answer from Jun Linyuan.","He was dazed for a long while.","He only believed in the big picture and cared about nothing except the benefit of the family as a whole.","Personal emotions would never get in the way.","He looked at Jun Linyuan and said in a sorry tone, “Your Royal Highness, are you saying you’ll use me as an example to threaten everybody who wants to get their hands on the Divine Phoenix Blood?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t deny it.","Zuo Chengfeng smiled bitterly. “I always thought Your Royal Highness would marry Qingluan, and we would be family.”","Jun Linyuan couldn’t be bothered to listen to his bullsh*t.","Zuo Chengfeng said, “I didn’t think Your Royal Highness would go so far for a girl. I’m amazed.”","Jun Linyuan’s sword moved a little.","Although neither of them had taken a step, the space between them was filled with fierce energy.","The battle was too advanced for ordinary people to comprehend.","Zuo Qingluan had been watching Jun Linyuan and her grandfather from afar, but she didn’t know what they were talking about. Suddenly, her eyes lit up.","An idea struck her.","She finally knew what her grandfather meant.","After she suffered the defeat, she had run back home distraught, and the first person she went to see was her grandfather, who had looked at her in disappointment.","He said, “Zuo Qingluan, don’t come here again.”","Before that, he said, “Zuo Qingluan, why are you so shaken by the Divine Phoenix Blood?","“How long do you think she can have it?”","Zuo Qingluan had been too distraught to realize what that meant, but she figured it out now.","Her grandfather wasn’t disappointed because her True Phoenix Blood was inferior to Feng Wu’s bloodline. He was disappointed by her state.","She shouldn’t have lost faith or lost control of her emotions.","So what if Feng Wu had the Divine Phoenix Blood?","If they could destroy her True Phoenix Blood five years ago, they could do it again five years later.","Maybe they could find a way to plant the Divine Phoenix Blood in her body. The idea excited Zuo Qingluan/","All those snobbish people chose Feng Wu because she has the Divine Phoenix Blood. What if I have it instead?","Zuo Qingluan’s heart pounded.","The crown prince hadn’t shown much interest in Feng Wu until she revealed her Divine Phoenix Blood.","That was to say, the crown prince liked Feng Wu’s bloodline instead of her.","If I have the Divine Phoenix Blood...","The idea made her blood boil.","Meanwhile!","The two people in the courtyard were nowhere to be seen.","“Where are they? Where did they go?”","Zuo Qingluan woke up from her daydream to find the courtyard empty. The barrier was stopping them from entering.","Her father said in a shaky voice, “They’re in the sky.”","They couldn’t keep their battle on the ground.","Instead, the battle took place in the air.","“Is grandfather fighting His Royal Highness? That’s not fair. His Royal Highness is so young. How can this be a fair match?”","Zuo Qingluan was completely infatuated with Jun Linyuan.","After finding an excuse that Jun Linyuan was only interested in the Divine Phoenix Blood, she became obsessed with him even more."]},{"number":2925,"title":"Chapter 2925 - Amazing Teenager","paragraphs":["Her father gave her a stern look. “His Royal Highness may be young, but the older generations have recognized his capability. This friendly battle won’t hurt him.”","He was displeased with Jun Linyuan, too.","The crown prince charged into his home with a sword. Not only did he destroy the family’s dream, he also threatened to kill his daughter.","Zuo Ming thought the crown prince was utterly arrogant to challenge old Mr. Zuo. It was time for him to learn a lesson.","Lose?","Zuo Ming never considered that possibility.","People like his father had gone through many struggles and survived many wars.","Not many people in that generation were still alive, but their power was beyond Jun Linyuan’s reach.","Yes, the crown prince was extremely talented, but it was too early for him to defeat the old man.","“He needs a few more years,” Zuo Ming said confidently.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi looked at each other, both feeling anxious.","“That idiot!","“Why did he challenge that terrifying old man so suddenly?","“If he really wants to do that, why couldn’t he wait a few more years?!”","Everybody was waiting anxiously.","Boom!?","The sky seemed to be torn open, and a figure fell from the sky.","“Boss Jun!” Feng Xun cried out.","Thump!","The figure fell so fast that by the time they realized it, it had smashed into the ground, creating a large crater.","Dust filled the air.","It was nighttime, so no one could see very clearly.","The barrier disappeared, and people could finally enter the courtyard.","Feng Xun pushed the door open and ran toward the crater in the ground.","“Boss Jun! Boss Jun, are you alright?!”","He was about to jump into the crater, when another person slowly landed.","His black robe was spotless.","The lower hem of his robe flapped in the wind, adding to his charm.","His eyes looked like the brightest stars in the night sky.","He pointed Sky Destroyer at the crater.","There was blood on the tip of the sword.","The blood dripped on the ground and soaked into the dust.","Feng Xun stopped short.","“Boss Jun?” He was dumbfounded.","Boss Jun was alright.","Then, who was the man lying in the crater?","There was only one possibility.","Feng Xun wasn’t the only one who was astonished.","Zuo Ming and Zuo Qingluan were horrified.","They stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief.","They knew the young man was more handsome than anybody they knew, but they didn’t expect to see such a demonstration of power.","In the crater was old Mr. Zuo, the pillar of the family.","Zuo Ming’s legs gave out, and he dropped to his knees.","Zuo Qingluan froze on the spot.","Jun Linyuan had destroyed the one person she could depend on.","She didn’t know what to say, and her head went blank.","Jun Linyuan never looked at her.","He only looked at the crater and smirked. “Zuo Chengfeng, if you break the agreement, you know what’ll happen!”","He walked away after that.","When he was gone, no one made a sound.","The old man slowly crawled out of the crater."]},{"number":2926,"title":"Chapter 2926 - Zuo Chengfeng’s Compliment","paragraphs":["One side of his face was burnt black, while the other side was still normal. It was an eerie sight.","Pffft!","Zuo Chengfeng started spitting blood.","There was so much blood.","“Father!”","“Grandpa!”","Zuo Ming and Zuo Qingluan helped Zuo Chengfeng to his feet.","He was the pillar of their family. What should they do now? Zuo Qingluan panicked.","“Grandpa, what happened? Did His Royal Highness do this to you?”","She almost couldn’t bring herself to ask that question because she was afraid of the answer.","Zuo Chengfeng might have many faults, but he didn’t like lying.","He slowly sat down and nodded.","Oh god!","It really was Jun Linyuan!","Zuo Qingluan clenched her fists and couldn’t decide if she was happy or sad.","Zuo Ming was almost in tears.","“Father, your level is so advanced, but Jun Linyuan can still injure you. What’s his level now?”","Zuo Qingluan also looked at Zuo Chengfeng.","Many people wanted to know the answer to that question.","Jun Linyuan’s cultivation level was unfathomable.","Zuo Chengfeng leaned back in the chair and took a deep breath. “A year ago, I would have had no problem defeating him; I didn’t know he could make such leaps and bounds in one year.”","He murmured, “That shouldn’t be the case. He has been making rapid progress for a long time. According to some of the elders, his potential has reached its peak and should move into a steady period.","“That wasn’t steady at all! His cultivation level has skyrocketed!”","Zuo Chengfeng coughed violently.","Jun Linyuan had severely injured him.","It had been years since he fought and was wounded like this.","“Grandpa, is His Royal Highness’s cultivation level higher than yours?” Zuo Qingluan didn’t know how she should feel.","She was happy that she had chosen Jun Linyuan. He never disappointed her.","However, it worried her that she still didn’t have the Divine Phoenix Blood, so His Royal Highness didn’t have feelings for her.","Zuo Chengfeng raised his head and gave Zuo Chengfeng a strange look.","He sighed. “Let it go.”","“What?” Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched.","Zuo Chengfeng said, “He’s in love with Feng Wu, not you.”","After hearing what Jun Linyuan said, Zuo Chengfeng knew what that girl meant to the crown prince. No one could compete with her.","Zuo Qingluan was astonished.","She rose to her feet and stared at Zuo Chengfeng. “Grandpa, His Royal Highness isn’t in love with Feng Wu! He likes her Divine Phoenix Blood!","“Grandpa, please help me! Let’s do it again, just like five years ago! We’ll destroy her Divine Phoenix Blood, so only I have the True Phoenix Blood.","“If it’s possible, we can take her bloodline and plant it in me. That way, I’ll have the Divine Phoenix Blood.","“That’ll be so nice! No one ever said that only Feng Wu is allowed to have the Divine Phoenix Blood!”"]},{"number":2927,"title":"Chapter 2927 - Jun Linyuan Loves Feng Wu","paragraphs":["“Grandpa, please help me! It’ll help the family, too! Grandpa, don’t you want Jun Linyuan as your grandson-in-law?","“Father, talk to Grandpa.” Zuo Qingluan urged Zuo Ming.","Zuo Ming looked at Zuo Chengfeng. “Father...”","Zuo Chengfeng cut him off.","With half of his face charred, Zuo Chengfeng didn’t look as composed as usual.","A moment ago, he had been smiling at Jun Linyuan while sipping his tea, but now, he had been defeated.","His current condition was a stark contrast to how he had looked before.","“Zuo Qingluan.” Zuo Chengfeng took a deep breath, the look on his face extremely serious.","“Remember everything I’m going to say next.","“You must brand it in your memory!","“Jun Linyuan loves Feng Wu, not you!","“He chose me as his opponent because he wanted to punish me to set an example.”","Zuo Chengfeng’s face was livid.","The old man used to be an approachable character. He even looked kind when he was angry. However, he seemed sinister and furious now.","Hatred burned in his chest. Jun Linyuan hadn’t destroyed his fury. Zuo Chengfeng only hid it deeper.","“Do you know why I said that?” he asked Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan shook her head.","Zuo Chengfeng said patiently, “Let me tell you why.","“The entire empire is coveting Feng Wu’s Divine Phoenix Blood now, and Jun Linyuan chose to challenge me because when he defeats me, no one will dare touch Feng Wu.”","Zuo Qingluan’s heart was pounding.","She shook her head and wouldn’t believe it.","Zuo Chengfeng moved closer. “Do you know why Jun Linyuan chose me?”","Zuo Qingluan shook her head.","Zuo Chengfeng said, “He probably knows what we did to Feng Wu five years ago, but he can’t be bothered to gather the evidence.","“According to him, he didn’t fall in love with Feng Wu five years ago, so he didn’t intervene.","“From now on, he will be there to protect Feng Wu. If anyone touches her, he’ll destroy their whole family.","“What a shame. Such an outstanding young man fell head over heels for a girl.”","Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded.","Tears rolled down her cheeks.","“No, that’s not true!","“I won’t believe it! I can’t!","“Jun Linyuan, if I can’t have you, I’d rather die!”","She clenched her fists and couldn’t listen to anything.","Zuo Chengfeng glanced at her and knew what she was thinking, so he said to Zuo Ming, “I’ve made some arrangements. She’ll be sent to Peace Grassland. I believe the war there can quench her fury. If she learns something from it, the Zuo family will still have a future.”","He waved his hand after that.","A man dressed in black walked out of the shadows.","Zuo Chengfeng nodded at him.","The man picked up Zuo Qingluan and disappeared in a few leaps.","They could still hear Zuo Qingluan yelling.","“Let go of me!","“Grandpa, I don’t want to go to Peace Grassland!","“I’m sorry, Grandpa! I want to stay here! I want His Royal Highness!”"]},{"number":2928,"title":"Chapter 2928 - He Likes Her","paragraphs":["The louder her voice was, the faster the man moved. They were soon out of earshot.","After Zuo Qingluan was gone, Zuo Chengfeng told Zuo Ming, “We must keep a low profile from now on.”","Zuo Ming nodded, but he didn’t feel that way.","His father had lost to Jun Linyuan, but he could still easily defeat anyone else.","Zuo Chengfeng smiled wryly. “You don’t understand.”","Extremely capable cultivators could sense the battles between other capable cultivators.","Although his battle with Jun Linyuan hadn’t lasted long, many people already knew what had happened.","Other people of his generation would have learned that he was weaker than Jun Linyuan.","They would discipline their family members, telling them not to offend Jun Linyuan or get any funny ideas about the Divine Phoenix Blood.","Feng Wu wouldn’t need to deal with the trouble created by many of the influential forces.","However, Jun Linyuan’s weakness had also been exposed in that battle.","“Jun Linyuan, I don’t believe you weren’t unaffected by my strike.” Zuo Chengfeng smirked.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan led the others out of the Zuo family manor.","“Boss Jun, Boss Jun —”","Jun Linyuan went straight back home to his cultivation room.","Retch —","He couldn’t hold it back anymore and spat out a mouthful of blood.","He frowned.","Feng wasn’t here because Emperor Wu had summoned him. Otherwise, he would have followed Jun Linyuan to the Zuo family.","The emperor’s study.","Emperor Wu had summoned Feng.","He started complaining as soon as the steward walked in.","“Feng, is that how you brought up that brat? He doesn’t look like a crown prince at all!”","Feng said, “Your Majesty, he’s just like you.”","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","He couldn’t deny that.","He stared at Feng and sighed. The two men sat down on the stairs, and Emperor Wu asked. “You know about what’s going on with Feng Wu, right?”","Feng nodded.","Emperor Wu asked, “What is that brat thinking? Does he like her? Does he want to marry her? I want an answer!”","Feng said, “The answer to both questions is yes.”","Emperor Wu’s eyes lit up.","“That’s great! I’ll write up the edict announcing the marriage!” Emperor Wu was thrilled. “Yes, they’ve always been engaged, but many people thought that the engagement was annulled.","“I can’t let those people belittle Xiao Wu. I’ve prepared a nice piece, and I’ll put it on paper later. I’ll say the nicest things about Xiao Wu! No one can object to that!”","Feng looked at him in resignation.","Emperor Wu asked, “What’s the problem?”","Feng said, “I don’t think you can make that announcement any time soon.”","Emperor Wu said, “Didn’t you say the answer is yes? What’s the problem?”","Feng said, “Your Majesty, you know what your son is like.”","Emperor Wu’s face darkened. “What’s his problem? Xiao Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood! If he doesn’t make a move now, it’ll be too late!","“Guess what? I received these today.” Emperor Wu showed Feng a thick stack of papers."]},{"number":2929,"title":"Chapter 2929 - Excellent Idea","paragraphs":["“These are the lists of all the gifts the influential forces are sending to the imperial capital. They all want to marry their sons to Xiao Wu! I’m so worried!","“After all, Xiao Wu isn’t exactly head over heels for Junjun,” Emperor Wu said honestly.","Feng nodded.","It was obvious that the crown prince liked Feng Wu more than the other way around.","He was the disadvantaged party, and she could be more willful.","“What’s his problem? You’ve been with him for so many years, so tell me! Otherwise, why do I need you?” Emperor Wu was a little mad.","Feng smiled bitterly. “Well, his problem is with the Divine Phoenix Blood.”","“What? Isn’t it good enough?” Emperor Wu asked grumpily.","Feng nodded. “Your Majesty, His Royal Highness is a proud man. He wants to marry Feng Wu, not the Divine Phoenix Blood.”","Emperor Wu was confused. “Feng Wu and the Divine Phoenix Blood are the same thing. What’s the difference?”","What a dumb question.","Feng said, “Your Majesty, that may be the case with everybody else, but it is definitely not how your son sees it.”","Emperor Wu shrugged. “Tell me more about it.”","Feng said, “His Royal Highness is a perfectionist. I’m sure you see that in his cultivation practice.”","Emperor Wu nodded. “Yes. He cultivates like there’s no tomorrow. When he was little, he didn’t want to interrupt his cultivation streak, so he stayed three days in the snow.”","Feng nodded. “His Royal Highness has the same requirement when it comes to relationships. He’ll marry Miss Feng Wu, but it won’t be for her Divine Phoenix Blood.","“He’ll agree to a marriage agreement, but he won’t want to force her to marry him because of an imperial edict.","“He wants her to marry him willingly.","“Your Majesty, if I were you, I wouldn’t intervene. It’ll make things more complicated.","“I could have intervened many times, but...","“Relationships need to be worked on. We’re outsiders. If we meddle, it’ll only distract the two of them.","“One thing is for sure: They’re moving in the right direction, which is a good thing.","“Your Majesty, your edict will have to wait until they’re both willing to acknowledge the relationship.”","Emperor Wu looked at Feng in resignation.","“Is that the only way?”","Feng said, “I’m afraid so.”","Emperor Wu said, “Alright. I’ll hold back on the edict, but you have to show him these lists. He needs to know he has competition!”","Jun Linyuan was still treating his wounds when Feng returned home.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi guarded the door.","“What happened?” Feng asked.","Feng Xun told him Jun Linyuan fought with Zuo Chengfeng earlier that day.","Feng frowned. “Does he have a death wish? He’s not as capable as Zuo Chengfeng!”","Feng Xun said, “What? Didn’t Boss Jun win?”","Feng said, “He did, but at a cost. Well, he likes the challenge...”","An idea suddenly struck Feng."]},{"number":2930,"title":"Chapter 2930 - Leave Her Alone","paragraphs":["“Feng, what’s on your mind? Why are you smiling like that?” Feng Xun’s stomach lurched.","Feng wouldn’t carry out the task himself.","He was supposed to be an unapproachable steward.","He waved at Feng Xun, and Feng Xun quickly ran to his side.","Feng put a stack of papers in his hands.","“What are these?” Feng Xun was curious.","Feng said, “They’re from His Majesty. All the major forces want to propose to Xiao Wu.”","Feng Wu said, “Are they blind? Don’t they know Xiao Wu isn’t available anymore?”","Feng rolled his eyes at him.","Feng Xun got it right away!","Boss Jun hadn’t made the announcement yet.","Feng Xun thought about Boss Jun’s injury. If he heard from other people that so many people wanted to propose to Feng Wu, he would turn the imperial capital upside down!","At that thought, Feng Xun told Feng, “We can’t keep it from Boss Jun. If he loses his temper, no one can stop him!”","Feng said calmly, “Is that right?”","Feng Xun said, “Yes, it is! You’ve been with Boss Jun for so long. You know what he’s like. If he sees all the gifts going into the Feng manor, I can’t imagine what’ll happen.”","Feng rubbed his chin. “I see...”","Feng Xun said, “This file says they’re moving as fast as they can and they’ll get here tonight. Oh, no! I have to tell him now! It can’t wait!”","He then rushed inside.","Xuan Yi was going to follow him inside, when Feng said, “I hear that Miss Feng Wu is a good doctor.”","Xuan Yi was amazed.","He had just gotten a glimpse of the real Feng.","That night, ordinary people in the imperial capital didn’t sense anything strange.","Little did they know that 15km outside the imperial capital, people were scattered all over the ground.","Apart from the Zuo family and the downgraded Xuanyuan family, all the major families and forces had sent their elite young members.","Only the monks of the Sumeru Temple and the Beggars’ Gang didn’t get involved.","Firmament Palace was here, too.","“Send the gift. I dare you!”","His sword moved.","He made one furious, single strike.","The strike was powerful enough to split the ground open.","The crown prince spared no effort.","There was a ten-meter gash on the 15m road leading to the imperial capital.","One strike.","Carriages tipped over, and men and horses fell all over the ground.","They were all terrified but had no idea what had happened.","Feng Xun was kind enough to remind them, “If you want to marry Feng Wu, you’ll have to go through Boss Jun!”","They didn’t see Jun Linyuan’s face in the dark, but they remembered his sword.","He left as swiftly as he came after successfully intimidating everybody.","The son of the Hua family fell backward on the ground and still hadn’t recovered.","After that strike, the crown prince stumbled and almost fell.","He soon disappeared.","“Boss Jun! Boss Jun?” Feng Xun and Xuan Yi ran after him.","The crown prince asked, “Who else wants to take up the challenge?”","Feng Xun said, “No, there’s no one. Your strike sent the warning. No one will mess with Xiao Wu again.”"]},{"number":2931,"title":"Chapter 2931 - Awake","paragraphs":["Xuan Yi nodded. “Only an idiot would try to propose to her again.”","The crown prince swayed because his spiritual essence was drained. “Take me home.”","“Sure.”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi exchanged a mischievous look.","The last words Jun Linyuan said were, “Don’t tell her!”","He lost consciousness before hearing a reply from Feng Xun or Xuan Yi.","Knock, knock, knock —","Somebody knocked on Feng Wu’s window in Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu frowned.","She had set up a barrier. Apart from Feng Xun and a few others, no one else could come in.","She pushed the window open to find several people outside.","It was Feng Xun and Xuan Yi, but Xuan Yi seemed to have someone on his back.","Feng Xun said anxiously, “Xiao Wu, please help us! You’re our only hope now!”","Feng Wu asked, “What happened?”","Feng Xun pushed Jun Linyuan into Feng Wu’s arms.","Before Feng Wu realized what was going on, she was holding Jun Linyuan, who was unconscious and covered in blood.","She was dumbfounded.","Feng Xun said, “Boss Jun is dying! Please help him. He’s in this state because of you. You have to do something!”","Jun Linyuan had ordered them not to tell Feng Wu, so Feng Xun didn’t go into detail. He was sure she could figure it out on her own.","Feng Xun pleaded with Feng Wu, “Please don’t send him back. When His Majesty hears the news later, he’ll hold Boss Jun responsible. Please let Boss Jun hide here!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi left as soon as they could.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She looked from Jun Linyuan to the night sky, and decided to save his life first.","Just then, she heard some noise outside.","It seemed someone had woken up.","Feng Wu was a strong girl.","She picked up Jun Linyuan and carried him into her room, shutting the door behind her.","The most important thing was to figure out what was wrong with him.","Feng Wu put him on the bed and examined his injuries.","She unbuttoned his robe, revealing his skin.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She had thought she could remain calm, like an ordinary doctor.","“Ahem.” Feng Wu cleared her throat to calm herself down.","Just then, she felt someone staring at her.","Looking up, she saw it was Jun Linyuan!","He was awake!","“I thought you passed out!” Feng Wu cried out.","The teenager’s eyes were exceptionally bright in the dark. “I’m awake.”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know what happened? Do you know you’re injured?”","Injured? The crown prince coughed violently.","She gave him a glass of water and said gently, “Don’t get excited. Take it slow.”","She then fed him some water.","The crown prince was dumbfounded.","Usually, she would run away from him as fast as she could. Why was she so gentle now?","The crown prince studied her.","After feeding him water, Feng Wu said, “Lay back down and let me examine your wounds.”"]},{"number":2932,"title":"Chapter 2932 - Leave Me Alone","paragraphs":["The girl meticulously examined the boy’s body, and he couldn’t take his eyes off her face.","His eyes were sparkling.","Feng Wu frowned when she saw the palm print on Jun Linyuan’s chest.","“Who did this to you?!”","Jun Linyuan thought,? She looks like an angry bunny.","He snorted. “I burned one side of his entire body. I won that battle.”","Feng Wu jabbed his head with a finger. “Don’t brag.”","The crown prince had to remain silent.","Feng Wu put some treatment powder on his chest. “What was the fight about?”","The crown prince looked at her with sparkling eyes.","He quickly looked away when their eyes met, pretending that he hadn’t been looking at her.","Feng Wu said, “Who did you want to teach a lesson this time? Why were you fighting in the middle of the night? What did you do to yourself?”","The crown prince mumbled, “None of your business!”","Feng Wu said, “I’m asking you for your own good. Do you know how severe your injury is? The internal injury is much worse than the external ones. Luckily, you’re strong enough. An ordinary person would be dead by now.”","The crown prince snapped, “I told you, it’s none of your business!”","He wanted to get up and leave, but he was too weak to move a muscle.","Feng Wu just poked him with one finger, and he fell back onto the bed.","Feng Wu said, “Are you a kid? You want to run back home whenever you’re angry.”","The crown prince ground his teeth.","Other people might fear to upset Jun Linyuan, but Feng Wu didn’t. “Why are there two layers of injuries? Did you fight twice tonight?”","The crown prince didn’t reply.","Feng Wu stared at him. “You were badly injured in your first battle, but you still had another battle. Are you an idiot?!”","The crown prince looked away and wouldn’t meet her eyes.","What should he say? He could have protected himself from getting injured, but he activated all his spiritual essence to create that shocking effect. As a result, he had wounds one on top of each other.","Feng Wu said angrily, “Feng Xun didn’t stop you?!”","The crown prince was glad to see this, and he nodded. “Yes!”","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan. “When you get angry, a hundred Feng Xuns put together can’t stop you. You can’t blame him!”","The crown prince looked at Feng Wu.","He was so good-looking, and his eyes were like the brightest stars in the sky.","However, those stars were staring at her now. What could she do?","She no longer felt so angry.","She told Jun Linyuan, “You’re very strong, but don’t do that again. Use your sword.”","But I would do anything for you, ?the crown prince thought.","Feng Wu asked, “Is that clear?”","The crown prince said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu suddenly realized how obedient Jun Linyuan was being today.","He had always been so proud, and she could never make him listen to her.","But he was being so lovely now."]},{"number":2933,"title":"Chapter 2933 - Adorable","paragraphs":["He looked so adorable that she wanted to rub his head.","Feng Wu said, “You need to stay in bed for the next three days. No extraneous activities for a month, and don’t eat food that can irritate your injuries. Can you remember that?”","The crown prince shook his head. “No.”","Feng Wu said, “Why can’t you remember such a simple thing?”","Jun Linyuan glared at him. “Why should a crown prince remember such a thing?”","Feng Wu scratched her head. He had a point.","“I’ll fetch Feng tomorrow.” Feng Wu glanced at him.","She didn’t know that Feng was visiting his hometown.","“You need some new clothes.” Feng Wu frowned.","It was early spring, and the wind was still quite chilly.","She told Jun Linyuan, “Wait here. I’ll find you some clothes.”","She searched her drawers and closet until she found a night robe.","“Why do you have a man’s robe in your room?!”","The crown prince wanted to kill somebody.","Feng Wu said, “I made it for Xiaoqi. Look. There are bunny ears on the hoodie. Isn’t it lovely? Put it on.”","The crown prince stared at her in disbelief.","Feng Wu said, “I know all your clothes are made from expensive material. Even the threads have silver and gold in them, but this is all I have. Do you want to wear your dirty clothes?”","The crown prince said impatiently, “Don’t you have anything else?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Nope. That’s all I have. I made it bigger because I don’t know when Xiaoqi will be back. You know, Grand Secretary Fang took him away on a long trip.”","The crown prince grunted, “I didn’t know that.” He didn’t care either.","Feng Wu went on. “I wonder how they’re doing now. Life on the road must be so inconvenient.”","The crown prince didn’t like hearing Feng Wu talk about Xiaoqi all the time. Even as he put on the robe, he decided to burn it to ash later. When Xiaoqi came back, there wouldn’t be anything left.","Before Feng Wu knew it, the crown prince had put on the robe.","His skin was smooth and fair. His deep-set eyes were intimidating on ordinary days, but his injuries made him let down his guard, so he looked like a sleepy tiger. Feng Wu almost wanted to rub his head.","“You look so nice!” Feng Wu was pleased with her work. “Don’t start fights again. Xiaoqi is a good boy. He never starts fights.”","The mention of Xiaoqi annoyed the crown prince.","“Get out!” he snapped.","Feng Wu asked, “Why are you so grumpy all of a sudden?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Get out of my sight now!”","Feng Wu said, “You’re unbelievable! This is my room, and you’re asking me to leave? Fine. I’ll leave you alone! Enjoy!”","She left the room after that.","She couldn’t understand it. She and Jun Linyuan had been having a peaceful moment, but he suddenly lost his temper; she didn’t know what happened.","Feng Wu paced back and forth along the river."]},{"number":2934,"title":"Chapter 2934 - His Majesty Wants to See You","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were enjoying drinks behind closed doors.","Feng Xun said, “We’ve sent Boss Jun to Xiao Wu’s home. We’ve accomplished our mission, right?”","Xuan Yi drained his glass. “Yup.”","He had always had feelings for Feng Wu, but he knew he couldn’t let anybody know, nor did he want to.","Feng Xun couldn’t tell, and just laughed. “They’ve dragged this thing out for too long. They’ll marry eventually, so they may as well do it now.”","Xuan Yi had a bitter taste in his mouth. “You’re right.”","Feng Xun looked like a happy mouse. “What do you think they’re doing now?”","The answer was: Nothing.","The crown prince was so frustrated because he usually was the one who walked away, but Feng Wu was the one who did it today.","Unbelievable!","He wanted to run after her but was too weak to do so.","Feng Wu had put some sleep-inducing ingredients in his medicine to make him sleep better, and it was taking effect now.","He couldn’t move or make a sound when he wanted to call Feng Wu’s name.","Couldn’t she come back herself?! The crown prince kicked away his blanket and turned to face the wall.","Feng Wu calmed down when the cool air outside blew on her face.","Jun Linyuan had always been like this. Given his severe internal injury, he couldn’t activate his spiritual essence. Of course he would feel frustrated. Feng Wu felt she shouldn’t have bickered with him.","She felt so childish.","She patted her own head.","Someone suddenly showed up when she was about to return to her room.","Feng Wu almost jumped.","“Master Gao?”","It was Master Gao, the eunuch and the chief steward of Emperor Wu.","He bowed. “Miss Feng Wu, His Majesty wants to see you.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","She had met Emperor Wu on many occasions, which was why she was so surprised when she saw him.","He looked so angry, like he was going to explode.","“Xiao Wu, you’re here! Tell me, have you seen that brat Jun Linyuan?”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","She looked so innocent when she shook her head in confusion. Anybody would believe her.","“You really haven’t seen him? I’m so mad!” Emperor Wu didn’t even give Feng Wu time to answer. She just sat there and watched the emperor complain about his son.","“Do you know what he did last night?","“He went out to fight!","“Do you know with whom?","“Zuo Chengfeng!","“Do you know who Zuo Chengfeng is?”","Emperor Wu went on before Feng Wu could answer.","“He’s Zuo Qingluan’s grandfather!","“That brat went to fight Zuo Chengfeng on his own!","“He’s of the older generation and is so much more capable! What made that brat so bold?!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","“Wait. He went to challenge Zuo Qingluan’s grandfather? Why?” Feng Wu was confused.","Emperor Wu stared at her. “You don’t know?”","Deep down, she knew the answer, but she insisted, “No, I don’t.”","“I heard Junjun and Zuo Chengfeng reached an agreement. If Zuo Chengfeng lost, he would have to keep his promise.” Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu."]},{"number":2935,"title":"Chapter 2935 - How Did I Do?","paragraphs":["Feng Wu asked, “What agreement?”","Emperor Wu asked, “Do you really want to know? You won’t be able to unhear it.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She thought for a few seconds before nodding solemnly. “Please tell me!”","Emperor Wu was serious. “I talked to Zuo Chengfeng afterward and learned what their agreement was.”","Feng Wu looked at him.","Emperor Wu said, “Zuo Chengfeng has agreed not to get involved in the competition between you and Zuo Qingluan.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Emperor Wu asked, “You understand what that’s about?”","Feng Wu said, “So, Jun Linyuan made sure that the competition would only be between Zuo Qingluan and me. No matter how miserably she loses, her family can’t get involved. Is that it?”","Emperor Wu nodded. “If the Zuo family dares try anything, Jun Linyuan will support you and help you handle the seniors of the Zuo family.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Jun Linyuan had made sure the senior members of the Zuo family wouldn’t interfere.","All Feng Wu needed to do was take care of Zuo Qingluan; she wouldn’t be distracted by her family.","“He did more than that. Do you know what he did? He destroyed the marriage proposal gifts sent by many families.”","“What gifts?” Feng Wu was perplexed.","“The whole empire knows you have the Divine Phoenix Blood, and many people have plans for you. With a single strike, he created a ten-meter wide gap in the ground 15km outside the imperial capital.","“The common folk in the capital city won’t have fresh vegetables to eat today because the vendors can’t cross the wide gap. Do you know how much trouble he has caused?” Emperor Wu put his hands behind his back and arrogantly paced around the room.","He also glanced at Feng Wu from time to time and exchanged knowing looks with Master Gao.","He was obviously up to something.","Feng Wu was still dazed by the information, or she would have realized that Emperor Wu was putting in a good word for his son.","“He did all that to protect you!” Emperor Wu concluded.","Feng Wu said, “What? What are you talking about?”","She couldn’t stand it when other people were too nice to her.","She didn’t want to owe other people favors, and would want to return them right away.","She felt undeserving after hearing what Jun Linyuan had done for her.","That explained his severe wounds.","He fought Zuo Chengfeng first before making that strike 15km outside the city. What a day!","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","After everything he did for her, he didn’t tell her anything.","Feng Wu headed for the door.","Emperor Wu feigned a concerned tone. “Xiao Wu, where are you going? I haven’t finished yet. Xiao Wu?”","Feng Wu was soon out of sight, and Emperor Wu turned to ask someone hidden in the shadows. “Feng, how did I do?”","There he was, the steward whom Feng Wu had been looking everywhere for.","So much was going on in Feng Wu’s head that she felt both happy and confused. It was so overwhelming that she couldn’t make a decision.","However, she knew there was something she needed to do now.","He had done so much for her Divine Phoenix Blood and had even gotten injured for it. Instead of thanking him, she made him upset.","If she were him, she knew she would have exploded by now."]},{"number":2936,"title":"Chapter 2936 - Unhappy Crown Prince","paragraphs":["Of course, Feng Wu didn’t rush to apologize to Jun Linyuan.","Being so straightforward wasn’t her thing.","This was so embarrassing...","She stalled for as long as she could. After making some chicken porridge, she squeezed some fresh juice and carried everything on a tray.","She knocked on the door.","No one answered.","Feng Wu knew Jun Linyuan must still be mad at her.","She pushed the door open and put the tray on Jun Linyuan’s bedside table.","The crown prince was facing the door at first, but he turned to face the wall when Feng Wu came in.","“How old are you?” Feng Wu wanted to ask him.","She had a hard time connecting this childish teenager to the person who created the two incidents that shook the entire Junwu Empire the night before.","She crouched down and poked Jun Linyuan’s back with a finger.","He moved a little at her touch.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you hungry? Would you like some porridge?”","The crown prince ignored her and went on sulking.","Feng Wu sat down on the edge of the bed and tugged at his blanket. “Lying on your side isn’t good for your wounds. You should lie on your back.”","Jun Linyuan threw a dirty look at her, thinking,? Just let me die. It’s not like anybody will care!","However, he didn’t say that out loud.","He eventually listened to Feng Wu and lay on his back.","Feng Wu fetched some cushions to put behind his back so that he could sit up.","“We made these cushions. Aren’t they adorable?” Feng Wu waved the rabbit ears on the cushion. “It’s the same as your robe.”","“Childish!” the crown prince commented.","Childish? You’re wearing the pattern, ?Feng Wu thought. Things were a little easier now that Jun Linyuan was talking to her.","Feng Wu tried to bring up the subject. “Actually, last night...”","The crown prince glared at her in frustration. “I don’t want to talk about it!”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","The crown prince said, “Not a word!”","He still felt embarrassed about destroying those gifts that way. It felt good, but probably everybody now knew how he felt about Feng Wu.","He wanted to roll over in bed and bury his face in the pillow.","Feng Wu wanted to tell him she knew what he had done for her, but Jun Linyuan wouldn’t let her talk about it.","Well...","She would make it up to him and return the favor.","It wouldn’t be too difficult since her master was the most capable man on this continent, and she also had several senior brothers.","Feng Wu showed him the glass of juice. “I squeezed the plum juice myself. Won’t you try it?”","The crown prince was still upset about her putting sleep-inducing ingredients in his water.","He looked at Feng Wu. “How do I know you didn’t put sleeping powder in it again?”","Feng Wu took a sip. “See? It’s safe.”","She was going to drink the juice and make another fresh glass for Jun Linyuan later. Before she knew it, the crown prince had drained the glass.","Feng Wu said, “The chicken porridge is really delicious. I made it myself.”","The crown prince glanced at her. “Really?”","Why was he upset again?"]},{"number":2937,"title":"Chapter 2937 - The Look","paragraphs":["Feng Wu couldn’t figure out what upset him this time.","She picked up the bowl of porridge, but he wouldn’t even look at her.","Feng Wu was speechless.","“Fine, you spoiled young prince.”","She scooped some porridge and held the spoon up in front of Jun Linyuan’s mouth. “Your Royal Highness, have some porridge.”","The teenager glanced at her. “How do I know you didn’t put any sleeping powder in it?”","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","What do you think I want to do to you? Why would I drug you all the time?","No, I can’t get angry. Jun Linyuan is a very difficult prince. I have to make him happy.","Feng Wu put on a pleasant smile. “I’ll take a bite first.”","She ate the porridge and found it quite tasty.","“Will you have some now, Your Royal Highness?” She smiled at him.","The crown prince said, “Your smile is so fake!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Nothing makes you happy, does it? Are you going to eat it or not? If not, I’m taking it back to the kitchen.”","She rose to her feet.","“Hey!” The crown prince said grumpily, “Did I say I wasn’t going to eat it?”","Be patient!","The crown prince gave her an accusing look.","Feng Wu thought,? He’s mad at me, right?","But why is he so good-looking?","His eyes are so bright.","In that rabbit sleeping gown, he looks so soft and lovely.","Ugly people were unbearable when they got angry.","Good-looking people were still attractive when they were mad.","What a world!","The crown prince said, “My arms are weak.”","Feng Wu said, “Shall I feed you?”","She felt rather embarrassed.","The crown prince’s ears were a little pink, but to conceal how happy he was, he said impatiently, “Whatever!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Should she feed him or not?","She lifted a spoonful of porridge to his lips, and he ate it.","She tried again, and the crown prince ate everything on the spoon.","Feng Wu couldn’t understand why he would still pretend when he was so hungry.","He finished the bowl of porridge in this awkward way.","Feng Wu wanted to take the bowl to the kitchen, but the crown prince stared at her in disbelief.","Feng Wu was speechless.","What did she do now?","The crown prince said, “Don’t you rinse your mouth after a meal?”","Feng Wu said, “Sure...”","The prince had made a request!","Feng Wu fed him some water.","However, he frowned. “Too hot!”","Feng Wu tried the water. “It’s not that hot...”","The crown prince looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Alright, alright. I’ll blow on it to cool it down.”","When she wasn’t looking, the crown prince smiled a little, but he wiped the smile off his face as soon as Feng Wu turned to him.","His expression changed so fast that Feng Wu thought it was an illusion.","“I probably saw wrong...” Feng Wu rubbed her eyes.","The crown prince was a fussy man. It took Feng Wu an hour to finish the meal.","During that hour, Feng Wu ran back and forth like a servant, doing things like trying the temperature of the water or massaging his back."]},{"number":2938,"title":"Chapter 2938 - Who Did It?","paragraphs":["An hour later, Qiuling’s voice came from outside.","“Miss, Miss —”","The crown prince glared at the door.","Qiuling might have improved, but she hadn’t reached the Spiritual Lord stage yet. Sensing the crown prince’s cold energy, she felt her blood curdle.","She immediately stopped talking.","Hearing the noise, Feng Wu wanted to go outside.","The crown prince frowned. “Don’t go!”","Feng Wu looked back at Jun Linyuan and saw him staring at her like an abandoned puppy.","She felt butterflies in her stomach.","She said softly, “I’m going to tell Qiuling your condition. My family doesn’t know you’re here yet. They’ll be frightened by the news.”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Do I look that frightening?”","Feng Wu was amused.","She said, “You’re good-looking, but your prominent status is quite scary. I’ll be right back. There are some books on the desk. Feel free to have a look.”","Feng Wu then left the room, ignoring his reluctance.","Qiuling heard every word of their conversation.","Granny Zhao, Qiuling and the beautiful lady were all there.","Qiuling was so scared that she could barely speak. “His Royal Highness... His Royal Highness...”","She pointed at the room as she spoke.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes, he’s inside.”","“Miss, did he kidnap you?” Qiuling was almost in tears.","Her mistress normally couldn’t stay far away enough from the crown prince. Why would she let him into her room?","“I’ll do anything to keep you safe, Miss Wu!” Qiuling wanted to rush into the room.","She knew her strength was puny in comparison, but she still wouldn’t give up.","Feng Wu stopped her.","Just then, Chaoge rushed into the courtyard.","She said, “Xiao Wu, everybody knows about your Divine Phoenix Blood now. I heard so many major families want to marry you to their sons!","“I’m sure the Zuo family will try to plot against you again, but we won’t let that happen! We’ll protect you!” Chaoge clenched her fists.","Qiuling and Granny Zhao nodded. Neither of them would let anyone mistreat Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Before she could speak, she heard hasty footsteps outside.","“Miss Wu, I heard some shocking news!” Uncle Qiu ran into the courtyard. “Something happened in the Zuo family last night, and nearly half of the manor has disappeared! I heard they were struck by lightning in the middle of the night!”","Feng Wu smacked her forehead!","“There are many carriages and trunks 15km outside the city. Judging from the emblems on them, they’re from several different families.”","Chaoge grabbed her sword. “They’re here to propose to Xiao Wu! How annoying! I’ll kick them out!”","Qiuling and Granny Zhao were worried. There were so few of them. How were they going to get rid of the big families?","Uncle Qiu stopped Chaoge. “Miss Duan, please let me finish. The carriages and trunks were all over the ground, as if somebody had robbed the owners.”","Robbed?","Feng Wu rubbed her temples. She knew what had happened. Of course, Jun Linyuan wouldn’t have struck just once."]},{"number":2939,"title":"Chapter 2939 - Was It Yu Mingye?","paragraphs":["Even if Jun Linyuan only struck once, Feng Xun wouldn’t let those people leave so easily. He would force them to leave something behind.","Chaoge was surprised. “Really? Were they robbed?”","Uncle Qiu said, “Yes, I checked it myself. There’s a ten-meter wide gap in the ground that runs for tens of kilometers!”","Chaoge asked, “Who dug it?”","Uncle Qiu said, “I heard it was created with a sword.”","Chaoge said, “Wow! Who did that? I want to be their student!”","Inside, Jun Linyuan felt both abashed and proud. He even smiled a little.","Fallen Star Yard was particularly crowded today.","They were still chatting when Feng Xun and Xuan Yi arrived.","Feng Xun rubbed his shoulders and back as if he was tired. He said to Xuan Yi, “I was so tired last night. That strike, I’m telling you...”","“Feng Xun!” Chaoge’s eyes lit up, and she grabbed Feng Xun’s sleeve. “You know who did it, don’t you? You know the person who got rid of the proposal gifts!”","The crown prince grew nervous.","“Ahem.”","He cleared his throat as a warning to Feng Xun.","Feng Xun’s stomach lurched because Boss Jun had told him not to tell anybody, so he told Chaoge, “Who else do you think could have done that? It’s so easy to guess.”","“Was it Master Linghu?” Chaoge guessed.","Feng Xun said, “Do you think Master Linghu has nothing better to do than meddle in mundane things?”","The crown prince cleared his throat again.","Realizing what he had said, Feng Xun wanted to slap himself. “You’ve met him before. You’ll be able to guess without me saying anything. I’m starving. Xuan Yi, let’s get some breakfast.”","Xuan Yi glanced at Feng Wu and left with Feng Xun without saying a word.","Feng Wu didn’t notice the glance because she was thinking about Jun Linyuan.","Chaoge was still guessing. “Who is it?”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. Nobody will try to steal my Divine Phoenix Blood again.”","Qiuling was pleasantly surprised. “Really? Are you sure? How’s that possible? They coveted your True Phoenix Blood. Are you sure your Divine Phoenix Blood is safe?”","Up on the wall, Feng Xun said, “Zuo Qingluan has been sent to Peace Grassland. What do you think?”","He jumped off the wall after that.","Qiuling was amazed. “Zuo Qingluan was really sent away? And those annoying families, too? Xiao Wu will have some peace again. Who is that secret person?”","Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu, after what they did for you, how will you thank them?”","She didn’t know that Jun Linyuan was inside.","The closed door couldn’t keep the crown prince from hearing her.","Feng Wu looked at Chaoge in resignation. “Don’t you have better things to do?”","Chaoge looked at Feng Wu. “Could it be Yu Mingye? That sounds like something he would do.”","The crown prince had been smiling, but he couldn’t smile now."]},{"number":2940,"title":"Chapter 2940 - Brother Jun","paragraphs":["Outside, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were so frustrated.","They had been busy the whole night, and that stupid Yu Mingye was going to take the credit. No, that couldn’t happen!","Feng Wu glanced at her room and smiled a little. “That’s possible.”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say a word.","Feng Wu, you’re blind!","I’m so mad!","Qiuling and Chaoge praised Yu Mingye, saying that he was good-looking, capable and nice to Xiao Wu.","Feng Wu couldn’t stand it anymore. “It may not be him. It could be the crown prince.”","“Do you really think His Royal Highness would do something like that?” Chaoge said. “If that’s the case, you can have my head as your stool!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","How bold!","Qiuling suddenly realized something and covered Chaoge’s mouth. “Shh...”","Chaoge said, “What’s the matter? You know what His Royal Highness is like. He’s arrogant and unapproachable. Yes, he likes Xiao Wu, but he’s always ordering her around...”","“Duan Chaoge, stop it!” Feng Wu couldn’t listen to her anymore.","The crown prince was right inside. Chaoge could get herself killed.","Meanwhile, Qiuling was already whispering into Chaoge’s ear while pointing at Feng Wu’s room.","Chaoge’s eyes widened in fear.","She stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded.","Chaoge thought,? Holy crap! Why is the crown prince here so early in the morning?","“I’ll check out that place 15km outside the city! It can’t possibly have been Yu Mingye who made that strike. I think it was probably His Royal Highness! I’m off!”","There was a whoosh.","Chaoge ran as fast as her legs could carry her.","She rushed outside to see Feng Xun.","Feng Xun mouthed to her the bad news.","“It was Boss Jun!”","Thump!","Chaoge fainted in his arms.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was telling Qiuling and the others to go about their day as usual for the next few days while the crown prince was staying with her.","She also mouthed to the others that Jun Linyuan was indeed the person they had been talking about.","Granny Zhao and the others were greatly moved, and Feng Wu slipped back into her room.","The room was freezing cold when she walked in.","There was ice on the window panes.","It was so cold.","Feng Wu shuddered.","The teenager on the bed was sulking.","Feng Wu felt a little guilty for having brought up Yu Mingye.","“Ahem...”","She walked up to the crown prince, but he wouldn’t even look at her.","Feng Wu felt the cushion behind his back.","Even the cushion was cold to the touch. He was very mad.","Feng Wu suddenly felt very bad.","He was easily agitated and was here to show off his achievements. She shouldn’t have upset him.","She had to take care of it herself.","She felt Jun Linyuan’s forehead and pretended to be surprised. “You’re so cold. Are you sick?”","The crown prince wouldn’t answer.","Feng Wu knew he was angry.","“Jun Linyuan?”","He still wouldn’t say anything.","“Junjun?”","He still wouldn’t say anything.","“Brother Jun —”","Feng Wu called him in a sweet voice."]},{"number":2941,"title":"Chapter 2941 - Hard to Please","paragraphs":["She already had a soft voice, and when she spoke like that, it was practically irresistible.","“Brother Jun, are you asleep?”","The crown prince realized he couldn’t stay angry anymore.","He felt like a deflated puffer fish.","Sensing the change in his mood, Feng Wu knew she had done the right thing.","“I don’t think it was Yu Mingye.” Feng Wu moved closer. “He’s not nearly capable enough to create that wide gap.”","The crown prince thought,? Yes, that’s right!","Feng Wu said, “I heard half of the Zuo family’s house is gone. Who could it be? I’m so glad!”","The crown prince buried his face in the duvet and smiled shyly.","Feng Wu said, “I really don’t like Zuo Qingluan. She destroyed my True Phoenix Blood five years ago. I won’t forgive her!”","The crown prince felt sorry for her.","Feng Wu said, “I wonder why that mysterious expert was so helpful? He took revenge on my behalf before I needed to do anything!”","The crown prince almost wanted to say something, but he was supposed to be sulking.","He fought back his impulse.","Feng Wu thought,? When is he going to lighten up?","She had no choice but to continue.","Feng Wu rested her chin on her hands and said sweetly, “I really want to meet that great expert! I’m sure he’s very handsome! I wonder if I’ll ever get to see him?”","She was saying all the nice things she could think of, and hoped the crown prince would start talking.","She glanced at Jun Linyuan.","Only then did the crown prince slowly turn around.","Feng Wu helped him lean on the cushion.","He glanced at Feng Wu. “Do you really want to meet that person?”","Feng Wu’s eyes twinkled. “Yes! I do! He helped me get rid of Zuo Qingluan and all those people! I’m so grateful!”","The crown prince said, “He didn’t do it for you.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why did he do it, then?”","Jun Linyuan said, “He didn’t have anything better to do.”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know?”","The crown prince realized what he had said. Feng Wu had tricked him!","However...","He then realized Feng Wu was admiring somebody she didn’t know.","The temperature dropped again, but Feng Wu didn’t know why.","She was confused.","Why was he mad again?","He looked even angrier now.","Feng Wu thought,? How much anger does this man have?","Feng Wu asked, “What did I do?”","Jun Linyuan stared at her. “Aren’t you ashamed?!”","She was dumbfounded.","Jun Linyuan said, “A girl should be reserved!”","Feng Wu said, “I...”","Jun Linyuan pointed at her. “You’re not reserved enough!”","Feng Wu didn’t know who that man was, so she was admiring a stranger. The idea made Jun Linyuan want to kill someone.","Feng Wu was upset by the criticism and decided to give up.","May Jun Linyuan be struck by lightning!","She stormed off."]},{"number":2942,"title":"Chapter 2942 - Reconciliation","paragraphs":["The crown prince felt a little guilty after saying those words. He grew anxious when he saw that Feng Wu was going to leave.","He jumped out of bed and grabbed Feng Wu’s arm.","Feng Wu said angrily, “Let go of me!”","Jun Linyuan said, “No, I won’t!”","Feng Wu said, “Let go!”","Jun Linyuan said, “I’m not letting you go!”","Feng Wu said, “You told me off!”","Tears welled up in her eyes.","She felt so awful.","She was only trying to make him happy, but he only scolded her.","She wouldn’t have made up those things if she didn’t know he was that man.","Her beautiful master was more capable than anybody else. Why should she admire somebody else?","She was very mad.","The crown prince grabbed her so hard that blue veins popped on the back of his hand. He was worried that she would leave as soon as he let go.","He thought,? I was only jealous!","But he couldn’t tell her that.","He suddenly put a hand on his chest. He turned pale, and sweat rolled down his face.","Feng Wu suddenly remembered Jun Linyuan’s severe internal injury.","“Didn’t I tell you to stay in bed for the next three days? Have you forgotten what I said?” She pushed Jun Linyuan back onto the bed.","After she tucked Jun Linyuan in, she realized that she couldn’t walk away.","He was holding onto the lower hem of her skirt.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She stared at him, and he looked at her like a wronged puppy.","Feng Wu thought,? If you keep looking at me like that, I’ll change my mind!","She didn’t know what to say. This man was supposed to be a relentless fighter.","She feigned a serious demeanor.","The crown prince looked even more aggrieved. “Don’t go...”","Seeing that Feng Wu was still angry, the crown prince said, “This is the first time I’m staying overnight in somebody else’s home.”","So?","“I don’t know how long my father will stay angry.”","Feng Wu thought,? Who cares?","“My grandmother will be so worried.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She recalled what Emperor Wu said. Jun Linyuan had challenged Zuo Chengfeng, who was several levels higher than he was. He was so bold!","The empress dowager doted on Jun Linyuan. She would be devastated if she knew how much Jun Linyuan went through.","At that thought, Feng Wu didn’t feel so upset anymore. Jun Linyuan had risked his life for her.","She wanted to ask Jun Linyuan how he got injured so that he could tell her the truth, but she was also worried that he would ask her to make a choice.","Growing up was so much trouble. She wished she was still a little baby.","She looked at Jun Linyuan, and Jun Linyuan looked back at her.","One could almost see pink bubbles in the air.","Feng Wu suddenly blushed.","She cleared her throat. “I’m not angry anymore. What about you?”","The crown prince wouldn’t tell her that he wasn’t, so he changed the subject. “Your shoes are so ugly!”","Feng Wu looked down.","She wore her fluffy winter slippers at home, and they were much more comfortable than the embroidered shoes of this world.","Feng Wu said, “They’re indoor shoes I wear at home. Who wants to wear boots? They’re rigid, and your feet can’t breathe. All my family members wear these slippers. I even made a pair for Feng Xiaoqi myself. Do you have any at your house?”"]},{"number":2943,"title":"Chapter 2943 - I Don’t Like Her Hands","paragraphs":["Feng Wu glanced at Jun Linyuan, feeling proud of her work.","The crown prince gave her a meaningful look.","Feng Wu said, “Shall I ask Granny Zhao to make a pair for you?”","The crown prince didn’t cheer up.","Feng Wu asked, “Two pairs?”","The crown prince looked even more unhappy.","Feng Wu said, “Shall I make them myself?”","The crown prince finally looked at her, but his tone was still very proud. “Make them here. Otherwise, how will I know if they were made by you?”","That way, she would have to stay by his side.","Feng Wu didn’t know what the crown prince’s preference was. He had made her embroider two ducks before, and knew how poor her skills were. Why would he want her to make him some slippers?","But if he wasn’t worried, why should she be?","She started right away.","Feng Wu asked Qiuling to bring in the materials for the fluffy slippers.","Qiuling didn’t dare look at the person on the bed when she came in. It was so scary!","She was worried that Feng Wu couldn’t do it, but when she sensed the crown prince’s cold energy, she put down the basket and ran for the door.","She summoned up her courage to look at the person on the bed before closing the door. One glance, and she thought she would faint.","That relentless crown prince was wearing such an adorable sleeping robe!","Was he really the cold-blooded crown prince?","Qiuling wasn’t as bold as Chaoge.","She didn’t dare look at him again.","She only breathed again once she closed the door behind her.","Granny Zhao and the others all wanted to know how things were going in the room, and the beautiful lady was very curious.","Qiuling whispered, “His Royal Highness isn’t angry...”","Granny Zhao wouldn’t believe it since the crown prince was so scary.","Qiuling said in a tiny voice, “His Royal Highness is wearing that bunny robe...”","Granny Zhao was astonished.","Qiuling said, “Yes. He doesn’t seem scary and almost looks adorable.”","Granny Zhao said, “Chaoge said the same thing.”","Both girls had called the relentless crown prince adorable.","Qiuling covered her mouth and shook her head.","She just felt that when His Royal Highness looked at her mistress, his eyes were so bright.","It was like her mistress had brought a god down to earth.","Inside, Feng Wu glanced at Jun Linyuan again. “I need to warn you, my sewing is mediocre at best.”","Jun Linyuan said, “It’s not like I haven’t seen it before.”","Feng Wu said, “I just don’t understand. Granny Zhao is such an expert, but you won’t let her make the slippers for you.”","The crown prince glared at Feng Wu. “Her hands don’t look nice!”","Feng Wu said, “Do you pick the eggs you eat by how pretty the hens look?”","The crown prince almost choked.","Feng Wu was gleeful when she saw the crown prince flush, but she couldn’t show it, or he would get angry again.","She focused on the fluffy slippers.","She made a pair that matched the robe with dangling rabbit ears.","The ears would sway as he walked, which would be cute.","The crown prince didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu showed him the slippers with both hands. “Your Royal Highness, shall I put them on for you?”","The crown prince stared at her.","Just then —"]},{"number":2944,"title":"Chapter 2944 - Big Bad Wolf","paragraphs":["Just then, footsteps came from outside!","“Sister!","“Mother!","“Chaoge!","“Qiuling!","“Granny Zhao!","“Uncle Qiu!”","They heard the excited voice of a teenager.","Feng Wu was thrilled.","That was Feng Xiaoqi!","It had been a long time since she last saw him.","He was back! He was alive!","Feng Wu tossed the slippers to the side and rushed off. The next second, she and Feng Xiaoqi were hugging each other in the courtyard.","Xiaoqi was only a year younger than Feng Wu.","They grew up together.","They went through the best and worst times together and had never been separated.","This was the first time that they had been apart for so long, and Feng Wu had missed him.","In her previous life, she had been a secret agent with little emotion, but this time around, she felt much softer inside because she needed to protect her family.","They were what motivated her to get better.","“I thought you were never coming back!” The boy had grown much taller, like a young tree. She squeezed his smooth cheeks.","It had only been six months, and he had changed so much.","“Ouch! That hurts!” Feng Xiaoqi jumped around.","It took Feng Wu a while to calm down and test Xiaoqi’s capability.","“You’re a Level 7 Spiritual Lord now!” Feng Wu was astonished.","He had improved so much in those six months!","Feng Xiaoqi said, “Master says it’s all thanks to the foundation you built for me. Once I started cultivating, I improved so fast.","“I won’t even need to take the exam to enter Imperial College. I can join the War Academy right away.”","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s Grand Secretary Fang?”","Feng Xiaoqi said, “We wouldn’t have come back so soon, but Master detected some unusual activity in the Dongsang Kingdom, so he went to see His Majesty, and sent me home first.”","Unusual activity in the Dongsang Kingdom... Feng Wu had a bad feeling.","With Northern Feng General guarding Peace Grassland, however, everything should be alright.","She soon put it aside and led Feng Xiaoqi inside. “I have a gift for you. Open your mouth.”","Feng Xiaoqi obediently opened his mouth.","“What is it? It tastes funny.” Feng Xiaoqi didn’t dare say it smelled like a toilet.","Feng Wu said, “It’s good stuff. There’s a bottle of it, and it’s all for you. Drink it again when you reach Level 9. You’ll then rise to the Spiritual King stage without getting stuck.”","“Really?” Feng Xiaoqi was surprised. “Master told me about the spirit wine that our school used to have.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. This is the spirit wine.”","Feng Xiaoqi’s eyes widened. He had such an amazing sister!","“Sister, you’re so nice to me! I’ll keep you safe! When I become a super capable cultivator, I’ll protect you from the crown prince! He’s a big bad wolf!”","“Shhh —”","Qiuling, Granny Zhao, and Uncle Qiu shushed him.","Feng Xiaoqi was bewildered.","The big bad wolf? A certain person smirked in the room."]},{"number":2945,"title":"Chapter 2945 - Sudden Guilt","paragraphs":["“Shhh!”","Everybody gave Feng Xiaoqi warning glances, but he was still perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “That big bad wolf is in my room.”","Feng Xiaoqi wouldn’t believe it. “Don’t scare me like that! You’re such an awful sister!”","Feng Wu said earnestly, “Kiddo, I’m telling the truth.”","Feng Xiaoqi laughed as he walked toward Feng Wu’s room. “There must be a present in your room. It’s a pleasant surprise, isn’t it?”","She was the best sister in the world!","Feng Xiaoqi turned the door handle.","The door opened.","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes and smiled at Feng Xiaoqi.","Feng Xiaoqi and Jun Linyuan’s eyes met.","“Gosh!”","Feng Xiaoqi was horrified.","He ran out of the house as soon as he could.","“Holy crap!”","He wiped off the sweat on his forehead.","Feng Wu walked up to him, and Feng Xiaoqi shook her by the shoulders. “Why is that fiend in the house?","“Why is he in your room?","“Has he gotten to you?!”","They were on the open street now, but Feng Xiaoqi was too shocked to choose his words carefully.","When he realized what had happened, he grabbed Feng Wu’s arm. “Let’s go to my master’s house! We can talk there!”","They jumped over the wall into Grand Secretary Fang’s house.","Feng Xiaoqi was scared of Jun Linyuan because he felt the fiend could do anything.","He dragged Feng Wu to the corner furthest from the Feng manor before whispering, “Sis, what’s going on?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s a long story.”","She would have to start with her old grudge against Zuo Qingluan.","Feng Xiaoqi said, “I’m worried about death here, so make it shorter! What’s your relationship with him?”","Relationship?","No matter how far away that corner was, the crown prince could still hear them if he wanted to.","Feng Wu said, “Well, I think we’re friends...”","Feng Xiaoqi said, “Do you let a friend sleep in your bed?”","Feng Wu wanted to explain, but Feng Xiaoqi cut her off. “I remember when we were little, I came back from outside and sat on your bed without changing my clothes. You kicked me off, telling me not to touch your bed before changing my clothes.”","Feng Wu said, “He changed his clothes.”","Feng Xiaoqi said bitterly, “That’s your bed. I can’t even sit on it, but he’s lying there...”","Feng Wu suddenly felt a little guilty.","Feng Xiaoqi went on. “You made that robe for me yourself. Why is he wearing it?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Xiaoqi asked, “Are you in love with him?”","Feng Wu said, “No!”","Feng Xiaoqi looked her up and down. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes!","Feng Xiaoqi mumbled, “I don’t think I believe you.”"]},{"number":2946,"title":"Chapter 2946 - Not Afraid","paragraphs":["Feng Wu didn’t believe it herself.","In Feng Wu’s room, the “fiend” rested his chin on his hand, lost in thought.","He kept replaying what Feng Xiaoqi said in his head.","“That’s your bed. I can’t even sit on it, but that fiend is lying there...”","The crown prince had been jealous of Feng Xiaoqi’s return at first, but he was now smiling.","When Feng Wu was involved, he turned into a foolish teenager.","He turned back into a wise and sensible man again when dealing with other people.","He wondered what he should do with his future brother-in-law.","That boy had just called him a big bad wolf.","In that case, Jun Linyuan would let the boy willingly bring his sister to him.","Once he formed that plan, his thoughts were much clearer.","Feng Xiaoqi and Feng Wu returned shortly after that. They had no idea what the clever crown prince was going to do.","Feng Xiaoqi was almost too scared to enter the room.","He only calmed down a little when Feng Wu promised him repeatedly that the crown prince was quite harmless at the moment.","After dinner, the crown prince was reading a book while Feng Wu worked on some herbs.","She needed to make some medicine for Jun Linyuan.","She had been treating him with the green light, but it only had a minimal effect.","Therefore, she decided to make a Semi-Divine pill.","She had been stuck at the Supreme Level for a while. If she could succeed, the crown prince could be healed a lot faster.","The pill required a lot of precious ingredients, but the crown prince’s residence was at her beck and call, so she found everything she needed without difficulty.","Jun Linyuan put down the book and asked in a seemingly casual tone, “Is your brother back?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes. Xiaoqi is amazing. I forbade him from cultivating until he achieved the Ultimate Spiritual Body. After that, he’s been making fast progress. He’s already a Level 7 Spiritual Lord!”","She added, “Xiaoqi is the most handsome boy in my neighborhood!”","The crown prince suddenly wasn’t in the mood to chat anymore.","He said, “Go back to your pill.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you sure you’ll be alright? I won’t be out for two days.”","The crown prince nodded.","Once Feng Wu entered the refinement room, the crown prince glanced at Feng Xiaoqi, who was outside the window and stealing peeks at Jun Linyuan from a few steps away.","“Come over here.”","Jun Linyuan’s indifferent tone might sound casual, but no one could challenge the authority it carried.","Feng Xiaoqi was already scared of the crown prince, and the last thing he wanted was to go anywhere near him.","He turned to run, but it felt like he was stopped by an invisible rope, and he couldn’t move even a finger.","Feng Xiaoqi wanted to cry. His sister lied! The fiend was anything but harmless!","He had no choice but to enter the room.","He didn’t know what the fiend would do to him.","My sister will take revenge for me!? he screamed inwardly.","Xiaoqi thought the crown prince would eat him alive, but what he received was a test.","The crown prince wanted to test his progress.","Xiaoqi wanted to rest his hands on his waist and laugh.","He had followed Grand Secretary Fang for the past six months and had learned many things from the old man, not to mention the rapid progress he had made in his cultivation.","He wasn’t afraid of the test at all!"]},{"number":2947,"title":"Chapter 2947 - Pride, the Biggest Enemy","paragraphs":["However, Xiaoqi was dumbfounded when he heard the first question.","It felt like falling into a bottomless pit.","Whenever he looked back on this day, Xiaoqi would always feel like he had been tested by a god.","How could such a man exist in this world?","That man could comprehend everything almost instantly and could bring the understanding to the next level.","With a few casual comments, Xiaoqi could understand so many things he couldn’t figure out before.","Jun Linyuan only pointed out the shortcomings in his swordplay. The next time Xiaoqi used his sword, it felt like he was being reintroduced to it.","A casual dot Jun Linyuan drew on paper could contain so much secret knowledge. When Xiaoqi comprehended it, he rose to the next level.","...","Feng Xiaoqi was amazed.","His eyes sparkled.","Was this the world of geniuses?","He admired Jun Linyuan for his intelligence, his knowledge, and his skills... His everything.","Feng Xiaoqi used to admire Grand Secretary Fang for his wisdom and prudence, but all that paled in comparison with Jun Linyuan.","At first, Xiaoqi thought he would never give in.","He searched for books all over the city, determined to find something that Jun Linyuan didn’t understand.","However, after he asked all his friends and collected all the books he could find, he realized Jun Linyuan could explain anything on any random page he picked.","His explanation was even more comprehensive than what was written in the books.","Xiaoqi almost felt it wouldn’t be a bad idea to have such a brother-in-law.","Brother-in-law?","“Stop it!”","Xiaoqi smacked his own head.","That man was just a little more clever and capable than other people.","“I won’t give in!”","The crown prince quickly finished a dozen abstract paintings.","Some contained a word, and some only had a single drop of ink on them.","It was as if he drew them on a whim.","Xiaoqi held the scrolls as if they were the most precious things in the world.","They were indeed precious!","Even Grand Secretary Fang asked him for one, not to mention other officials.","Feng Xiaoqi dried the paintings under the grape trellis. He then studied the first painting and started cultivating.","Feng Wu came out with the pill.","It was only semi-successful.","Semi-Divine pills weren’t that easy to make. Feng Wu rubbed her temples, put the pill in a box, and came out of the room.","She was surprised to see Feng Xiaoqi cultivating under the grape trellis.","It had only been two days, but he felt different.","The impulsive and arrogant feelings brought by his rapid progress were gone. He was working very hard now.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She also knew that the rate of progress wasn’t the most important thing for a genius. What was important was to stay humble and modest.","Arrogance was a genius’s only enemy.","Because of his achievements, Xiaoqi had a sense of superiority."]},{"number":2948,"title":"Chapter 2948 - Brother-in-law","paragraphs":["Feng Xiaoqi seemed to have been tempered. He looked like a modest, self-disciplined gentleman.","Feng Wu wondered if Xiaoqi had taken a blow or something.","Just then, Xiaoqi finished circulating the energy around his body. He opened his eyes and spotted Feng Wu.","“Sister.” Xiaoqi rose to his feet and didn’t rush to hug Feng Wu like before, because his brother-in-law... No, the fiend said only childish boys would act that way around their sisters.","Feng Wu was perplexed. What happened to her cute, clingy brother?","She put down her extended hands in embarrassment.","Before she could ask, Xiaoqi grinned. “Sister, do you see anything different about me?”","Feng Wu examined him. “You’re a level higher! You’re a Level 8 Spiritual Lord now!”","It was as if he was on a rocket ride!","Feng Wu said, “I thought you wouldn’t be able to make any breakthroughs for the time being because of your rapid progress. What happened?”","“Sister, you have no idea. His Royal Highness is amazing! He only gave me a few pointers, and I made a breakthrough.”","Feng Wu thought,? His Royal Highness? Isn’t he the fiend?","Feng Xiaoqi then took out a dagger and showed it off to Feng Wu.","“This is Wolf Moon. It’s a Level 3 divine weapon! It can be upgraded!” Xiaoqi’s eyes sparkled.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","A Level 3 divine weapon?","Weapons had different categories.","Some could be upgraded, and some couldn’t.","The first kind was extremely rare, and there were only a handful on the continent.","Most weapons couldn’t be upgraded.","Most cultivators used iron weapons. Sacred weapons were of a higher grade, and above that were divine weapons.","The Fallen Star Sword had only been an iron weapon when it was made. It only became a sacred weapon after Feng Wu added inscriptions and formations to it.","She then found an opportunity in the tomb to turn the sword into a divine weapon.","Most weapons would maintain the state they were made in; the most one could do to increase the weapon’s offense and defense powers was to add inscriptions and formations – upgrading wasn’t an option.","“Where did you get this?” Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised.","Such a weapon was extremely hard to find.","Even the elders might not have one.","Xiaoqi was over the moon.","“His Royal Highness says that with my concealment skills, this dagger is perfect for assassination!” Xiaoqi suddenly rushed past Feng Wu and stopped behind her.","His speed was incredible!","“His Royal Highness?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and had a bad feeling.","The simple and honest boy told her everything. “The dagger is from His Royal Highness, and so is this move. His Royal Highness is amazing. In the past two days...”","“Hold on...”","Feng Wu raised her hand and cut him off. “Haven’t you been calling him ‘the fiend’ all this time? Since when did you start calling him ‘His Royal Highness’?”","Xiaoqi said shyly, “I was too childish before.”","Feng Wu said, “If one didn’t know better, they would think I went away for two years! How did you realize that in two days?”","Xiaoqi smiled awkwardly. “Well, I think he’s a pretty decent brother-in-law!”"]},{"number":2949,"title":"Chapter 2949 - Does It Hurt?","paragraphs":["Feng Xiaoqi dashed off after that.","He needed to cultivate.","According to his brother-in-law, once he had finished comprehending the twelve paintings, there was another roomful of paintings at the crown prince’s residence. Feng Xiaoqi couldn’t wait to see them all.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Wasn’t she supposed to be his beloved sister?","Didn’t he say he would protect her from the big bad wolf?","“Feng Xiaoqi, you’re pushing your sister into a wolf’s den!","“Jun Linyuan, what did you do in the past two days?”","What she didn’t know was that because of the twelve paintings, she wouldn’t see her brother for a while.","He was focused on his cultivation.","Inside, a certain fiend was listening to the noise in the courtyard.","He smiled in satisfaction.","When he heard footsteps approaching, he jumped into bed and buried his head under the blanket.","“Will my hair get messy?”","He immediately sat up, smoothed down his hair, and grabbed a book from the bedside table. He only turned a page before Feng Wu came in after a knock.","She studied Jun Linyuan in amazement.","How could he achieve that in two days?","How did he completely change Xiaoqi’s attitude?","That was incredible!","The crown prince pretended he was too absorbed in the book to notice Feng Wu.","Realizing she was studying him, he put a hand on his chest and coughed weakly.","Feng Wu immediately came over and sat down by his side.","No matter what he did, his health was still the top priority.","Feng Wu handed him the semi-finished pill. “I made this Semi-Divine enhancement pill. Don’t stare at it. It’s my first time making it, so I made some errors. It’s only semi-finished, but it’s better than nothing. It’ll help your injury to recover 20% to 30%. Will you take it?”","Jun Linyuan was staring at her in silence, and Feng Wu thought he disliked the pill. She was upset.","“Forget it. I’ll...”","Feng Wu took back the pill and turned to leave, but he grabbed her hand.","Before Feng Wu knew it, he yanked her, and she fell into his arms.","He was still severely injured and couldn’t withstand her weight.","Feng Wu blushed and wanted to stand up.","However, he was holding her by her shoulder, and she couldn’t break free.","Surprised, she turned her head and stared at him. “How’s your chest? Did I hurt you?”","Feng Wu had examined him, and the injury was very severe.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes flickered like a starry night.","He didn’t care about his injury.","He just wanted to kiss her.","He wanted to tell everybody how amazing his girl was.","She was so young, but she was already making Semi-Divine pills! She was the smartest girl in the world!","“Are you sure you’re alright?” Feng Wu untied his robe, and his fair skin was exposed.","The handprint was still on his chest, but it was less swollen than before.","Feng Wu touched the wound, and Jun Linyuan sucked in his breath.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Does it hurt a lot?”"]},{"number":2950,"title":"Chapter 2950 - We Have Time","paragraphs":["Feng Wu asked, “Does it hurt?”","The crown prince said, “It’s not that.”","Feng Wu frowned. “What is it, then?”","Jun Linyuan couldn’t answer that question.","He wanted to tell her why, but couldn’t summon up his courage.","Getting no response from Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu said, “Are you going to take this pill? It only has a quarter of the effort of a divine-level enhancement pill.”","She then added, “But don’t worry. I’ve gained some experience; next time, I’ll probably be able to make a proper one.","“I wish I had some Immortal Spiritual Fruit here. I don’t need much. One drop of the juice, and this pill would be much more effective.”","The crown prince glanced at her.","Feng Wu immediately fell silent.","She didn’t forget what she had done with the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","“Luckily...” The crown prince didn’t finish his sentence.","Feng Wu looked at him. “Luckily what?”","The crown prince’s eyes shone as bright as the stars.","The words were on the tip of his tongue, but he didn’t say anything in the end.","He swallowed the rest of the sentence along with the pill.","Seeing this, Feng Wu stood up and guarded Jun Linyuan while he absorbed the pill.","She knew she had to find a way to find some Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","She had obtained some information on the fruit from the Dongsang spy, but she hadn’t had the time to follow the lead once the fighting started.","Bao Er couldn’t wait much longer.","She didn’t have much time left.","Feng Wu had asked the military intelligence to investigate, but they hadn’t gotten back to her yet.","It was the middle of the night when Jun Linyuan opened his eyes again.","His eyes were as clear as if they had been rinsed.","Feng Wu was sitting next to the bed, and she immediately rose to her feet.","“How do you feel? Let me see your injury.”","She put a hand on his chest to feel his heartbeat.","The heat of his skin seemed to run up her arm.","Feng Wu forced herself to calm down.","You’re a doctor! Control yourself!","It took her a while to finish examining Jun Linyuan. She looked up at him in excitement.","“It worked. Although it doesn’t have the full effect, it worked. You’ve already recovered a quarter of your strength, and the pill helped you with another quarter. Right now, you’re halfway to a full recovery!","“See for yourself. How do you feel?”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes dimmed.","Why was she excited about his fast recovery?","Did she want to get rid of him?","He was upset.","Feng Wu had no idea that the crown prince’s imagination was running wild again, and she asked in bewilderment, “What’s wrong? Haven’t you recovered that much?”","The crown prince sulked.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder to comfort him. “Don’t worry about it. There’s no need to rush. We have all the time in the world.”","All the time in the world?","Does that mean she doesn’t mind having me around?","The crown prince immediately brightened up, but he covered it up well.","He was about to say something, when he heard hurried footsteps outside."]},{"number":2951,"title":"Chapter 2951 - One Moment","paragraphs":["The footsteps sounded somewhat familiar.","Feng Wu said, “I’ll have a look.”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu answered the door herself.","Master Gao was outside.","Feng Wu remembered the way he was when she last saw him a couple of days ago. He seemed quite cheerful back then, but his expression was rather gloomy and nervous now.","“Has something happened?” Feng Wu had a bad feeling.","Master Gao nodded and asked, “Is His Royal Highness here?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Master Gao represented the emperor, so Emperor Wu must have sent him here.","Feng Wu didn’t know what Master Gao said, but Jun Linyuan soon came out in his own clothes.","He stopped in front of Feng Wu and looked into her eyes.","He had so many things to say, but he only wrapped his arms around her.","Feng Wu wanted to push him away.","His voice was hoarse. “Just for a moment.”","Why was there sadness in his voice?","Feng Wu was perplexed.","Before she realized it, Jun Linyuan had released her and marched off.","Feng Wu blurted out, “I’ll make the Semi-Divine enhancement pill soon! I’ll wait for you!”","The crown prince paused. He clenched his fists in his sleeves and fought back the impulse to look back at her.","He then walked away.","Feng Wu felt awful.","It was as if a big hand was squeezing her heart.","What happened?","She looked at Master Gao.","Master Gao gave her an apologetic look and quickly followed Jun Linyuan.","They mounted their horses and rode out of sight.","“Where’s my brother-in-law?”","Xiaoqi had just finished comprehending a painting and wanted to show off to his brother-in-law, only to come out and see the crown prince ride away.","“Is my brother-in-law alright?” He had become used to addressing the crown prince that way.","Only then did Feng Wu recover from her emotional moment. “Watch your language.”","Xiaoqi nodded but still asked, “Where is my brother-in-law going?”","Feng Wu wished she knew the answer, but Jun Linyuan had left without a word.","“Men are so unreliable!”","Feng Wu went back to her refinement room and wanted to finish making that pill, but she felt distracted.","The pill didn’t work out. In less than two hours, the refinement failed.","Feng Wu was speechless.","All kinds of ideas rushed through her mind.","Was there a revolt? It shouldn’t be. Emperor Wu was a popular ruler.","Had there been an assassination attempt on Emperor Wu? If that was the case, they should have brought her along.","Was Emperor Wu dead?","Or was the empress dowager dead?","Or...","Feng Wu sat on her bed with her arms around her knees and didn’t sleep for the whole night. She couldn’t think of anything that would make Jun Linyuan have that reaction.","If she didn’t get an answer, she would drive herself crazy.","The sky had just begun to turn bright when Feng Wu arrived at Northern Feng Mansion to try and get an answer from Feng Xun.","He wasn’t there."]},{"number":2952,"title":"Chapter 2952 - Border Emergency","paragraphs":["Lady Northern Feng seemed to have stayed awake all night, too, and there were dark circles under her eyes.","She said, “Xun left last night.”","Last night, too?","Feng Wu asked, “Where did he go?”","Lady Northern Feng gave her a long look before rubbing her head and sighing. “Let the men do their thing.”","It was obvious that she had tried to talk Feng Xun out of it but failed.","Feng Wu was even more anxious when she heard this. It sounded like the empire was in danger, and men were being sent out to defend the empire with their blood and flesh.","“Please tell me. I really want to know.” Feng Wu said down in front of Lady Northern Feng, looking nervous.","Seeing that even Feng Wu had lost her calmness, Lady Northern Feng knew the girl was really worried, so she said in resignation, “There is a crisis at the northern border.”","Feng Wu asked, “Isn’t my godfather stationed there?”","Lady Northern Feng nodded. “Yes. He’s the Great General of the empire and is stationed at the northern border next to the Dongsang Kingdom. They’re on the move.”","Feng Wu said, “The Dongsang Kingdom has always been trying to plot against us. Why is there a crisis now?”","Lady Northern Feng shook her head. “I don’t know the exact situation. I heard that their crown prince made some great achievements and is leading the invasion himself.”","Lady Northern Feng didn’t know much and was telling Feng Wu everything she knew, but Feng Wu was still confused.","She had to find someone that could explain it to her.","Since Feng Xun wasn’t here, Xuan Yi probably had left with him, too.","She went to Jun Linyuan’s residence just in case, but even Feng was gone, let alone Jun Linyuan.","Granny Gong told her that they had all left the night before.","Feng Wu then visited Bao Er, who had deteriorated further. There wasn’t much time left.","She had to find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","If anything happened to Bao Er, Feng Wu would spend the rest of her days in guilt.","She took a deep breath and went straight to Emperor Wu.","He wasn’t in the main hall but was in his study.","News on the Dongsang Kingdom was known only to the high-ranking officials of the empire. It was kept from the common people in order to avoid panic.","Emperor Wu and his officials had discussed it at length but reached no conclusion. In the end, he had to let the officials talk among themselves while he retreated to another room to clear his head.","“Your Majesty.” Feng Wu was waiting for him there.","Emperor Wu was surprised to see her. “Kiddo, you’re here.”","He now saw Feng Wu as a daughter-in-law.","Seeing Emperor Wu’s pale face, Feng Wu asked in concern, “Your Majesty, did you not sleep last night?”","Emperor Wu waved at her. He sat down on the steps and patted the spot next to him.","He seemed to love chatting with people he liked while sitting on the steps.","As soon as Feng Wu sat down, Emperor Wu asked, “You want information on Junjun, don’t you?”","Feng Wu didn’t know how to answer that question.","Emperor Wu wasn’t in the mood to tease her."]},{"number":2953,"title":"Chapter 2953 - Blood Tax","paragraphs":["He said solemnly, “The situation is serious at the moment, and I’m afraid you’ll have to wait for a while before seeing him again.”","Feng Wu said, “I want to know exactly what has happened.”","Her cultivation level might not be high enough, but maybe her knowledge of medicine and formations could help.","Instead of answering her question, Emperor Wu asked, “The Dongsang Kingdom is only a tenth of ours in size. Do you know how they are able to breach our border all the time, and were even able to invade us 14 years ago?”","Feng Wu said, “Is it because they’re better at things like medicine, formations and inscriptions?”","Emperor Wu asked, “Do you know why?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Emperor Wu said, “It’s because they have a patron!”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Emperor Wu said, “There are only a few kingdoms and empires on this continent, but there’s another continent far away to the east with an even more powerful kingdom.”","Feng Wu said, “I’ve never heard that before.”","Emperor Wu said, “That’s because you weren’t qualified to hear of it.”","Feng Wu fell silent.","Emperor Wu said, “That kingdom is very far from us. It can take years to travel there by ship, so we seldom have to deal with them. There’s no need to be scared of them, but they’ve given the Dongsang Kingdom a lot of support. The Dongsang Kingdom obtained most of its technology from that powerful kingdom.”","Emperor Wu seemed reluctant to mention that kingdom’s name.","“Enough about that country. Let’s talk about the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Emperor Wu said, “Apart from technologies like formations and inscriptions, what else do you think is the Dongsang Kingdom’s advantage?”","Feng Sang recalled the books Jun Linyuan had forced her to read, and her eyes lit up. “The blood tax system?”","Emperor Wu nodded. “Yes.”","What was the blood tax system?","It was simple but cruel.","Every five years, the Dongsang Kingdom government would choose children between five to seven from the families of merchants, craftsmen, and farmers.","The smartest child would be chosen from every 50 households.","The chosen children would become the king’s personal guards and be brought up in a military camp, trained by officers and eunuchs.","They weren’t allowed to marry during this period.","Apart from eating and sleeping, they spent all their time studying and training.","The weakest of them would be eliminated regularly, and the survivors would become capable and knowledgeable guards.","Because they were all from ordinary families, they weren’t connected to any forces and were absolutely loyal to the king.","As a result, all the military officers and government officials came from these guards.","Feng Wu said, “The guards aren’t allowed to leave the service before they’re 40. They can marry and have children after that, but their children aren’t allowed to join the guards.”","Emperor Wu nodded, “That’s why the Dongsang Kingdom can prosper for so many years.”","Without families of their own, all the guards had was full loyalty to the king.","Emperor Wu envied the Dongsang King for that.","What ruler wouldn’t want a team of guards like that?"]},{"number":2954,"title":"Chapter 2954 - Parricide","paragraphs":["Feng Wu shook her head. “Your Majesty won’t do that.”","Emperor Wu stared at her. “Why is that?”","Feng Wu said, “You’re a merciful ruler.”","Emperor Wu said, “One day, I’ll adopt the blood tax system, and the Junwu Empire will be invincible!”","Those children were brought up as soldiers and couldn’t marry until they were 40. They would devote all their energy to serving their king.","Feng Wu chuckled. “You’re wiser than the Dongsang King, so you won’t do the same.”","Emperor Wu glanced at her. “How so?”","Feng Wu said, “The blood tax system has made the Dongsang Kingdom powerful, but it’s also a time bomb waiting to explode.”","Emperor Wu glanced at her. “Why do you say that?”","Feng Wu said, “Because of human nature.","“All men are selfish. Once they have their own families, they’ll want different things, and the relationships will become more complicated.","“The key lies in the rule which forbids the guards’ children from joining the guards.","“If a former guard has worked so hard to become a chancellor, but his son can’t join the guards, that means that the latter won’t have a job in the military or government. How can he maintain the prosperity of his family?","“Therefore, the influential people will try their best to get rid of that rule.","“Something is bound to happen. Even if it doesn’t, we can create some problems for them.”","Emperor Wu looked at her in amazement.","“The crown prince said exactly the same thing right here when he was eight years old. You and he are the only two people who have noticed that.","“You’re both brilliant kids!” Emperor Wu almost couldn’t contain his excitement. “Can you imagine how smart your children will be?”","Feng Wu said, “Your Majesty...”","Emperor Wu knew she felt shy, so he shook his head. “I got carried away.”","He thought,? Feng and I have worked so hard to create this great opportunity for you, Jun Linyuan, but you still haven’t won her heart!","Emperor Wu took a deep breath and went on talking about politics with his future daughter-in-law.","“The first king of the Dongsang Kingdom was a wise man. Since he started the blood tax system, he also created a corresponding succession system.","“Do you know how it works?”","The books Feng Wu read didn’t cover the succession system, so she shook her head and looked at Emperor Wu in bewilderment.","Emperor Wu felt like talking today.","“Don’t get impatient because it’s closely related to the incident Junjun went to solve this time.”","He then saw his future daughter-in-law sitting up and urging him with her eyes.","He couldn’t believe what he saw.","Had his plan worked?","Emperor Wu told Feng Wu, “The blood tax system isn’t cruel in comparison because it at least gives the ordinary people a way to climb up the social ladder. The succession system is a different story.”"]},{"number":2955,"title":"Chapter 2955 - Night Owl","paragraphs":["The look on Emperor Wu’s face became serious.","“Their succession system requires parricide.","“Do you know what that is?”","Feng Wu shook her head, but she had a feeling that it involved something very cruel.","Emperor Wu said solemnly, “When one of the princes takes the throne, he has the right to kill all his brothers, and he has to do that.","“It’s written in their law.”","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Emperor Wu said, “Their kings don’t have queens or wives. They only have female slaves.","“All the princes are born from these slaves and are treated as equal. They’re brought up in a strict environment, and the most powerful prince will take the throne.”","Feng Wu took another deep breath.","Emperor Wu asked, “Do you think that gives them a great chance of producing powerful princes?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes. They’ll have a high chance of producing geniuses.”","Emperor Wu said, “All the kings of Dongsang were their strongest princes, not ones born from a queen.”","Feng Wu sighed. “That’s why the Dongsang Kingdom is only a tenth of our size, but they can constantly invade our border.”","Emperor Wu nodded. “Their people are very united.”","Feng Wu had to admit that the Dongsang Kingdom was frighteningly powerful because they were cruel enough.","However —","“Your Majesty, why did you say it has something to do with His Royal Highness?” Feng Wu asked eagerly.","Emperor Wu said, “Just like we have Junjun, the Dongsang Kingdom also has a genius.","“He’s been made the crown prince in advance, and his name is Night Owl.”","Night Owl? As in the bird?","Feng Wu couldn’t understand why the people here would find that name imposing.","However, she still took it seriously since it concerned Jun Linyuan.","“What about Night Owl?” she asked.","Emperor Wu didn’t reply, and just gave her a stack of files to read.","Feng Wu read the information on Night Owl.","He was a very powerful enemy.","He spent almost all his time on cultivation.","He was born to be a powerful fighter.","He had mastered three elements, and became a Spiritual King before he was thirteen.","Feng Wu felt inferior because she was fourteen now and was still a Spiritual King.","At sixteen, he reached the Spiritual Overlord stage.","That was the stage directly above Spiritual King.","Very few people in the empire were at that stage.","Elder Wu and Gongshu Hongzhu, whom Feng Wu had met during the competition, were Spiritual Overlords.","Feng Wu read the next line out loud. “At twenty, he became a Spiritual Saint...”","She had never dealt with that stage before and wasn’t familiar with it.","Emperor Wu explained, “Old Mr. Zuo, the old master whom Junjun defeated the other day, is a Spiritual Saint.”","Feng Wu remembered Emperor Wu had told her before that Jun Linyuan was a few levels below Zuo Chengfeng.","Emperor Wu nodded. “Junjun is a Spiritual Saint as well.”"]},{"number":2956,"title":"Chapter 2956 - Sky Destroyer vs. Fierce Sun","paragraphs":["He added, “Most of the elders in the major families are at that stage, too.”","Feng Wu said, “His Royal Highness isn’t 20 yet, so he’s more talented than Night Owl.”","“But he’s injured.” Emperor Wu rubbed his chin. “I don’t know how severely he was wounded in the battle against Zuo Chengfeng.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She knew the answer to that question.","“It was very severe!” said Feng Wu. “He’s suffering from a severe injury and has recovered only 50% in the past few days.”","“50%?!” Emperor Wu almost jumped to his feet. “He told me he was mostly recovered!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She was overwhelmed by guilt and anxiety.","“He’s only halfway through his recovery. I’m sure of it!” Feng Wu jumped to her feet. “What’s so special about Night Owl? Why does Jun Linyuan have to go?”","Emperor Wu was equally anxious. “That’s because only Junjun can suppress Night Owl’s attack.","“The battle is led by Night Owl himself.","“He has been attacking our strongholds as if no one’s there to guard them.","“The principals of Imperial College and the Military Academy are both there, but Dongsang also sent two Spiritual Saints to match the challenge.","“Junjun’s Sky Destroyer is the only thing that can withstand Night Owl’s Fierce Sun, which is why he was sent to Peace Grassland so urgently. If our army can’t stop this wave of attack, Northern Border City will be invaded, and the enemy will arrive at the imperial capital three days after that.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She really didn’t know what to say.","Why did this happen right after Jun Linyuan and Zuo Chengfeng’s battle?","“Does the Dongsang Kingdom know about His Royal Highness’s injury?” Feng Wu got right to the point.","Emperor Wu looked into her eyes.","Feng Wu said, “If they do, how did they get that information? Who else knew Zuo Chengfeng injured His Royal Highness?”","Emperor Wu said, “I’ll look into it right away!”","Feng Wu said, “Jun Linyuan’s injury is the most important thing. How many days do you think their battle will last?”","Emperor Wu said, “Battles between two capable cultivators like them can take more than a few days.","Feng Wu said, “Will it last ten days?”","Emperor Wu said, “It’s possible.”","Feng Wu nodded. “I know what to do. I’ll prepare right away.”","She turned to leave.","Emperor Wu asked, “Where are you going?”","Feng Wu said, “The Semi-Divine enhancement pill!”","She walked back and extended an open palm. “I need the token to the palace’s medicine storage room now! I need access to everything!”","Emperor Wu gave her an imperial seal before he realized what he had done.","Feng Wu dashed off, running as fast as the wind.","Only then did Emperor Wu say, “What did she say? The Semi-Divine enhancement pill?”","Master Gao nodded.","Emperor Wu asked, “Is she going to make it herself?”","Master Gao said, “I think that’s what Miss Feng meant.”","Emperor Wu said, “Has she lost her mind? She’ll need another 30 years before she can do that!”"]},{"number":2957,"title":"Chapter 2957 - Phoenix Pen","paragraphs":["Master Gao wanted to say something but hesitated.","Emperor Wu said, “I want her to succeed more than anything else. How could Junjun lie to me? If I knew he had only recovered half of his strength, I would never have sent him out there!”","Master Gao was touched. “His Royal Highness might seem defiant and doesn’t seem to care much about the empire, but at this critical moment, he went to the battlefield despite his injury. He’s the pride of our empire!”","Emperor Wu nodded with tears in his eyes. “He’s giving his life to the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu found Master Chu as soon as she could. She showed him the token and had him prepare all the ingredients she needed while she went to Wandering Temple.","Master Linghu was the one she needed to see now.","Jun Linyuan was only half-recovered.","If Night Owl could rise above all the other capable princes, he had to be extremely powerful.","The fact that he had started this war meant that he was well-prepared. He must know he was Jun Linyuan’s equal.","Jun Linyuan was walking into a death trap!","He was risking his life!","If one were to get to the bottom of it, one would discover that Feng Wu was the cause of his injury.","The war had to be stopped before the entire empire was dragged into it.","That was why Feng Wu went to Wandering Temple. Of all the people she knew, Master Linghu was the only one who could stop this war.","She rode all the way from the royal palace to the temple.","She saw boys playing outside their homes and girls eating sweets.","There were vendors along the streets.","The common people were enjoying their peaceful lives.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","She would never let the war destroy this.","All the fighting should be confined to Peace Grassland.","No one should shed blood beyond that place.","Feng Wu raised her whip and urged the horse to run faster.","...","Wandering Temple.","Feng Wu rushed inside as fast as her legs could carry her.","She couldn’t find Master Linghu’s room.","It was so easy to find before, but she lost her way in the bamboo grove.","It took her a while to realize she was in a formation.","She was amazed because very few formations could do that.","She tried to solve it but failed.","Only then did she realize that Master Linghu’s formation skill was as unmatched as his cultivation achievements.","He was so much more powerful than her.","Feng Wu fell silent and was a little upset.","His meaning was obvious.","Master Linghu didn’t want to get involved.","She was right.","Before long, Yuanbao came out with a guilty look when he saw Feng Wu.","He said, “Master says he can’t leave the imperial capital.”","Feng Wu had guessed as much.","If it could be easily done, Master Linghu would have agreed to help her because Jun Linyuan was one of his favorite young cultivators.","Yuanbao raised his hands.","“Master asked me to give this to you.”","It was a long, narrow box.","There was nothing special about it."]},{"number":2958,"title":"Chapter 2958 - Beautiful Master","paragraphs":["The box gave off a spiritual light that filled one with expectations.","What a treasure!","Little Phoenix, who had been cultivating in Feng Wu’s mind space, suddenly woke up.","“The Phoenix Pen!”","Little Phoenix cried out.","“It’s the Phoenix Pen!”","Feng Wu couldn’t understand why it was so excited.","Little Phoenix said, “Of course I’m excited! That used to be... Well, it’s a great pen, so just take it.”","Feng Wu asked, “Does it have something to do with my beautiful master?”","Little Phoenix wouldn’t reveal too much and only told Feng Wu, “You just need to know it’s a great pen. The pen you normally use to write inscriptions is fine, but it’s not good enough for your inscriptions.","“This Phoenix Pen is a totally different story.” Little Phoenix was very pleased.","It had been cultivating in Feng Wu’s space and didn’t know much about what was happening in the world outside. After asking Feng Wu a few questions, its eyes lit up. “Isn’t that great? You wanted to go to Peace Grassland, but over there, the Junwu Empire army has much worse equipment than the Dongsang Kingdom.","“What makes the equipment powerful? The inscriptions are written on the weapons, and that’s some ancient technology!","“This Phoenix Pen will make your inscriptions much more powerful. You can simply write the inscriptions onto the weapons.","“Before, you had to carve the words into the weapons, but you don’t need to do that anymore. This pen is so much smoother than an ordinary carving knife.","“The Dongsang Kingdom inscription masters will be astonished!”","Feng Wu was amazed.","However, she still felt sorry that Master Linghu couldn’t go to Peace Grassland. “I guess we’re on our own. I need to hurry and make that Semi-Divine enhancement pill.”","The facilities in the royal palace were better than what she had at home, and she was more likely to succeed.","Feng Wu cleared her mind once she entered the refinement room.","She tried to focus on making the pill, but she was too worried.","She told herself to concentrate, but she kept getting distracted, which led to failure.","Three days later, Feng Wu scratched her head in frustration when she saw the “pill” that was, in fact, a pile of powder.","After clearing her mind, she started the process again.","Her success rate would be much higher if she were a Semi-Divine refinement master, but she wasn’t there yet.","Three more days passed, and she failed again.","Feng Wu smacked her head.","She wished she had worked harder before.","It had been six days. Was Jun Linyuan still alive?","She realized she couldn’t stop worrying about him.","Wait. The people here believed in God Mu. Maybe things would change if she prayed to her beautiful master.","The next second, she entered her own mind space.","Lying on the ice bed was her god-like beautiful master.","Every time she saw him, it felt like she was desecrating a god.","“Master, please help me. Let me become a Semi-Divine refinement master so that I can make a Semi-Divine pill. I’ve never asked you for anything. Please help me this time...”","Feng Wu bowed three times and gave the beautiful face a long look.","She then left the mind space.","What she didn’t notice was her beautiful master’s hand. His finger twitched a little."]},{"number":2959,"title":"Chapter 2959 - She Can’t Do It","paragraphs":["After that, Feng Wu went back to the refinement room.","Maybe her prayer worked, because she felt much calmer this time.","She added the precise amount of ingredients into the furnace.","She was acutely aware of when the ingredients took effect.","Her calculations had never been so fast when she combined the ingredients.","...","Maybe her beautiful master had blessed her, because the refinement lasted until the fourth day.","Feng Wu had gotten very little sleep during the past ten days.","She was exhausted, but her eyes were surprisingly bright.","They reminded one of the sky outside.","She had reached the final moment.","All the dregs had been filtered, and the dense liquid was about to condense into a pill.","This was the critical moment.","Emperor Wu was already outside.","Master Chu and Master Gao were by his side.","All their eyes were on the door of the refinement room.","“It’s been ten days. Are you sure she’s still working on the pill?”","Emperor Wu also seemed tired.","Needless to say, things weren’t going too well with Jun Linyuan.","Master Chu was very certain. “Your Majesty, Miss Feng Wu is still working on the pill.”","“However, she has failed twice, and this is the third attempt. She hasn’t slept much, has she?”","Master Chu nodded.","Emperor Wu said, “That won’t do. She’ll collapse. Maybe she has passed out already.”","He wanted Master Chu to open the door, but he still had a little hope left.","What if...","What if the girl succeeded?","With the pill, Jun Linyuan’s injury could be healed.","After that, Night Owl wouldn’t be his match.","Master Chu said, “Your Majesty, I can sense the heat in the room, so the furnace is still working.","“The heat is sometimes strong and sometimes weak, which means somebody is controlling the fire.","“Just then, the heat started to fade.","“She’s probably at the critical stage of condensing the pill.","“If we force the door open, Miss Feng Wu’s efforts will go to waste. She’ll collapse!”","Master Gao said, “Your Majesty, why don’t we wait for a moment?”","Emperor Wu couldn’t make up his mind.","He asked the other two men, “Do you think Feng Wu can succeed?”","Master Chu sighed. “It’s almost impossible.”","Master Gao said, “Maybe there’s a little hope.”","Emperor Wu said, “I don’t think there’s any hope.”","The other two men looked at him.","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “Have you forgotten about how she defeated the Military Academy? Her level was revealed then, and she’s a Level 2 Spiritual King now.","“She only recovered her cultivation ability a year ago and had to start as a Level 1 Spiritual Master. It only took her a year to become a Spiritual King.","“Do you realize how many levels she has risen during this time?","“Spiritual Master, Spiritual Grandmaster, Spiritual Elder, Spiritual Lord, and Spiritual King!","“It would take other people decades to achieve that, and she only spent a year on it. That shows how hard she has worked.”"]},{"number":2960,"title":"Chapter 2960 - She Did It","paragraphs":["“A person only has limited energy.” Emperor Wu sighed.","“Since she was working so hard on her cultivation, she wouldn’t have spent so much energy on other aspects.","“Being a Supreme Level refinement master is already very impressive. It’s extremely difficult to rise higher.","“How can she do it?","“That’s just impossible!”","Both Master Chu and Master Gao fell silent.","That was right...","Miss Feng Wu was already an amazing cultivator, so they shouldn’t expect her to be the same with refinement.","They shouldn’t ask for too much.","They all smiled bitterly.","They shouldn’t have such unrealistic expectations.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was concentrating on the pill that had almost taken shape.","She was almost there!","However, something suddenly happened.","The hemispheric pill began to collapse.","It was supposed to be brown, but the color was turning black.","This wasn’t right!","Something was wrong!","Feng Wu remembered what was written in the book her beautiful master left her.","A Semi-Divine enhancement pill should be as smooth and pure white as a boiled egg.","“Quickly! Use your Divine Phoenix Blood!”","At the critical moment, Little Phoenix gave her a loud reminder.","Feng Wu couldn’t afford to fail and was so shocked that she forgot to react.","Divine Phoenix Blood?","Feng Wu took out a dagger and was about to cut her wrist.","Little Phoenix hesitated.","“I didn’t want to tell you this, but if I don’t, you’ll kill me later.","“I think I should tell you the truth. Otherwise, you’ll hate me forever.","“The blood from your wrist won’t work. It has to be your heart blood.","“The Divine Phoenix Blood only has a single drop of heart blood. It can save your life. If you give it to him, you must be sure you won’t regret it.”","Of course, Little Phoenix didn’t want Feng Wu to give it away, but it had to be Feng Wu to make the choice.","Previously, her master decided for her, and it ended up creating a disaster that no one anticipated.","Therefore, Little Phoenix didn’t dare make the same mistake.","Feng Wu looked at the bird and said solemnly, “Thank you.”","She then cut her chest with the tip of the dagger.","A drop of golden blood flew out of her chest and landed on the collapsing pill.","Feng Wu was thrilled to see the pill recover as she watched, and it eventually took shape.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief and nearly fainted.","She hadn’t slept for ten days and had spent that time staring at the furnace.","She needed to concentrate all the time.","It was an impossible task, but she did it.","Her eyes were bloodshot red but frighteningly bright."]},{"number":2961,"title":"Chapter 2961 - Semi-Divine Enhancement Pill","paragraphs":["Feng Wu could sense the knowledge and experience of a Semi-Divine refinement master flowing into her head.","This time, she had made a Semi-Divine pill despite being only a Supreme Level refinement master.","With this precious experience, it wouldn’t be very difficult for her to rise to the next level.","However, she didn’t have time for that because she had more important things to do.","She took out a jade box and carefully put the pale golden pill inside. She then opened the door as fast as she could.","Emperor Wu had already given up.","Master Chu thought Feng Wu had fainted in the room, and was about to force the door open.","Just then, the door opened from the inside.","Emperor Wu was so worried when he saw Feng Wu with her bloodshot eyes and pale complexion.","The adorable girl’s cheeks were hollow, and her chin had gotten so thin.","The first thing he did was to comfort her.","“Kiddo, please don’t blame yourself. You’ve done your best...”","Feng Wu opened the box before he could finish.","Wait!","The color, the smell, and the appearance!","One could see the level of a pill from more than its color and smell. The pill came with its own markings.","Emperor Wu saw the markings of a Semi-Divine enhancement pill.","“OMG!”","Emperor Wu’s heart skipped a beat.","He was ecstatic.","He was so excited that he couldn’t speak.","“It’s a Semi-Divine pill,” Feng Wu said plainly.","Her eyes were frighteningly bright, and she talked fast. “How’s Jun Linyuan doing? Do you have any news?”","Emperor Wu nodded, then shook his head. “They’re fighting in Peace Grassland, and things aren’t looking good.”","Feng Wu said, “I need to get there right now!”","Emperor Wu said, “Elder Wu is gathering Imperial College students to lead them to Peace Grassland. If you go with him, it’ll take you less than half an hour to get there.”","He suddenly started talking faster. “Even I can’t open that portal whenever I want. You have to follow Elder Wu’s schedule. The portal will open in less than 15 minutes.”","The next second!","Feng Wu was out of his sight.","She was gone as fast as she came out of the room.","Master Chu and Master Gao didn’t even have time to talk to her.","Master Chu only realized what had happened after Feng Wu left.","“Oh my god!” Master Chu shouted. “A Semi-Divine enhancement pill? For real? Is it really a Semi-Divine enhancement pill?”","Master Chu stared at Master Gao and Emperor Wu, so excited that he started waving his hands around.","Emperor Wu and Master Gao looked at each other, and they nodded.","Master Chu said, “She really made a Semi-Divine enhancement pill! I can’t believe it! Is she a Semi-Divine refinement master now?","“The Junwu Empire has a Semi-Divine refinement master now!” Master Chu was so excited that his eyes turned red.","“Only the Dongsang Kingdom has masters of that level before, but we have one of our own now!”"]},{"number":2962,"title":"Chapter 2962 - Barely Made It","paragraphs":["Even Master Chu was so excited, not to mention Emperor Wu, the ruler of the empire.","Not only would it strengthen the empire as a whole, they could also vent their long-lasting frustration.","For the past 13 years, the king of the Dongsang Kingdom had laughed at Emperor Wu, saying that the Junwu Empire didn’t have any Semi-Divine refinement masters.","“We finally have one of our own! Finally!”","Tears welled up in Emperor Wu’s eyes, and he couldn’t stop laughing loudly.","He was so proud of his daughter-in-law.","However, he soon stopped laughing because he still didn’t know if his son was still alive.","Luckily, his daughter-in-law was already on her rescue mission.","Feng Wu ran toward the War Academy as fast as she could.","The gate of the academy only opened once a month, and Feng Wu already knew that.","However, rules were meant to be broken.","When she arrived, the teacher at the door was terrified to see her.","Feng Wu remembered the last time when she and Zuo Qingluan went through this portal.","They were welcomed by the same teacher, who couldn’t stop fawning on Zuo Qingluan.","What happened after that?","Word of the competition between the two schools had already spread.","Everybody in the War Academy knew Feng Wu had single-handedly defeated their team. Of course, this teacher knew it, too.","Therefore, he was embarrassed to see her.","He didn’t know how Feng Wu would laugh at him.","He was trying to figure out what to say, when Feng Wu showed him Emperor Wu’s imperial seal.","“Open the portal now!”","The teacher had a thousand things to say, but he kept his silence in the end.","Once inside the portal, Feng Wu sat down, closed her eyes, and started her recovery.","Time was of the essence, and she couldn’t waste a second.","The teacher had prepared a little speech to apologize to Feng Wu, but she ignored him.","Ding —","When the portal opened again, Feng Wu dashed off like a hurricane.","The teacher suddenly remembered an expression.","“The person you ignore today may ignore you one day.”","That was what Feng Wu’s eyes had seemed to say back then.","The teacher felt as if he had just been slapped.","By then, Feng Wu had reached the War Academy.","She headed directly for the principal’s office.","Gongsun Mu wasn’t there.","Nor were Chen Ziyun and the others.","Feng Wu panicked.","15 minutes had almost passed. Had they left already?","According to Emperor Wu, even he couldn’t activate the portal at will.","Feng Wu had never felt so nervous before.","Just then, she heard a voice from her armband.","It was Chen Ziyun.","“Feng Wu, we’re going to Peace Grassland, and I don’t know if I’ll come back alive. If not, these will be my last words to you. I wish you and His Royal Highness all the happiness in the world!”","Feng Wu was astonished!","She had forgotten about her armband.","“Chen Ziyun, where are you?!” Feng Wu asked excitedly.","Chen Ziyun was about to step into the portal, and Feng Wu’s voice made him jump."]},{"number":2963,"title":"Chapter 2963 - You Can’t Go","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu? I didn’t know you were listening to your armband. That was very fast. If you had replied just a little later, I wouldn’t have heard it.”","The girl sounded so excited that Chen Ziyun was secretly elated.","“Where are you now? Tell me!” Feng Wu said solemnly. “Don’t you dare go into that portal before I arrive!”","She sounded so fierce!","Chen Ziyun almost jumped.","Just then, Elder Wu glared at him. “Go inside now!”","The portal had opened.","To keep it open consumed a lot of spiritual essence.","Chen Ziyun told Feng Wu the location and then pleaded with Elder Wu.","“Elder Wu, Feng Wu is here to see us off. Can we wait for her?”","Elder Wu’s spiritual essence was pouring out, so he shook his head. “You’ll see each other again. Go inside now!”","Because of the unusual activity in Peace Grassland, Imperial College was sending more students there.","Most of the Class A students were already there, and they were sending the seeded team now.","Everybody was there except for Feng Wu.","Of course, Qiu Zeyu had already been kicked out.","Chen Ziyun said, “Elder Wu, we...”","Elder Wu’s face darkened. “If you don’t go in now, you don’t need to go in at all!”","Chen Ziyun sighed.","It seemed he wouldn’t see Feng Wu after all. He hoped he could come back alive.","The portal slowly opened.","Feng Wu was still a hundred meters away.","Her eyes went bloodshot red when she saw the closing portal.","She quickened her pace because she wasn’t going to make it.","Just then, Little Phoenix jumped out of her mind and shouted, “Now!”","The bird could be very helpful in critical moments like this.","The teleportation delivered Feng Wu right into the portal, which had almost closed and was only wide enough for one person to squeeze through.","If she were 0.001 seconds slower, she would either be stopped outside the portal or crushed to pieces by it.","Little Phoenix created this one last chance for her.","Thump!","Feng Wu crashed into Chen Ziyun, who was the last person in line.","Ah!","Chen Ziyun was almost knocked down.","Luckily, there was a line of people in front of him.","Everybody cried out in pain.","Even Elder Wu was taken by surprise.","He looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","“How did you get in?”","Little Phoenix had already run back inside Feng Wu’s mind space, leaving Feng Wu behind to face the consequences.","Feng Wu frowned. “I’m going to Peace Grassland.”","Elder Wu asked, “How did you get in?”","He knew that even he couldn’t move that fast.","He was a Spiritual Overlord!","Feng Wu said, “That’s my secret.”","Elder Wu immediately stopped asking questions because he realized Feng Wu was a girl of many secrets.","She had secrets back when they were in the Secret Essence Mine, and now...","“You can’t go,” Elder Wu said solemnly.","Feng Wu couldn’t understand why it was so difficult for her to go to Peace Grassland."]},{"number":2964,"title":"Chapter 2964 - Peace Grassland","paragraphs":["She frowned. “Why?”","Elder Wu said, “His Royal Highness gave me clear instructions when he left, forbidding you from going there.”","That was why the entire seeded team was going to Peace Grassland, but Feng Wu hadn’t been informed.","Before, Feng Wu would have been furious, thinking Jun Linyuan was deliberately holding her back, but after learning what Jun Linyuan had done for her, she could understand why he had left that instruction.","Peace Grassland would soon become a death trap.","It would be extremely dangerous to go there.","That was why he had left that instruction.","She understood, but she had to go.","Feng Wu showed Elder Wu the seal that Emperor Wu had given her. “This is His Majesty’s personal seal. He’s sending me to Peace Grassland, and no one can stop me!”","Elder Wu wanted to say something, but Feng Wu said, “If I remember correctly, Emperor Wu is still the ruler of this empire!”","Elder Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu was relieved.","She didn’t expect this seal to be so useful. It had helped her greatly in such a short period of time.","Elder Wu rolled his eyes at Feng Wu and wouldn’t talk to her.","While they were talking, Chen Ziyun and the others didn’t dare make a sound.","Elder Wu was one of the elders and was known for his ferocity.","Feng Wu was about the only student who dared to speak to him in that way.","Seeing that Elder Wu had given his tacit consent, Chen Ziyun nudged Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him.","Chen Ziyun whispered, “Is this your first time going to Peace Grassland?”","Feng Wu said, “What do you think?”","Chen Ziyun said, “You can’t even find the portal. I think the answer is quite obvious.”","The portal was made for war, so it could contain up to a hundred people.","Feng Wu found a corner to get some rest.","Chen Ziyun sat down opposite her and smiled at her.","He finally saw how tired Feng Wu looked.","“Why are you so pale? You look like you haven’t slept for ten days!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Chen Ziyun.","That was an accurate guess, but it wasn’t like he would be getting a prize for it.","Chen Ziyun said, “Hey, don’t sleep. This is your first time there. Do you know what it’s like over there?”","Feng Wu darted a glance at him.","Chen Ziyun said, “Do you know where the grassland is located?","“Do you know where the battlefield is?","“Do you know how far it is from Northern Border City?","“Do you know the levels of the cultivators there?","“Do you...”","Feng Wu was so tired that she could fall asleep at any moment. She rested her mind while giving him a succinct answer. “Tell me what you know.”","Chen Ziyun felt sorry for Feng Wu. “Sleep. Just follow me when we get there, and I’ll fill you in then.”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Her top priority was to find Jun Linyuan and get him to take the enhancement pill. She didn’t have time for anything else.","She told Chen Ziyun, “Just tell me the most important things.”","The War Academy would provide the students with relevant information.","If a student went to school as scheduled, the teachers would give them lessons on Peace Grassland once they reached Class A."]},{"number":2965,"title":"Chapter 2965 - Battlefield Structure","paragraphs":["The lessons covered battles and how to survive over there.","However, Feng Wu had skipped too many grades.","No one else had ever made such rapid progress.","She was a student of Class A, but she had never attended any classes – of course she wouldn’t know those things.","Therefore, Chen Ziyun filled her in on the essentials.","The battlefield was only 500 km from Northern Border City.","Because things had been intense recently, both sides had built fortresses 30 km from their borders.","The Junwu and Dongsang fortresses were only 60 km apart.","The war wasn’t what Feng Wu had imagined.","There had been no large-scale battle, and the skirmishes were confined to local areas, so only cultivators had been involved.","Northern Feng General’s army had been stationed here mainly as a deterrent.","Chen Ziyun said, “Most of our cultivators come from Military Academy and Imperial College.”","Not everybody in the empire was capable enough to cultivate.","Only a handful were qualified to do that, and even fewer were considered talented.","A very small percentage of cultivators could get into Imperial College or the Military Academy.","It was the same situation in the Dongsang Kingdom.","Therefore, the war between cultivators involved fewer than a thousand people.","Chen Ziyun said, “Most Imperial College students come from intermediate schools, whereas the Military Academy mainly recruits from the military service.","“Here in Peace Grassland, Northern Feng General holds supreme command on our side.","“Below him are the principals of Imperial College and the Military Academy.","“The three of them are at the top of the hierarchy, and they’re all Spiritual Saints. They seldom participate in battles. They’re only there as a deterrent.","“If they participated, Peace Grassland wouldn’t be big enough to withstand their power.","“After that are the elders, who are Spiritual Overlords. Elder Wu is an intermediate Spiritual Overlord, and one of the other elders is a peak Spiritual Overlord. I’ll tell you more about it when we have time.","“We Spiritual King students are below the elders.","“We belonged to the Spiritual Lord group before we rose to the Spiritual King stage. Most graduates are Spiritual Kings. That’s right. Most people end up on this battlefield after they graduate.","“Only peak Spiritual Lord students from Class A are qualified to train themselves in Peace Grassland. They won’t participate in dangerous battles. They’re there to train and survive. They’ll only join the main force when they become Spiritual Kings.”","Just then, the portal opened.","Chen Ziyun stepped outside, and Feng Wu opened her eyes.","She saw green.","Everywhere she turned, she saw an endless green.","In front of her was a fortress.","The walls were at least 50 m tall, and she seemed tiny in comparison.","“This is our fortress, and the Dongsang fortress is over there,” said Chen Ziyun. “Here on the flat grassland, you can easily see things 60 km away.”","It wasn’t completely flat. She could see trees in the north, but they were only a little over 10 m tall.","She didn’t have time to say anything, because something suddenly happened."]},{"number":2966,"title":"Chapter 2966 - Covered in Blood","paragraphs":["Feng Wu felt very hot, and she looked up at the sky.","It was covered by flaming red clouds.","“Are the clouds on fire?” Feng Wu frowned.","That shouldn’t be the case.","Clouds were made of water vapor, so how could they be on fire? She must be so tired that she was hallucinating.","However, something still felt off.","They soon entered the fortress.","The vast fortress was divided into two wings.","According to Chen Ziyun, the left wing was where the Military Academy’s quarters were, and the right wing was Imperial College’s.","Feng Wu only realized how large the fortress was when she was inside.","It was a 5 km by 5 km square, and covered an area of 25 square kilometers in total.","Imperial College’s quarters were at least ten square kilometers in size.","It was made up of rows of stone houses that seemed quite durable.","Everybody could have their own house.","Feng Wu thought that everything she had seen so far seemed to be in order, and she didn’t feel the tension of war. Northern Feng General had to be an excellent leader.","She went straight to Elder Wu. “I need to see Northern Feng General.”","She had asked around, but no one had any information on Jun Linyuan.","She thought that Northern Feng General had to know something.","Elder Wu stared at her. “Northern Feng General won’t see every person who wants to talk to him.”","He was the supreme commander of the army and a very busy man.","Somebody snorted.","Feng Wu frowned and saw that it was Sheng Changtian, her old enemy.","Feng Wu ignored him and only said to Elder Wu, “Do you remember that seal?”","Elder Wu immediately realized it was Emperor Wu’s personal seal.","It occurred to Elder Wu that the girl might be Emperor Wu’s future daughter-in-law, so Northern Feng General might actually agree to see her.","Elder Wu said, “Follow me.”","Feng Wu asked, “Don’t you find it strange?”","Elder Wu said, “You’ve noticed it as well, then.”","Feng Wu nodded. “It’s so quiet. Where is everybody?”","Elder Wu said, “Has the war started? I don’t think so...”","They suddenly heard surprised voices, and they rushed to the other side of the fortress, which was the side that didn’t face the portal.","The portal was at the back of the fortress.","So many people had gathered on a wide plain, and they all looked up at the burning clouds.","Elder Wu asked a familiar student what was going on.","The student said, “They’re fighting over the clouds!”","“They? Who?”","“His Royal Highness and Night Owl of the Dongsang Kingdom!”","WHAT?!","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","She knew Jun Linyuan and Night Owl would confront each other, but she didn’t know the battle would be so fierce.","People around them were explaining to Elder Wu and Chen Ziyun, “It’s been ten days since His Royal Highness and Night Owl started fighting.","“The clouds were white at first, but as the battle continued, more and more clouds were set on fire!","“Nearly 80% of the clouds are like that already!”","Little Phoenix stood on Feng Wu’s shoulder and looked up at the sky.","Feng Wu couldn’t see anything, but Little Phoenix knew better because it had the fire element.","What it said made Feng Wu’s blood curdle.","“His Royal Highness is covered in blood.”"]},{"number":2967,"title":"Chapter 2967 - Looked Down Upon","paragraphs":["His Royal Highness was covered in blood?","Feng Wu was worried sick.","How was his injury?","She had to find a way to give him the enhancement pill!","Just then, she saw somebody jumping into the air.","Who was that?","She wanted to go up there, too.","However, Elder Wu stopped her before she could do anything.","“What are you doing?”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “I’m going up.”","Up?","Most of the people nearby were Spiritual Kings, and there were also Spiritual Overlords like Elder Wu.","They all frowned when they heard this.","A girl in a green dress scolded Feng Wu. “Go up there? Do you want to get His Royal Highness killed?”","Feng Wu glared at her. “Didn’t someone go up there just now?”","The girl stared at her, her tone even less friendly. “That doesn’t mean you can go up there! Don’t you know the rules?”","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","The rules?","A polite teenager stepped out to calm things down. He said to the green dress girl, “Senior Sister Lan, we’ve never met her before. I think she’s new, so it’s understandable that she doesn’t know the rules.”","He then turned to Feng Wu. “May I have your name?”","Chen Ziyun immediately said, “Senior Brother Yun, she’s Feng Wu, a member of the seeded team. It’s her first time here.”","Senior Brother Yun gave him a knowing look. “That explains everything. Class A students are always new here.”","Senior Sister Lan rolled her eyes at Feng Wu and turned around to look up at Jun Linyuan in the sky. She was very concerned.","Chen Ziyun whispered to Feng Wu, “Senior Sister Lan graduated two years ago, and Senior Brother Yun graduated last year. They both came straight to Peace Grassland after graduation.”","One of the ways for cultivators to climb the social ladder was to come to Peace Grassland after Imperial College. Here, they could accumulate military achievements and earn a higher military rank.","Chen Ziyun then asked, “Senior Brother Yun, what’s going on? Why is His Royal Highness up there? Why is he fighting Night Owl?”","Senior Brother Yun was also watching the battle. He frowned and explained, “The battle started ten days ago.","“Night Owl destroyed a small fortress and asked to duel His Royal Highness. If we didn’t grant his request, he would destroy a small fortress every day until a full-scale war broke out.","“Both sides have three capable cultivators; if they join the war, all hell will break loose, so no one dares do anything.","“His Royal Highness arrived that evening, and the duel started right away in the clouds.","“At first, only one cloud was red, but as the battle continued, half of the sky turned red.","“How did Night Owl make such rapid progress? He wasn’t His Royal Highness’s match before.” Sheng Changtian shook his head.","Senior Brother Yun nodded. “Before, His Royal Highness could finish the battle in one day, but this battle has lasted ten days. I heard from my master that His Royal Highness has a severe injury.”","Feng Wu interjected, “He can’t defeat Night Owl because of that injury!”","Senior Sister Lan found her comment idiotic. “You don’t know sh*t!”"]},{"number":2968,"title":"Chapter 2968 - His Royal Highness Will Win","paragraphs":["Feng Wu stared at Senior Sister Lan in bewilderment.","So did Chen Ziyun and Sheng Changtian.","She didn’t know sh*t?","Excuse me? Judging by the relationship between Feng Wu and His Royal Highness, she might know everything.","Chen Ziyun was about to say something, when Senior Brother Yun tried to mediate again.","“You weren’t here, so you don’t know,” Senior Brother Yun said earnestly. “My master said His Royal Highness is indeed injured, and it is a severe internal injury.","“We didn’t know at first, but the masters saw it when the battle started.","“According to them, His Royal Highness found old Mr. Zuo prior to the battle. Zuo Chengfeng is three levels higher than His Royal Highness, but His Royal Highness burned half of the old master’s body to a crisp.","“That kind of battle is bound to severely injure His Royal Highness!”","Senior Sister Lan ground her teeth. “Why did His Royal Highness challenge Zuo Chengfeng now?”","Chen Ziyun and Sheng Changtian looked at each other.","Could Zuo Qingluan be the reason? Did His Royal Highness take revenge for Feng Wu?","That explained everything!","That was why Feng Wu knew about the injury already!","She knew everything!","Senior Sister Lan kept her gaze on the two tiny figures in the sky. “His Royal Highness will win! I’m sure of it!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why did that person go up there?”","These people kept digressing!","She wanted to know how to go up!","“The person you saw is a Spiritual Overlord from the Dongsang Kingdom,” Senior Sister Lan said reluctantly. “They won, so they can send a person up there.”","They won?","They won what?","Senior Sister Lan’s answer was so vague that Feng Wu was still confused, so she looked at Senior Brother Yun.","Senior Brother Yun lost all his frustration when he met Feng Wu’s beautiful eyes.","“That’s our agreement.” He pointed at an area not far ahead of them. A large group of people had gathered at the border.","“Both sides can send reinforcements up into the sky. No matter how many people either side sends, we must fight a battle to decide which side gets to send its people.","“Apparently, the Dongsang Kingdom won that battle, so one of their Spiritual Overlords flew up.","“The battle is between Spiritual Kings, but a Spiritual Overlord is sent out.","“That’s because Spiritual Kings can’t fly up there.”","Feng Wu frowned. Why was it so complicated?","“What about a spiritual pet?” she asked.","She just wanted to give Jun Linyuan the pill.","Senior Brother Yun shook his head. “That won’t do. The sky above us is controlled by the most powerful cultivators.","“We have the general and two principals, and they have three equally powerful cultivators. All six pairs of eyes are watching over this area. Even an ant will be spotted, let alone a spiritual pet. They’ll be smashed to the ground right away.”","Little Phoenix cringed because it knew Feng Wu had wanted to send it up there.","Feng Wu took a deep breath. So, Little Phoenix wouldn’t do the trick.","Senior Sister Lan glared at Senior Brother Yun. “Save your spit! She’s just an ant!”","Senior Brother Yun seemed to be scared of Senior Sister Lan. He didn’t talk back and only gave Feng Wu an apologetic glance."]},{"number":2969,"title":"Chapter 2969 - Special Method","paragraphs":["Feng Wu ignored Senior Sister Lan. “The battle is fought by Spiritual Kings, is it?”","Senior Brother Yun said, “Yes. The contestants have to be junior Spiritual Kings below 20 years old.”","That was because only young Spiritual Kings of that age had the potential to become capable fighters in the future. Therefore, both the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom paid a lot of attention to Spiritual Kings.","Senior Sister Lan grew impatient.","The girl was so pretty and seemed so worried about His Royal Highness. Lan suddenly felt threatened.","“I told you to shut up!”","She raised her hand, trying to slap Feng Wu.","Holy crap!","The few people who knew better were astonished.","Had this woman lost her mind?","How dare she attack Feng Wu?","...","Chen Ziyun and Sheng Changtian stared at Senior Sister Lan in disbelief.","Although Senior Sister Lan was an outstanding graduate, Feng Wu was the love of His Royal Highness’s life!","There were many talented graduates, but His Royal Highness only had one future wife!","Just then, they heard a crisp sound and were shocked by what they saw.","Somebody was slapped, but it wasn’t Feng Wu. She had slapped Senior Sister Lan instead.","Feng Wu hadn’t slept for ten days and was filled with frustration. She couldn’t stand the provocation anymore.","She didn’t hold back her power as a Level 2 Spiritual King.","Thump!","Senior Sister Lan flew backward.","Everybody stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","Senior Brother Yun was so shocked that he turned to Chen Ziyun in bewilderment. Why was a Class A student so powerful?","Chen Ziyun rubbed his nose. “During the competition against the Military Academy this year, Feng Wu defeated all five opponents, including Sheng Changtian, all by herself.”","Sheng Changtian couldn’t stand the humiliation.","He immediately tried to leave, but the students nearby all heard it, and they all looked at Feng Wu.","One could never tell that the girl was so fierce!","“She’s only 14.” Chen Ziyun feigned an indifferent tone. “She’s only been with us for less than six months.”","Senior Brother Yun was speechless.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","No!","They wouldn’t believe it!","Feng Wu had already walked away.","If only the winner could go up into the sky, she would defeat them all.","Chen Ziyun turned around and saw Feng Wu charging at the border. He immediately ran after her. “Xiao Wu! Wait for me!”","Only then did Senior Sister Lan stumble back to them.","“Where’s that girl?!” Her face was livid.","Everybody saw the mark on her face.","Her hair was disheveled, and her clothes were covered in dirt.","Somebody said, “Feng Wu is heading for the border.”","It was a girl’s voice.","If Feng Wu had been here, she would have recognized the speaker – it was Shan Jingfei.","Senior Sister Lan stormed off toward the border, too.","Was there going to be a battle?","Let’s go!","All the people in the fortress headed for the border, too.","Over the years, the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom had kept their battle to Peace Grassland.","The battle between cultivators was different from that between ordinary soldiers."]},{"number":2970,"title":"Chapter 2970 - Are We Going to Lose?","paragraphs":["They set up many arenas on the border.","Usually, the two sides would engage in five-on-five battles in these arenas to compare the strength of the two forces.","Of course, the Spiritual Saints wouldn’t get involved.","The Spiritual Overlords also felt that they were too important to participate.","Therefore, most of the battles took place between Spiritual Kings, who made up the majority of the cultivators in Peace Grassland.","There were three large arenas on the border.","The one on the left was a junior arena, the one on the right was an intermediate arena, and the one in the middle was an advanced arena.","Level 1 to 3 Spiritual Kings fought on the left.","Level 4 to 6 Spiritual Kings fought on the right.","Level 7 to 9 fought in the middle.","The current battle was taking place in the junior arena.","Feng Wu pushed away the crowd and made it to the front row.","The two sides were fighting.","Two out of the five Junwu cultivators had lost, and there were three more to go.","The Dongsang team had only lost once.","Feng Wu heard the people around her talking.","“Oh no... We’re not going to lose again, are we?”","“The previous one was from the Military Academy, and he lost to the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“This round is between Imperial College and the Dongsang Kingdom. If we lose again,","they’ll send another Spiritual Overlord up there to help Night Owl!”","...","“Look! We’re losing up there!”","“Oh god! They’ve come out of the clouds!”","Feng Wu looked up.","It was incredible!","Jun Linyuan and Night Owl had been fighting in the clouds before, and no one could see how they were doing.","But now, they were fighting a few hundred meters above them, and they could see their every move.","“Gosh! Look at His Royal Highness! His hand is bleeding!”","“There’s a cut on his cheek!”","“Night Owl doesn’t look much better. He’s awfully pale.”","“Shit! That Dongsang Spiritual Overlord tried to sneak up on His Royal Highness!”","“He’ll never succeed!”","“But he can distract His Royal Highness. In a battle like this, one second can make all the difference!”","That was true.","At the thought of that, many people cursed loudly for losing that battle.","“Forget about the last round. We’re losing this one!”","“Why aren’t I a junior Spiritual King?!” Feng Xun was furious.","Xuan Yi was equally frustrated.","They arrived right after Jun Linyuan, but there was nothing they could do.","Another Junwu cultivator fell out of the arena.","“Shit! Not again! Are you trying to get His Royal Highness killed?”","Countless people glared at the contestant that had been kicked off the stage.","The junior Spiritual King was a former student of Imperial College and was chosen because he was under 20."]},{"number":2971,"title":"Chapter 2971 - It’s Her","paragraphs":["“I... I...” The teenager was frustrated and scared.","If His Royal Highness died because of his failure, he would never be able to atone for his crime.","Right now, the Military Academy only had two people left, but the Dongsang Kingdom had four.","“Hahaha —”","The chubby Dongsang teenager on the stage smirked.","“People of the Junwu Empire are useless!","“You lost the last round, and three of your people have been defeated so far.","“Who’s next? Come here and try my fists!”","Many Junwu cultivators wanted to give it a go.","The contestants had been determined beforehand, and they wouldn’t introduce new members in the middle of a battle.","“It’s Senior Brother Min!” Chen Ziyun told Feng Wu. “He graduated two years ago and was the strongest graduate of his year. Don’t worry...”","Feng Wu didn’t care if he used to be the strongest.","She stepped forward and patted Senior Brother Min on the shoulder.","Senior Brother Min turned around, displeased.","Who was bold enough to disturb him now?","The people around them also stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Who was this pretty girl in the red dress?","Of course, they were in the middle of a battle, so they didn’t pay much attention to her beauty.","His Royal Highness’s life was on the line.","The war would also affect the entire Junwu Empire.","“Are you confident you can win?” Feng Wu stared at Senior Brother Min.","Who was this girl?","Senior Brother Min stared at Feng Wu.","Usually, Senior Brother Min would have bellowed at the intruder, but the girl was so pretty and delicate that Senior Brother Min said patiently, “Excuse me, but it’s my turn now.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you sure you can win?”","Hoshimi was shouting on the stage. “Bring it on! I want to punch someone in the face! Stop stalling!”","Having met one another in the arena on a daily basis, all the cultivators were familiar with the language of the other side, especially the curse words.","Senior Brother Min grew impatient because Feng Wu was still blocking his way.","“You’re not certain, are you?” Feng Wu asked.","Senior Brother Min said, “No one can say that for sure, but I’ll do my best...”","Feng Wu cut him off. “Let me do it.”","Huh?","Everybody was dumbfounded.","“What’s with the girl?”","“Where did she come from?”","“Is she from the Military Academy or Imperial College?”","“Can somebody drag her away?”","“She’s pretty, but she doesn’t have a brain.”","...","Feng Wu didn’t care what they said. All she wanted was to win this battle.","She had to give the pill to Jun Linyuan!","She was about to push Senior Brother Min away, when she heard a voice behind her.","“Let me do it.”","It was a cold voice, but it was proud and confident.","What a familiar voice.","Feng Wu turned around and saw her old acquaintance.","Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan had been here for a while. Thanks to her social skills, all the people in the fortress knew her.","They also knew that she came from the Zuo family and was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace.","Moreover, she had True Phoenix Blood.","“Zuo Qingluan?”","“I heard she’s very capable!”","“She has been taught by both the Zuo family and Firmament Palace. With the True Phoenix Blood, she has a much better chance than Min!”"]},{"number":2972,"title":"Chapter 2972 - Hoshimi","paragraphs":["Even Senior Brother Min hesitated.","He looked from Zuo Qingluan to Feng Wu and chose the former.","“In that case...”","Senior Brother Min took a step back.","Everyone else nodded.","Zuo Qingluan was said to be quite capable, so she could increase their chances of winning this battle.","Zuo Qingluan deliberately bumped into Feng Wu when walking past her.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let her win.","She concentrated her spiritual essence on her shoulder when Zuo Qingluan knocked into her.","Thump!","Zuo Qingluan was bounced off.","No!","She couldn’t fall.","Zuo Qingluan stumbled, and it took all her strength to stop herself from falling.","However, everybody saw her stumble, and they all fell silent.","Zuo Qingluan froze.","Her face turned livid.","Feng Wu walked up the stage before Zuo Qingluan could do anything.","“Out of my way!”","Feng Wu pushed Zuo Qingluan out of the way and walked up the stage to face Hoshimi.","All the Junwu cultivators became very nervous.","“Zuo Qingluan accidentally lost her balance when Feng Wu bumped into her, didn’t she?” Everybody thought that way.","“Who on earth is this Feng Wu?” They all whispered to each other.","Most students at the front were from Imperial College, and the Military Academy students were at the back.","The Imperial College students studied Feng Wu’s armband.","Only current students wore that armband. Once they graduated, they would wear a military armband instead.","Therefore —","They immediately saw that she hadn’t graduated yet.","How could she possibly win this battle?","Chen Ziyun was the top student, but even he couldn’t do it.","We’re through!? everybody thought nervously.","The Dongsang Kingdom soon found out what they were talking about, and they were thrilled.","A teenage girl?","What was the Junwu Empire thinking?","Hoshimi looked Feng Wu up and down. “I almost can’t bring myself to hit a pretty girl like you. Why don’t you surrender now?”","Feng Wu felt she had wasted a lot of time, and she had to hurry up.","“Shall we begin?” Feng Wu asked coldly.","Hoshimi was over 100kg, and his physical strength was his strong point.","He grinned viciously. “Of course, but only I get to decide when we finish...”","Hoshimi hadn’t finished talking, when Feng Wu moved.","She leaped into the air and charged at Hoshimi.","She suddenly disappeared from everybody’s sight. The next second, she was in front of Hoshimi.","Hoshimi sensed her terrifying energy, but he didn’t have time to react.","Thump!","Feng Wu kicked him in the mouth before Hoshimi could utter another word.","He flew backward and fell on the ground far away from the arena.","Because of the distance, the thump wasn’t loud.","However, it was very quiet all around."]},{"number":2973,"title":"Chapter 2973 - A Child","paragraphs":["Because it was so quiet, everybody heard the thump.","Ssss —","They all sucked in their breaths.","OMG!","That was...","“Really?”","“Am I hallucinating?”","“She’s wearing the Imperial College armband, isn’t she?”","“That’s right! She doesn’t have a military rank yet because she hasn’t graduated!”","“Does that kick look like she hasn’t graduated?”","Everybody fell silent.","Chen Ziyun was pleased.","Senior Brother Min knew Chen Ziyun, so he asked, “Who is she?”","Senior Brother Min graduated two years ago, but he was still an intermediate Spiritual King.","He was the top student of his year, which just showed how difficult it was to become a Level 2 Spiritual King.","But now —","“Is she really a current student?” Everybody asked Chen Ziyun because they knew he was the current top student.","Chen Ziyun smiled. “That’s right. Xiao Wu only joined the War Academy six months ago, and she skipped four grades in that time. She also joined the seeded team and led our team in the competition, where she defeated the Military Academy team.”","“What? We won?”","“Aren’t you the top student? Why did she lead the team?”","...","Chen Ziyun gloated. “Why couldn’t she lead the team? She’s only 14, but she’s already a Level 2 Spiritual King. How about that? She has my utmost admiration.”","The crowd was speechless.","Although they didn’t like Chen Ziyun’s tone...","14 years old?","A Level 2 Spiritual King?","Was she even human?","“She’s only 14?!”","“She does seem young, but a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","“We’ve graduated for so long, and I’m still... Gosh, I want to kill myself!”","These people had always considered themselves geniuses, but when they compared themselves with Feng Wu, they felt like hanging themselves.","Hearing all the discussion, Zuo Qingluan felt humiliated.","She was older than Feng Wu.","She took a deep breath and told herself to calm down. Feng Wu was going to turn herself into a laughing stock!","She was only the fourth contestant. Once she lost, Zuo Qingluan would go up and save the day!","That was Zuo Qingluan’s wish, but would things turn out that way?","Feng Wu ignored all the noise.","What they said didn’t concern her.","She just wanted to win and save Jun Linyuan.","She never knew she could care so much about someone who wasn’t her beautiful master.","Since when did she care about Jun Linyuan as much as she did Qiuling, who had grown up with her?","Feng Wu cleared her mind and looked up.","The Dongsang Kingdom had sent their third contestant.","It was a teenage girl.","Dressed in a leather jacket and a leather skirt, the girl had a tiny waist and amazing curves.","Her face looked rather young.","Her attitude was quite arrogant the moment she walked onto the stage."]},{"number":2974,"title":"Chapter 2974 - What to Do?","paragraphs":["She stared at Feng Wu and said coldly, “You’ve defeated Hoshimi, so I guess you have some skills, but that’s not enough.”","Feng Wu didn’t have time for this.","“Let’s begin!”","She charged at the girl.","“How careless!” The girl smirked.","She raised her staff and started chanting.","Ice began to form in the air.","The Dongsang cultivators were pleased, while the Junwu Empire cultivators grew anxious.","This teenage girl was more powerful than Hoshimi.","“She’s a peak Level 2 Spiritual King!”","“A peak Level 2 Spiritual King?!”","“What should we do? Is Feng Wu a junior or intermediate Level 2 Spiritual King?”","“This is so frustrating. We have peak Level 2 Spiritual Kings, but the age limit makes it so hard to find any!”","“All the Dongsang weapons have inscriptions that suit the users. That staff has inscriptions, too!","“The inscriptions increase the power of her ice by 20%!”","“20% on top of being a peak Level 2 Spiritual King? That’s impossible!”","They all panicked.","Even Chen Ziyun grew anxious.","Feng Wu had defeated Sheng Changtian, but this girl was a Level 2 Spiritual King with a 20% increase in her power. What was Feng Wu going to do?","Ice was forming rapidly.","In less than a second, there was a giant ice ball in front of the girl.","“Explode!","“Go!”","The ice ball exploded when Feng Wu was ten meters away.","Everybody saw the ice blades surround Feng Wu.","She was trapped inside the confined space.","The Junwu Empire cultivators held their breaths.","Those ice blades could destroy Feng Wu’s face!","Was the genius girl going to be killed?","The teenage girl smirked, and so did the other Dongsang cultivators.","Feng Wu didn’t make any unnecessary moves.","“Ground Control!","“Reflect!","“Fallen Star Sword!”","No one thought Feng Wu could control the flying ice blades.","Not only did she do that, she also made them fly back.","WHAT?!","The Dongsang girl froze.","By the time she realized what had happened, the ice blades were only inches away.","“Dissipate!","“Now!”","Even so, a few blades still flew past her cheek.","Her smooth skin was cut open, and blood trickled down her cheek.","That wasn’t all.","While she was busy handling the ice blades, the Fallen Star Sword reached her tiny neck.","The girl straightened her back and stopped moving.","She stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","“You...” She couldn’t form a sentence.","How could this be?","She knew Feng Wu hadn’t graduated yet, but since when could a current student defeat her?","She wasn’t the only one that was surprised.","Meanwhile —"]},{"number":2975,"title":"Chapter 2975 - Fight","paragraphs":["Many Junwu Empire cultivators were astonished.","The next second, they realized what had happened, and they shouted at the top of their lungs.","“Good!”","“That’s great!”","“Feng Wu is awesome!”","...","If Feng Wu moved her Fallen Star Sword one inch further, she would cut the girl’s throat open.","The girl trembled nervously.","She could easily lose her life now.","“Get lost.” Feng Wu put down her sword.","“Are you not going to kill me?” The girl was surprised.","Feng Wu had no personal issues with the girl, and she knew the girl was very popular in the Dongsang Kingdom. Killing her would only cause more problems.","Feng Wu only wanted to win this battle and send the pill to Jun Linyuan.","“Do you want to die?” Feng Wu stared at the girl.","She didn’t know this, but when her face darkened, she reminded other people of the crown prince.","The girl immediately jumped off the stage.","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","The girl was called Sakurin and she was quite popular among the Dongsang teenagers.","She quickly disappeared into the crowd.","She was looking for someone.","One of her senior brothers was Fuhara, a man of little words but an outstanding swordsman.","Fuhara was trying to become a Level 4 Spiritual King.","He would be 20 years old in a day.","After that, he wouldn’t be qualified to fight in the junior arena anymore.","Sakurin ran as fast as she could.","“Fuhara, don’t make the breakthrough just yet!”","Feng Wu remained on the stage and said impatiently, “Where are the Dongsang cultivators? Hurry up!”","The Dongsang cultivators were so shocked that they hadn’t decided who to send next.","Feng Wu frowned. “I’m in a rush! Hurry up!”","In a rush?","Everybody looked up at the sky.","The battle between Night Owl and Jun Linyuan had reached a critical moment.","The Spiritual Overlord beside Night Owl was ready to ambush Jun Linyuan at any moment.","Stalling would only help the Dongsang Kingdom.","Hence, the Junwu Empire cultivators tried to provoke their enemy.","“Weren’t you so confident before? Where’s your next contestant?”","“Are you scared of Feng Wu?”","“You’re all cowards!”","...","The Dongsang cultivators were furious.","“I’ll do it!”","A strong teenager stepped out of the crowd.","He was so strong that each of his steps shook the ground.","His weapon was a rod that had some patterns on it.","The Dongsang Kingdom was very generous with inscriptions, and this Spiritual King also had his own inscribed weapon.","“I’m Solai, a junior Level 3 Spiritual King.”","Solai pointed his rod at Feng Wu.","A Level 3 Spiritual King...","Although he was also a junior Spiritual King, he was a whole level higher than Feng Wu.","The Junwu Empire cultivators fell silent.","They grew anxious.","“He’s a level higher, and the inscription can amplify his power by 20%...”","“Will Feng Wu be alright?”","Feng Wu wasn’t worried about herself at all.","When she saw the blood on Jun Linyuan’s face, her sight seemed to turn red.","“Bring it on!”","Feng Wu started the battle without giving her enemy any time to react."]},{"number":2976,"title":"Chapter 2976 - Surrender","paragraphs":["Feng Wu didn’t give her opponent any time to react.","Frankly speaking, Solai was a capable fighter.","He was a Level 3 Spiritual King, and a junior Level 2 Spiritual King couldn’t possibly withstand his power.","Luckily, Feng Wu wasn’t an ordinary junior Level 2 Spiritual King.","The battle started, and she exerted as much power as Solai did.","“Wow, Xiao Wu is an intermediate Level 2 Spirit King now!”","Sheng Changtian was shocked.","Was this Feng Wu even human?","She was too powerful to be one!","He had met her ten days ago when she had just risen to Level 2.","It had only been ten days, and she was making progress again!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","They exchanged blows in mid-air.","Feng Wu didn’t exert her full power during the competition with the Military Academy, but she needed to send the pill to Jun Linyuan, so she spared no effort in the battle.","She immediately used her most lethal stances.","Each strike was more powerful than the previous one.","Solai was astonished.","This shouldn’t be happening.","He was a whole level higher than her and had exerted his full power, but he still couldn’t take her down.","Solai’s eyes glinted.","He had to defeat her for the sake of the Dongsang Kingdom’s dignity.","Therefore!","He moved his rod even faster.","Several times, he almost hit Feng Wu in the head, but she dodged the strike every single time.","Ten minutes had passed, and neither of them was winning.","“OMG! Feng Wu has held on for so long!”","“She’s a level lower than him. That shows how much potential she has!”","“Have you forgotten? There are inscriptions on Solai’s weapon. He’s 20% more powerful than he really is!”","“Look! He’s exerting that power!”","Solai smirked.","He stared at Feng Wu. “You’re good, but I’m better!","“You’ve been able to fend me off despite being a Level 2 Spiritual King. I can see your potential.","“However, you shouldn’t have revealed it here.","“The Dongsang Kingdom will never let a genius like you grow up!”","Everybody heard those words.","Sh*t!","Cultivators of the Junwu Empire were frustrated.","Were they going to kill their genius girl?","“You should have killed Sakurin. That way, you would have at least taken out one enemy, but you were too merciful.","“Do you think that’ll stop me from killing you?","“Get ready to die,” Solai said gloomily.","Feng Xun realized something was wrong, so he shouted, “Feng Wu, come off the stage! Now!”","If she gave up, Solai wouldn’t be allowed to kill her.","Many people also realized that Solai wanted to kill this young genius.","Everybody tried to get Feng Wu back.","“Feng Wu, just give up!”","“You can always win the next battle!”","“Don’t throw your life away!”","...","Feng Xun wanted to drag Feng Wu off the stage, but he couldn’t do that.","The contestants had to leave the stage willingly, and no one was allowed to intervene, unless the three bosses came here in person.","“It’s too late.”","Solai grinned again before Feng Wu could say anything. It was an eerie smile."]},{"number":2977,"title":"Chapter 2977 - Lovely Angel","paragraphs":["Feng Wu also smiled, and it looked almost like Solai’s.","“Do you know why you’re going to die?”","Feng Wu suddenly drew out her Fallen Star Sword.","Solai had leaped up and was smashing down at Feng Wu’s forehead with his inscribed rod.","Feng Wu said, “The second stance of the Fallen Star Sword!","“Dancing Dragon In the Moonlight!”","Speed made all the difference.","Feng Wu was moving as fast as Solai, an intermediate Level 3 Spiritual King.","However!","No one saw it coming when Feng Wu suddenly picked up her speed.","She was only a little faster than Solai.","The difference was only 0.001 seconds, but that was all she needed.","It was like a slow-motion picture.","Fallen Star Sword slashed through the air, and Solai was cut in half at his waist.","The upper part of his body fell to the left, and the lower to the right.","He was in two pieces, and blood gushed out.","The rod that he was so proud of made a loud clank as it dropped onto the ground.","Solai’s eyes were wide open, as if he didn’t understand what had happened.","Everybody fell silent.","Cultivators on both sides stared at Feng Wu as if she had grown wings.","She had been a little faster than Solai just then.","She...","“She’s a senior Level 2 Spiritual King now...” said someone in the crowd.","A senior Level 2 Spiritual King?","Wasn’t she only a junior one just then? How did she reach the senior level during a battle?","It was so unfair!","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom couldn’t accept it, while people of the Junwu Empire were perplexed.","Feng Wu looked into Solai’s eyes and answered the question she asked.","“You’re dead because you talk too much,” said Feng Wu.","He talked too much?","People of the Junwu Empire wanted to laugh, whereas the people of the Dongsang Kingdom wanted to cry.","That was outrageous!","No, that wasn’t important. The important thing was that Feng Wu had won!","She really had killed Solai.","“How can a Level 2 Spiritual King kill a Level 3 Spiritual King?”","The Dongsang cultivators fell silent.","Why were there different levels?","That was because the difference in strength between levels was huge.","There were cases where a cultivator of a lower level defeated someone of a higher level, but the lower one would be severely injured during the battle.","However...","They looked at Feng Wu.","Her face was smooth and clean, and not one hair was out of place.","How frustrating!","Feng Wu frowned at the Dongsang people. “Don’t you have one last contestant? What are you waiting for?”","She was in a hurry to deliver the pill.","The Junwu cultivators realized something.","They had been so frustrated before Feng Wu came.","They had lost the first round and seemed to be losing this round. They were panic-stricken.","It wasn’t that they were weaker than the other side, but the rule required the contestants to be junior Spiritual Kings below 20 years old.","It was hard to achieve, but that was the rule.","It was a battle of potential.","They had capable junior Spiritual Kings, but they were all older than 20.","The Dongsang people had said the most humiliating things, and the Junwu cultivators had been so frustrated.","Then, Feng Wu arrived.","She was the loveliest angel!","Seeing that things had turned around, they started taunting the Dongsang Kingdom."]},{"number":2978,"title":"Chapter 2978 - We’re Doomed","paragraphs":["“What’s wrong with you? Did you send your weakest cultivators? None of them could put up a fight!”","“That’s right! Xiao Wu cut that man in half with one strike. Do you have tougher members?”","“Is that all you’ve got? There’s not much potential there, is there?”","...","They enjoyed taunting their opponents because it helped them vent their rage.","They needed to show off.","The Dongsang cultivators looked at one another in frustration.","Several people wanted to go up the stage until they saw the Fallen Star Sword, which was still dripping blood.","They rubbed their abdomen when they saw Solai carried off the stage in parts.","How scary!","Were there more Level 3 Spiritual Kings?","Yes, there were, but they didn’t dare go up the stage.","Feng Wu looked up at Jun Linyuan and Night Owl’s fierce battle.","Each blow could be a lethal one.","Why were those people still stalling?","Feng Wu said impatiently, “Is that all you’ve got?”","The Dongsang Kingdom people were furious.","Feng Wu said, “If you can’t find anyone, just give up! Stop wasting my time!”","The Dongsang Kingdom didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “Stop staring and send someone up here!”","Hoshimi’s face was livid.","His friend was about to go up the stage, when Sakurin ran toward them, shouting, “Wait!”","They all looked at her.","Sakurin shouted as she ran, “Senior Brother Fuhara is here!”","“Fuhara Tsuba?”","“That peak Level 3 Spiritual King?”","“Gosh! It really is him! I thought he went into seclusion,” said Hoshimi.","They were of similar cultivation levels and fought in the same circle, so they knew each other well.","Everybody knew how capable Fuhara was.","Many Junwu Empire cultivators fell silent when they heard the name.","“No way!”","“Why is he here?”","“I thought he went into seclusion and wasn’t going to participate in this battle!”","Seeing their frustration, Chen Ziyun asked what they were talking about.","He had just become a Spiritual King and hadn’t been qualified to watch the battle until now.","Senior Brother Min looked like he was going to cry. “We’re doomed.”","Chen Ziyun asked, “Why? Tell me!”","Senior Brother Min said, “Fuhara is the ultimate winner in the junior arena. He has won 100 battles on that stage!”","Chen Ziyun said, “100?”","Senior Brother Min said, “That’s not all. Whenever he participates, the other four members are never needed. He can defeat all our five members on his own.","“He has done it 100 times!","“He has defeated almost all of us.","“In other words, Fuhara is invincible here in the junior arena!","“He only went into seclusion because he was bored defeating us all the time. He was trying to become an intermediate Spiritual King and fight in the intermediate arena.","“None of us are his match. We’re doomed!”"]},{"number":2979,"title":"Chapter 2979 - Protest","paragraphs":["“What?” Chen Ziyun turned pale.","Was Fuhara really that capable?","What about Feng Wu?","“If they win this round, they’ll send another one up, and His Royal Highness...”","A Spiritual Overlord usually wouldn’t affect the crown prince, but he was injured now, and Night Owl was also an extremely capable cultivator.","That was very bad news!","People of the Junwu Empire couldn’t imagine what would happen.","Senior Brother Min protested, “That’s not fair! Fuhara promised he wouldn’t fight in the junior arena anymore!”","Other students of the Imperial College realized that, too.","That was right!","Fuhara had indeed said that, and his tone had been full of disdain.","They all raised their hands to protest.","Fuhara smirked.","He walked steadily toward the arena until he was on the stage.","He glanced at the cultivators of the Junwu Empire and smirked. “Protest? Your protest isn’t worth sh*t!","“I’ll fight in whichever arena I want!","“Only the weak protest. Strong men speak with their fists!”","Fuhara waved his fists in the air.","Teenagers of the Junwu Empire flushed.","“Only the weak protest”?","What irony!","They didn’t want to protest, but Feng Wu couldn’t possibly win!","Feng Wu frowned at Fuhara. “Are you done talking yet?”","Fuhara looked at her in bewilderment.","Feng Wu explained, “The person before you died because he talked too much.”","Fuhara was surprised at first, but he soon realized what Feng Wu meant.","Was the pretty girl telling him that she was going to kill him?","Fuhara laughed arrogantly.","He looked at Feng Wu. “I admit that many people are more talented than I am. At my age, they’ve already reached the intermediate arena. However...”","He glared at Feng Wu. “Here in the junior arena, I’m the king!","“Anybody who tries to defeat me will end up in a box!","“You’re so pretty that I almost feel sorry to kill you.","“I can spare your life for your pretty face, but you...”","Feng Wu lost her patience before he could finish.","“I told you already,” Feng Wu said coldly.","What?","Fuhara was perplexed. What had she told him?","Feng Wu made her move before Fuhara could figure out the answer.","This time, she didn’t spare any effort, because she needed to finish the battle as soon as possible.","“Ground Control!","“Fallen Star Sword!","“Little Phoenix, use your fire!”","...","She exerted all her strength and used all her stances on Fuhara.","Fuhara was smirking at first, but the smirk was soon wiped off his face.","Because!","Thump!","He was overwhelmed by Feng Wu’s power.","Half of the stage collapsed, and Fuhara fell to the ground.","There was a moment of silence, and everybody looked from Feng Wu to Fuhara, who was buried under a pile of rocks.","Had Fuhara lost?","Just like that?","Just then, the pile of rocks stirred."]},{"number":2980,"title":"Chapter 2980 - OMG","paragraphs":["The pile of rocks exploded, and Fuhara flew out.","His clothes were burnt, and his eyebrows and hair were almost gone.","He had been so handsome before, but he was in a mess now.","Everybody was astonished, but Fuhara was the most astonished one.","He had never thought the girl’s attack would work.","She seemed to be a Spiritual King, but could she be deceiving him?","There was blood on his cheek.","“Aren’t you a Level 2 Spiritual King?” He stared at Feng Wu.","Instead of answering him, Feng Wu drew out her Fallen Star Sword.","Sword energy filled the air and charged at Fuhara.","Fuhara smirked.","He also used a sword.","He tightened his grip, and frightening power came out of his body.","He pointed the sword at Feng Wu, and the air around him rippled.","What kind of power was that?","“Sh*t!”","Senior Brother Min turned pale and cried out in surprise.","The other people of the Junwu Empire also panicked.","“What’s going on?! What’s going on?!”","Seeing how nervous they were, Chen Ziyun was so scared that his heart skipped a beat.","“That’s the swordplay known as Dragon Power!” Senior Brother Min’s lips quivered.","The others nodded, all looking extremely nervous.","“Fuhara used Dragon Power to defeat all his past opponents!” Senior Brother Min said bitterly. “Everyone of us has lost to that swordplay!”","Chen Ziyun looked at the others, and they all nodded at him.","Everyone... Chen Ziyun’s heart sank.","He wasn’t alone. Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were both shaken.","They looked at the battle in the clouds and then at Feng Wu’s fight, feeling so nervous that their hearts were jumping out of their mouths.","Dragon Power gave off a blinding red light, which charged at Feng Wu.","Would she be able to evade it?","Fuhara was a peak Level 3 Spiritual King!","There was no way that Feng Wu could evade the attack.","No way!","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. She was moving as fast as she could.","However —","She finally experienced the difference in capability between the two cultivation levels.","No matter how fast she moved, she still couldn’t move faster than Fuhara.","Whoosh!","Feng Wu was hit in the shoulder, and blood stained the front of her clothes.","“Xiao Wu!”","“Gosh! Xiao Wu is injured!”","“I knew it! She can’t beat Fuhara!”","Fuhara smirked.","“You’re not so arrogant now, are you?","“Don’t you know how many battles I’ve won so far?","“You’re very pretty. A genius is meant to die young!”","Fuhara was never going to let Feng Wu live.","He concentrated his energy on the tip of his sword again and frantically charged at Feng Wu.","The blades flashed, and the light was blinding.","Gosh!","Everybody was too nervous to breathe.","Was Feng Wu dead?","Fuhara’s Dragon Power had always been invincible in this arena.","After the attack ended, Fuhara landed on the ground. The others cried out when they looked at Feng Wu.","“Sh*t!”"]},{"number":2981,"title":"Chapter 2981 - Feng Xun in Tears","paragraphs":["“OMG!”","“Xiao Wu...”","Feng Wu was covered in wounds.","Her clothes were stained with blood.","No one could tell how many times the sword had cut her because her dress was soaked.","She looked like she had been showered with blood.","The blood even dripped on the ground like raindrops.","Feng Wu had the soft armor, but it could only cover her torso and keep her internal organs safe.","The rest of her body wasn’t protected.","Oh god...","Feng Xun burst into tears.","Xuan Yi’s eyes were bloodshot red, and he wanted to tear Fuhara into pieces.","However, it was a life-or-death battle.","No matter how furious they were, there was nothing they could do before Feng Wu came off the stage.","It looked so painful.","Everybody felt sorry for Feng Wu.","She was so pretty and so talented.","How could that man hurt her like this?","Their eyes burned with hatred, and they wanted to fight the Dongsang Kingdom to the death.","Only two people were pleased to see this.","One was Shan Jingfei, and the other one was Zuo Qingluan.","They thought Feng Wu was going to die.","In the end, the Dongsang Kingdom would defeat Feng Wu.","How exciting!","Feng Wu touched her face, and her hand came back covered with blood.","She knew she was injured.","Blood was oozing out from every part of her body.","If she could eat that enhancement pill now, her bleeding would stop, and she would recover in no time.","Of course, she couldn’t do that.","Feng Wu stared at Fuhara.","Countless people were shouting at her, telling her to give up and come off the stage.","Feng Wu couldn’t hear them anymore.","She only stared at Fuhara.","Give up?","Were they asking her to watch Jun Linyuan die?","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","What a pity.","When Jun Linyuan and her switched souls, he had accumulated a lot of spiritual essence for her, but it was almost used up.","During the battle against Sheng Changtian, she used it to rise to Level 2 of the Spiritual King stage.","She used what was left to raise her capability.","“A peak Level 2 Spiritual King?”","Everybody thought Feng Wu was going to give up, but energy burst out of her, and she rose to the peak of Level 2.","How was that possible?","She was in the middle of a battle, and it wasn’t long ago before Feng Wu was a junior Level 2 Spiritual King.","Would she make a breakthrough and reach Level 3?","Unfortunately, that didn’t happen.","Feng Wu only had enough spiritual essence to go this far.","She stared at Fuhara. “Bring it on!”","A terrifying burst of energy came out of her body.","Fuhara stared at Feng Wu.","He had thought about letting Feng Wu surrender because he had severely injured her. However, instead of giving up, she was ready for another round.","Hadn’t she had enough of his Dragon Power?","In that case, she could go to hell.","“Dragon Power!","“Inscription!","“Now!”","The inscriptions on the Dragon Power Sword were much more advanced than on other people’s weapons.","Instead of 20%, it could amplify his power by 30%!"]},{"number":2982,"title":"Chapter 2982 - Write Inscriptions","paragraphs":["Fuhara smirked.","If she wasn’t afraid of death, she could die!","What Fuhara didn’t know was how perceptive Feng Wu was.","Fuhara’s first attack was indeed successful.","Feng Wu could have avoided it, but she didn’t because she wanted to end this battle sooner.","She had to send the pill to Jun Linyuan.","Therefore, she used her own body to test Fuhara’s attack.","More precisely, she was examining his stances.","Why was Fuhara’s Dragon Power invincible among his peers?","The most important reason was the inscriptions on the sword.","His stances also contained a formation.","Feng Wu discovered the pattern of those stances at the price of being injured.","Therefore, when Fuhara used the same stance this time...","“Break!”","Feng Wu parried the attack despite being a level lower than Fuhara.","Boom!","There was an explosion, and smoke filled the air.","“No!”","“Xiao Wu!”","“Don’t die!”","“Fuhara, I’m gonna kill you!”","Countless people shouted and screamed.","They all thought Feng Wu was dead.","When the smoke dissipated, they saw Feng Wu lying on the ground, covered in blood, but Fuhara didn’t look any better.","He was also lying on the ground.","His sword had flown several meters away.","Fuhara stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“You broke my attack!” Fuhara looked like he had seen a ghost.","The crowd was dumbfounded.","WHAT?!","Feng Wu broke Fuhara’s attack?","How could this be?","No one had been able to withstand Dragon Power because it was like a whirlpool that could suck people in before backfiring on them with double the energy.","That was why no one had been able to counteract it.","Feng Wu rose to her feet in difficulty and walked toward Fuhara.","After the initial astonishment passed, Fuhara had a murderous look in his eyes.","He couldn’t stand it that somebody had broken his attack.","He reached for his sword but found nothing.","What was going on?","When he looked at Feng Wu, he saw that she was holding the sword.","Feng Wu took a brush out of her pocket.","A brush?","Everybody looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","What was that brush for?","Did she want to write something?","Feng Wu started writing.","Everybody could read the words she was writing, but they couldn’t understand the whole sentence.","“Are those inscriptions?” Somebody recognized them.","“Inscriptions? They can’t be. Inscription masters always carve their inscriptions one stroke at a time. It takes them days to finish a word.”","“That’s right! I remember that, too! Feng Wu is just writing.”","“What’s she writing on Fuhara’s sword?”","“Didn’t Fuhara say he’s invincible? Maybe Feng Wu is writing that he isn’t.”","“Dude, stop joking! Feng Wu isn’t Fuhara’s match.”","...","Not only the crowd but Fuhara was also astonished.","Inscriptions?","Did she really think she was writing inscriptions?","Fuhara could stop Feng Wu, but he didn’t.","He only crossed his arms and smirked at Feng Wu. He wanted to see what she was writing.","He was thinking about how to laugh at her later."]},{"number":2983,"title":"Chapter 2983 - A Round Head","paragraphs":["While Fuhara was getting ready to laugh at Feng Wu, Feng Wu had finished writing on the sword.","She then glanced at Fuhara. “Let’s begin.”","Begin?","Begin what?","Fuhara looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t be daft. The battle isn’t over yet.”","Fuhara stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Are you not giving up?”","Fuhara retrieved his sword and glanced at it.","He thought Feng Wu would write something meaningful.","Looking closer, he realized they were strange symbols.","They looked like inscriptions, but he couldn’t recognize any of them.","“Give up?”","Feng Wu looked up at the sky, and when she looked at Fuhara again, her face was grim.","“Let’s begin!”","Feng Wu charged at Fuhara like a small tornado.","Fuhara smirked.","“Feng Wu, you must have a death wish!","“Die!","“Dragon Power!","“Die!”","Fuhara aimed at Feng Wu’s forehead with the tip of his sword.","He exerted all his power.","Dragon Power was a ferocious swordplay.","The inscriptions just amplified the power.","Everything felt like an explosion.","Feng Wu also spared no effort.","“Oh, no!”","“Feng Wu can’t dodge this one!”","“She should have given up when she had the chance!”","“She’s doomed!”","...","The people of the Junwu Empire were so worried, but the people of the Dongsang Kingdom were over the moon.","When the blades clashed, sparks flew everywhere.","There was dense smoke.","Where was Feng Wu’s head?","People of the Dongsang Kingdom looked around, trying to see if Fuhara had cut off Feng Wu’s head.","They couldn’t find anything.","When the smoke dissipated, they realized in surprise that everything was still the same.","Feng Wu’s head was still on her neck, but they couldn’t say the same about Fuhara.","Fuhara’s head rolled off his neck and bounced around on the ground.","“Ahhh!!!”","Many people screamed.","People of the Dongsang Kingdom were astonished.","So were the people of the Junwu Empire.","They all followed the head with their eyes as it rolled down the stairs until it stopped by their feet.","The eyes were still wide open.","That mouth had only just told Feng Wu to die.","As it turned out, he was the decapitated one.","What was wrong with this world?","They couldn’t believe their eyes!","How could this happen?","They looked from Fuhara’s head to Feng Wu.","That girl...","Was she even human?","“Isn’t she a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","“Isn’t Fuhara a Level 3 Spiritual King?”","“Didn’t Fuhara severely injure her?”","“And...”","They didn’t know what to say because it was too incredible.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi looked at each other, and were both relieved.","Feng Wu was still that genius girl who could defeat opponents who had higher levels than her.","Feng Wu glanced at the sword on the ground.","It was the sword that Fuhara had been proud of.","She had changed the inscriptions on it.","The sword was rendered useless, and Dragon Power wouldn’t harm her in the slightest way.","Feng Wu looked up at the sky again."]},{"number":2984,"title":"Chapter 2984 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu looked up at the sky.","Right now, Jun Linyuan and Night Owl’s battle had reached a critical moment.","Night Owl struck Jun Linyuan in the stomach, and Jun Linyuan stabbed him in return.","Both of them were covered with blood and wobbled around in the sky, but neither stopped fighting.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Because both of them were drained, the Spiritual Overlord next to Night Owl became more important in this battle.","He stood behind Jun Linyuan, trying to ambush the crown prince.","“D*mn it!”","Feng Wu gripped the pill and looked at Elder Wu.","Everybody from the Junwu Empire was worried for Jun Linyuan, and Elder Wu was no exception.","He walked up to Feng Wu, but she spoke first. “Elder Wu, do you think you can take the Spiritual Overlord?”","Elder Wu hesitated, then shook his head. “That man’s called Meaty Monk. He’s a level higher than me.”","Of course, Feng Wu wanted to hand Jun Linyuan the pill herself, but she couldn’t do that.","Her cultivation level was nowhere near the Spiritual Overlord stage. Doing that would only get Jun Linyuan killed.","Feng Wu handed the enhancement pill to Elder Wu and whispered something in his ear.","Elder Wu stared at her in disbelief.","She had a Semi-Divine enhancement pill!","Feng Wu said, “You don’t have to defeat that Meaty Monk. The most important thing is to let Jun Linyuan take this pill.”","Once Jun Linyuan recovered, even ten Spiritual Overlords put together wouldn’t be his match.","He had to make a recovery!","Elder Wu had never appeared so serious before.","“Good!”","He had made up his mind. He would do anything to hand the pill to Jun Linyuan, even if it cost him his life.","“Tell him I made it, or he probably won’t believe you,” Feng Wu instructed Elder Wu.","At this critical moment, Jun Linyuan needed to focus on the battle, so he chose not to trust anybody.","Elder Wu was about to fly into the air, and he stumbled when he heard that.","He turned around and gave her a strange look.","She made it?","The girl really knew how to brag.","Feng Wu urged him, “Go! We don’t have time to waste!”","Elder Wu wanted to lecture her, but that had to wait.","After the battle, he would teach the girl not to lie.","Elder Wu flew into the air like an arrow.","The people of the Junwu Empire were relieved.","Finally, they won this round.","Only then did they have time to discuss what was going on.","“I can’t figure out why His Royal Highness hasn’t defeated Night Owl yet. He’s so powerful!”","“His Royal Highness is losing.”","“I heard His Royal Highness fought with somebody before this and was injured.”","“Which idiot did that?”","“Be careful. If they could injure His Royal Highness, they have to be very capable, too.”","“What? I...”","“I heard it was Zuo Chengfeng, the old master of the Zuo family!”","“What? Isn’t that Zuo Qingluan’s family?”"]},{"number":2985,"title":"Chapter 2985 - Anxiety","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened when she heard the discussion.","She had been so satisfied with how things were going until now, and had expected to see Feng Wu dead.","However, Feng Wu’s achievement slapped her in the face once more.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to sneak off when that incident was brought up again.","She had no choice but to defend herself.","She said, “His Royal Highness went to challenge my grandfather.”","“Why did His Royal Highness do that?” somebody asked.","Zuo Qingluan said, “To improve his cultivation ability, I guess?”","She couldn’t even convince herself.","Feng Xun smirked. “Why do you think Night Owl suddenly attacked us? Could he have learned of Boss Jun’s injury in advance?”","Wow!","The others hadn’t thought about that possibility until now, and what Feng Xun said made some sense.","If that were true, it would be a major issue.","Zuo Qingluan flushed and glared at Feng Xun. “That’s pure slander!”","Feng Xun said, “His Majesty will find out what really happened.”","Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched.","Night Owl launched the attack as soon as Jun Linyuan was injured. Could her grandfather really have leaked the information?","She was frustrated.","If it really were her grandfather’s doing, would the crown prince ever forgive her?","Would she still be able to marry him?","“Look!”","Someone cried out.","Everybody looked up at the sky.","In mid-air, Elder Wu tried to approach Jun Linyuan, but Night Owl’s attack turned even fiercer, and the crown prince kept falling back.","Pffft!","Jun Linyuan spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Sh*t!”","Everybody freaked out.","His Royal Highness was injured again, and it was even more severe than before!","Night Owl’s sword went right through Jun Linyuan’s chest.","What was Elder Wu doing?","Feng Wu felt she was going crazy.","She wished she could go up there and deliver the pill herself.","Elder Wu finally made his move.","He had been fighting Meaty Monk, and he feigned an opening.","Meaty Monk punched him in the back.","Elder Wu let that happen despite the possibility that he might be severely injured.","He used the momentum to dash to Jun Linyuan’s side.","When they brushed past each other, Elder Wu threw the pill at the crown prince.","“It’s from Feng Wu!”","Fearing that Jun Linyuan wouldn’t believe him, Elder Wu shouted at the top of his lungs.","Night Owl had very sharp eyes.","At this close range, he immediately recognized the pill.","“A Semi-Divine enhancement pill!” Night Owl’s eyes turned red.","That was an extremely rare pill.","Even in the Dongsang Kingdom, where medical technology was much more advanced, such a pill was still hard to come by.","This particular pill could do wonders in curing injuries.","Night Owl panicked.","If Jun Linyuan took the pill, his internal injuries would recover.","He wouldn’t let that happen!","Night Owl turned into a ball of fire and hurled himself at Jun Linyuan.","He didn’t spare any strength.","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes.","He was about to get hold of the pill, when the box was knocked away by Night Owl’s weapon.","Elder Wu’s eyes widened.","That pill could change the course of this battle!"]},{"number":2986,"title":"Chapter 2986 - Is He Alive?","paragraphs":["Elder Wu spat out a mouthful of blood.","The battle had reached a critical moment, and Feng Wu was so anxious.","Night Owl was fighting like there was no tomorrow.","Jun Linyuan deliberately slowed down and finally grabbed the pill.","“I won’t let you take it!” Night Owl bellowed.","He would never let Jun Linyuan have that chance, because Jun Linyuan was so frightening.","If he regained his strength, he would destroy the nearby city in his rage.","“Die!”","Night Owl shouted like a crazy person.","He locked Jun Linyuan in his arms, and streaks of golden light surrounded him.","The concentrated energy then exploded.","Boom!?","“Your Royal Highness!”","People from both the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom cried out for their princes.","No one had thought Night Owl would become so frantic.","He no longer cared about his own safety and wanted to perish together with Jun Linyuan.","Only the most dauntless person could do such a thing to himself.","Everything seemed to happen in slow motion.","Feng Wu saw Night Owl wrap his arms around Jun Linyuan.","Then there was a big explosion.","The impact sent Night Owl and Jun Linyuan flying in opposite directions.","What Feng Wu saw made her eyes turn red.","“Night Owl, you’re going to pay for this!”","Feng Wu glared at Night Owl and wanted to tear him into pieces.","However, Jun Linyuan was her top priority.","Before anybody realized what had happened, Feng Wu dashed off and caught Jun Linyuan before he fell to the ground.","He fell fast, but she caught him in mid-air and spun in the air to counteract the momentum. She only landed when their movements slowed down.","The whole process took less than a second.","The others still hadn’t realized what had happened.","Night Owl wasn’t as lucky.","Thump!","The Dongsang prince made a human-shaped pit in the ground.","“Your Royal Highness!”","The Dongsang people rushed toward Night Owl.","Feng Wu held Jun Linyuan in her arms.","She burst into tears when she saw his condition.","If Jun Linyuan weren’t in need of urgent treatment, she would have cut Night Owl into little pieces.","Jun Linyuan’s handsome face was blackened by the smoke.","The explosion had opened a big hole in his abdomen.","Nearly every inch of his body was burned.","Night Owl!","Feng Wu glared at the man in the pit.","“Boss Jun! Boss Jun!”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi rushed to their side, and several other people stood around Jun Linyuan.","“Xiao Wu, how’s Boss Jun? Is it bad?”","Even Feng Xun wanted to cry when he saw Jun Linyuan’s condition.","“I’m gonna kill Night Owl!”","Feng Xun grabbed a sword and rose to his feet.","Chen Ziyun stopped him.","“We can take our revenge whenever we want, but His Royal Highness is... He...","“Is he still alive?”"]},{"number":2987,"title":"Chapter 2987 - Miss Dongfang","paragraphs":["“Is His Royal Highness still alive?”","Everybody fell silent when they heard the question.","Was it that serious?","Could the crown prince have been killed?","Gosh!","The cultivators of the Junwu Empire were worried sick.","What did the crown prince mean to the Junwu Empire?","Everybody knew he was the greatest genius in the empire’s history.","If they wanted to defeat the Dongsang Kingdom, he was their only hope.","If he died, the Dongsang Kingdom could burn the Junwu Empire to the ground.","The thought only made them more nervous.","“Where’s the doctor?”","“Where’s Miss Dongfang?”","“She’s a Supreme Level medicine refiner. Go get her!”","...","Everybody was running around like blind rats.","Feng Wu frowned and bellowed, “Shut up, all of you!”","She couldn’t check Jun Linyuan’s pulse with everybody running around.","Her outburst frightened everybody.","They couldn’t believe such a young girl could speak in such a commanding tone.","Feng Xun knew what an excellent doctor she was and no longer felt so anxious.","He and Xuan Yi finally controlled the situation.","With their help, Feng Wu could finally examine Jun Linyuan.","Night Owl really did some damage this time.","Having been defeated by Jun Linyuan so many times, Night Owl would rather die than have Jun Linyuan rise again.","Luckily, Jun Linyuan swallowed the enhancement pill at the last moment, and it protected his heart.","That was why he was still alive.","As long as he was alive, the rest was treatable.","Feng Wu picked him up and ran back to the fortress with him in her arms.","Intimidated by Feng Wu’s demeanor, everybody made way for her.","Feng Wu ran all the way into the castle.","The other people only realized what had happened after she was gone.","“Is His Royal Highness still alive?”","“He must be! His Royal Highness is so blessed!”","“Was that girl called Feng Wu? She seems to care about His Royal Highness a lot.”","“That’s an understatement. Didn’t you notice it? She was so protective!”","“Haven’t you seen that Miss Dongfang is also...”","“I like Miss Feng Wu. She’s so talented.”","“It’s too early to say anything. The most important thing now is to save His Royal Highness’s life.”","Everybody hated the Dongsang Kingdom even more.","If something happened to the crown prince, the war between the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom would be bloodier than ever.","Feng Wu carried Jun Linyuan all the way into the castle.","Elder Wu was also severely injured, but he didn’t have time to worry about himself.","He led Feng Wu to the crown prince’s room.","Not many people knew Feng Wu yet, but after seeing her amazing battles, many people were so impressed by her.","Many people in the castle were perplexed when they saw her.","Miss Dongfang arrived in a hurry. She didn’t know who Feng Wu was or her relationship with Jun Linyuan."]},{"number":2988,"title":"Chapter 2988 - Save His Royal Highness","paragraphs":["Her eyes popped when she saw Feng Wu carrying the crown prince.","She glared at Feng Wu and scolded her. “Who are you? What are you doing? Put His Royal Highness down!”","His Royal Highness was a neat freak and didn’t like anybody touching him!","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Dongfang, knocked her out of the way, and rushed into the room.","Elder Wu lifted the blanket while Feng Wu set Jun Linyuan down.","Dongfang realized what had happened, and she was mortified.","She was a Supreme Level medicine refiner, and everybody in this castle respected her.","Even the principals of Imperial College and Military Academy recognized her abilities.","The Dongsang Kingdom had Mu Yan, and the Junwu Empire had Dongfang Ziyun.","Without her, the people in this castle would be defenseless!","That was how important Dongfang Ziyun thought she was.","However, this girl gave her a look that made her feel like an idiot.","Dongfang Ziyun couldn’t stand it.","She stormed into the room, just in time to see Feng Wu cutting open the crown prince’s robe. She shoved Feng Wu in rage.","Caught by surprise, Feng Wu stumbled back and almost cut Jun Linyuan.","She was furious.","What was wrong with this woman?","She glared at Dongfang Ziyun and told Feng Xun, “Throw her out of the room!”","Feng Xun walked toward Dongfang Ziyun.","Dongfang Ziyun couldn’t believe her ears.","She thought Feng Wu was crazy. “Get out of my way! I’m a Supreme Level medicine refiner!","“His Royal Highness is in grave danger, and I must treat him!","“You’ll make him worse! Can’t you hear me? Get out!”","Everybody in the castle knew she was in love with the crown prince.","Dongfang Ziyun tried to drag Feng Wu away.","Feng Wu was fuming and threw her scissors at Dongfang Ziyun.","Whoosh!","The scissors flew over Dongfang Ziyun’s head, brushing over her scalp.","That was to say...","Dongfang Ziyun had a bald spot on her head now.","When she felt her bare scalp, Dongfang Ziyun was both furious and frightened.","Feng Xun stepped forward and picked her up by the back of her collar.","Dongfang Ziyun was furious. “Feng Xun, are you deaf? I’m a Supreme Level medicine refiner! Only I can save His Royal Highness! Do you want to get His Royal Highness killed? Kick that stupid girl out!”","Feng Xun found her statement idiotic.","Dongfang was usually a normal person. Why was she so impossible today?","Could jealousy drive a person crazy?","Feng Xun was too worried about Jun Linyuan to talk to Dongfang. He frowned, and his face darkened. “Behave yourself, or Feng Wu will kill you.”","He put down the girl, went back inside, and shut the door behind him.","Dongfang Ziyun was dumbfounded.","She even began to doubt if Feng Xun really was the crown prince’s friend.","Was he trying to get His Royal Highness killed?","“No! I have to save His Royal Highness!”","Dongfang Ziyun came from the Shadowless Sect, one of the four major forces. She had lived like a princess growing up, and had never been ill-treated before."]},{"number":2989,"title":"Chapter 2989 - Is It Possible?","paragraphs":["What to do now?","Who should she turn to?","Northern Feng General and the two principals were too difficult to get hold of, nor was she qualified to see them.","She could only go to her aunt for help.","Her aunt was the most senior elder in the Military Academy.","Elder Dongfang had always been trying to get the crown prince and Dongfang Ziyun together.","At that thought, Dongfang Ziyun rushed toward her aunt’s residence.","The castle was divided into two wings, and the Military Academy had the left wing, which was the better side.","The set-up of the right wing was slightly inferior.","Dongfang Ziyun ran all the way from the right wing to the left.","The fortress had an area of 25 square kilometers, and the houses were set quite far apart.","“Aunt! Aunt!”","Dongfang Ziyun rushed into the courtyard.","Elder Dongfang was at a critical moment in her cultivation and wouldn’t see anyone.","Dongfang Ziyun was stopped at the door.","“Miss Ziyun, I’m sorry, but Elder Dongfang is cultivating now, and no one can disturb her,” said Xuelan, the elder’s maid.","“When will my aunt come out?” Dongfang Ziyun stomped her foot.","“I can’t say for sure.” Xuelan frowned. “Elder Dongfang seldom goes into seclusion, and she may make a breakthrough this time. She mustn’t be disturbed.","“If she succeeds, she’ll be more capable than the most senior elder of the Military Academy. Miss Dongfang, please wait here.” Xuelan stressed how important it was.","Dongfang Ziyun was so frustrated.","Xuelan looked at her in bewilderment.","She knew Miss Dongfang was a mediocre cultivator, but was very talented in the medical field. She was already a Supreme Level medicine refiner, and even His Majesty had complimented her for that.","Miss Dongfang was usually a calm and nonchalant person. Why was she so restless today?","Dongfang Ziyun said, “If my aunt can’t help me, I’ll do it myself!”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was treating Jun Linyuan’s wounds.","His injuries were so severe that she couldn’t find any untouched skin.","She knew that with Jun Linyuan’s capability, as long as his spiritual essence started circulating properly, his superficial wounds would recover quickly.","The internal injury was the tricky part.","He had used most of his spiritual essence to protect the enhancement pill in that critical moment.","“How’s Boss Jun doing?”","Feng Xun panicked when he saw Feng Wu sitting there with a blank face.","Feng Wu said, “He’ll live.”","Feng Xun said, “So, he’ll be fine.”","Feng Wu gave him a long look.","It made Feng Xun uneasy. “What?”","Feng Wu sighed. “I’m worried.”","Feng Xun asked, “About what?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m worried he’ll be like me.”","Feng Xun looked confused.","Feng Wu only shook her head. “I’m worried about his cultivation...”","When Zuo Qingluan destroyed Feng Wu’s cultivation ability, there had been no spiritual essence in her body anymore. Only the tiniest amount of spiritual essence had still lingered in her dantian.","Jun Linyuan’s dantian reminded her of those days.","Feng Xun finally realized what she was talking about. His eyes widened, and he said nervously, “Are you saying that Boss Jun may lose...”"]},{"number":2990,"title":"Chapter 2990 - Elder Dongfang","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Xun paced around the room in frustration.","“We can’t let that happen!” He stared at Feng Wu. “You know Boss Jun is the most talented person in history. He’s the future of the Junwu Empire! If he loses his cultivation ability...”","Feng Wu said, “I only said it was possible, and that’s the worst case scenario. I don’t think he’ll be so unlucky...”","She didn’t sound nervous, but she was more worried than anybody else.","It was all because of her.","If Jun Linyuan hadn’t gone to the Zuo family because of her, things wouldn’t have turned out this way.","She then thought about Night Owl.","What a relentless man!","He wanted to blow Jun Linyuan up even if the explosion could kill him, too. Feng Wu had never hated anybody so much.","She hated Zuo Qingluan, but she hated Night Owl even more.","She gently dressed Jun Linyuan’s wounds and told Feng Xun she needed to make some more pills.","One Semi-Divine enhancement pill wasn’t enough.","She kept Jun Linyuan company while making the enhancement pills.","Luck was on her side this time, and she made three pills in one go.","Feng Xun stared at her. “That’s incredible! You made three pills in one night!”","It had taken Feng Wu days to make the first one, but she was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner now, so it was much easier to make these pills.","She then made the pills into a potion and injected it into Jun Linyuan’s body.","Just then, they heard hurried footsteps outside.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Somebody knocked on the door repeatedly.","Feng Wu was busy treating Jun Linyuan, so Feng Xun went to answer it.","He was very displeased.","He had told the others not to disturb them. Who was defying his order?","He opened the door to find Elder Dongfang outside.","She was the most senior elder of the Military Academy.","The principals of the two schools hardly ever left their offices, and the actual ruler of the fortress was somebody else.","One was Elder Dongfang of the Military Academy, and the other one was Elder Helian of Imperial College.","Dongfang Ziyun stood next to Elder Dongfang, who was the head of 36 elders.","That was to say, her rank was equivalent to lieutenant general, and Gongshu Hongzhu was a major general.","Elder Dongfang frowned at Feng Xun. “Young Lord Feng, I heard His Royal Highness is injured.”","Feng Xun felt the elder was more intimidating than before.","Had she made another breakthrough?","Feng Xun nodded. “He is injured, but Feng Wu is treating him now. There’s no need to worry.”","Dongfang Ziyun glanced at Feng Xun. “His Royal Highness was so badly injured, and people have been saying that he’s on the verge of dying. Get out of my way. I have to save His Royal Highness!”","Feng Xun stared at her and wondered if she couldn’t understand what he was saying.","He frowned. “His Royal Highness is being treated as we speak. Miss Dongfang, your services won’t be necessary.”","Dongfang Ziyun was dumbfounded.","Elder Dongfang turned to Feng Xun. “Ziyun isn’t the best doctor, but she’s still a Supreme Level medicine refiner and the best doctor in this castle. If her services aren’t needed, who else can do it?”"]},{"number":2991,"title":"Chapter 2991 - Humiliation (1)","paragraphs":["Elder Dongfang led the others into the room.","Dongfang Ziyun glanced at Feng Xun smugly.","If he thought he could stop her, he was very much mistaken.","Feng Xun frowned, fearing that Elder Dongfang might disturb Feng Wu.","Elder Dongfang walked into the room to find Jun Linyuan’s eyes tightly shut.","Feng Wu was giving him an injection.","Elder Dongfang scolded Feng Wu. “Who are you? What are you doing?!”","Feng Wu didn’t even look at her and only focused on the injection.","Her potion needed to be injected at a steady speed and pushed into Jun Linyuan’s energy channel with her spiritual essence. Therefore, it would take her a full minute to finish the process.","Elder Dongfang was furious when Feng Wu ignored her.","She was a Spiritual Overlord and the ruler of the castle. How dare this girl disrespect her?","Something like this hadn’t happened in years.","“Arrest her!”","Elder Dongfang gave the order.","She didn’t come alone. There were two people behind her.","They were only her maids, but they were by no means incompetent fighters.","“Stop!” Feng Xun’s face darkened.","He would do anything to stall them for Feng Wu.","He and Xuan Yi stepped out to face Elder Dongfang’s fury.","Elder Dongfang couldn’t believe what was happening. She felt offended.","“Young Lord Feng, are you defying a direct order?”","Elder Dongfang was a lieutenant general. Although Feng Xun was the young lord of the Northern Feng Mansion, he didn’t have as high a military ranking because of his age.","His ranking was...","Elder Dongfang glanced at his shoulder strap and saw he was only a captain.","Feng Xun stood his ground.","Even when he saw Elder Dongfang’s rage, he still wouldn’t move aside.","“Elder Dongfang, I don’t think you know Boss Jun well,” Feng Xun said coldly. “He doesn’t like other people shouting in front of him.”","“Shouting?” Elder Dongfang was amazed.","She was the senior elder of the Military Academy, and bickering with a teenager was beneath her!","She was even more furious now.","She said grimly, “You’re right. His Royal Highness doesn’t like people shouting in his room, so shut up now!”","Feng Xun wanted to say something, when a maid tied his hands behind his back and stuffed a rag in his mouth.","Blue veins popped on his forehead.","Xuan Yi wanted to fight back, but the other maid tied him up, too.","Feng Xun was frantic.","He mumbled loudly.","This old woman!","How dare she tie him up?","Boss Jun would teach her a good lesson when he woke up!","Feng Xun kept struggling, and the temperature around Xuan Yi seemed to drop.","They had had enough of Elder Dongfang.","Luckily, their efforts weren’t for nothing. Feng Wu finished the injection.","After dealing with Feng Xun and Xuan Yi, Elder Dongfang finally focused on Feng Wu."]},{"number":2992,"title":"Chapter 2992 - Humiliation (2)","paragraphs":["She leaned on her walking stick and glared at Feng Wu.","“Tie her up!” she said furiously.","Feng Wu frowned and raised her head slightly.","She finally had time to deal with the newcomers.","“No one touches her!”","Just then, somebody else arrived.","It was none other than the senior elder of the Imperial College, Elder Helian.","He didn’t know Feng Wu, but Elder Wu did. When he realized things were going wrong, he went to fetch Elder Helian.","Imperial College and Military Academy were always competing with each other.","Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang were in charge of the castle’s west and east wing, respectively. Whenever there was a disagreement, they would engage in a fierce argument.","When Elder Wu told Elder Helian that Elder Dongfang was picking on an Imperial College student, Elder Helian couldn’t take it anymore.","He arrived just in time to see what Elder Dongfang was doing.","“What is this?” Elder Helian glared at Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu spoke first.","“Jun Linyuan is being treated for his injuries. He may deteriorate if he’s disturbed.”","Jun Linyuan?","She had just called the crown prince by his name!","Only His Majesty and Her Majesty, the empress dowager, could address him like that, but this girl...","Elder Helian was shocked at first, but he reacted quickly and nodded. “That’s right. No one can take responsibility if something happens to His Royal Highness. Let’s talk outside!”","Elder Dongfang wouldn’t listen to him.","Elder Helian smirked. “Will you take responsibility if His Royal Highness’s injuries worsen?”","Of course Elder Dongfang wouldn’t do that.","Even her entire sect wouldn’t be able to afford the price.","“Outside.” Elder Dongfang glanced at Elder Helian and went out of the room.","“Come out!” Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned and looked at Jun Linyuan for a moment.","Jun Linyuan had stabilized temporarily after the injection, but his spiritual essence hadn’t started circulating yet.","Feng Wu was worried.","However, she had to solve the problem at hand, or they would keep disturbing him.","She followed the others.","Outside.","There was Elder Dongfang, Dongfang Ziyun and the other members of the Military Academy.","Elder Helian, Elder Wu, Feng Xun, Xuan Yi and Feng Wu were from the Imperial College.","Elder Dongfang immediately pointed at Feng Wu. “Who on earth are you? Are you a medicine refiner? What level are you? Who gave you the right to treat His Royal Highness?”","She then turned to Elder Helian. “Ziyun is a Supreme Level medicine refiner, and no one in this castle is better than her. These people tried to stop her from treating the crown prince. Instead, this girl is doing the job. How’s that possible?”"]},{"number":2993,"title":"Chapter 2993 - A Semi-Divine Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["Dongfang Ziyun reminded her aunt about Feng Wu’s armband.","Elder Dongfang was even angrier. “Look at her armband! She hasn’t even graduated from Imperial College yet!”","She couldn’t be any more displeased.","She had come all the way here only to argue with a child who hadn’t graduated.","How humiliating!","Elder Dongfang felt she had been played, but she couldn’t blame her own niece, so she directed all her rage toward Feng Wu.","Elder Helian didn’t know who Feng Wu was either.","This was the first time he had met her.","However, he was happy to see Elder Dongfang so mad.","Of course, he didn’t let the others see how pleased he was. Instead, he cleared his throat and put on a straight face. “Feng Wu, do you have an explanation?”","Feng Wu frowned and didn’t beat around the bush. “I’m a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.”","What she said almost made other people faint.","“Ahem...”","“Haha!”","“OMG.”","Other people reacted with different expressions, but they all thought she was bragging.","Elder Dongfang rolled her eyes at Feng Wu. She couldn’t believe she had been arguing with an idiot.","Even Elder Helian was astonished.","He wanted to speak up for his student, but there was no way he would be able to convince the others that Feng Wu was telling the truth.","Dongfang Ziyun was much more direct. She looked at Feng Wu as if the latter was an imbecile. She had to take a deep breath before she could speak again.","“I’ve never heard such a ridiculous lie. You’re a pretty girl. Don’t you have any shame at all?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Elder Dongfang waved at her maids. “Get her out of here. She’s such a clown.”","Elder Wu didn’t believe Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, but...","“The pill Miss Feng Wu gave His Royal Highness was a Semi-Divine enhancement pill,” Elder Wu said affirmatively. “Otherwise, Night Owl wouldn’t have set off that explosion to stop His Royal Highness from taking the pill.”","Elder Dongfang frowned. “That doesn’t prove she made that pill.”","She then looked at the potion in Feng Wu’s hand. “What did you inject His Royal Highness with?”","Medicine could be in the form of pills, potions, and injectable potions.","Elder Dongfang had seen the last type because Dongfang Ziyun knew how to perform an injection.","Feng Wu said, “It’s the potion of a Semi-Divine pill.”","Elder Dongfang didn’t want to talk to her anymore.","She glanced at Dongfang. “Take a look at the potion.”","Dongfang Ziyun despised Feng Wu even more. She walked up to Feng Wu and asked for the potion. “The potion of a Semi-Divine pill? Don’t you know that is even harder to make than a Semi-Divine enhancement pill?”"]},{"number":2994,"title":"Chapter 2994 - What Did You Say?","paragraphs":["She wondered when Feng Wu would stop bragging.","She then examined the syringe.","She did it right in front of Feng Wu because she thought she could humiliate Feng Wu later.","Elder Dongfang glanced at Elder Helian. “Helian, is that how you’ve been teaching your students?”","Elder Helian blushed.","He felt abashed by what Feng Wu said and gave Elder Wu a dirty look.","Elder Wu rubbed his nose. He had no idea Feng Wu would say such things.","Elder Dongfang was glad to see Elder Helian ill at ease.","The elders usually behaved in such an unapproachable way in front of their subordinates, but when they were among their peers, they would show their emotions just like any ordinary people.","It wasn’t any different from the world that Feng Wu used to live in before coming here.","Seeing that Dongfang Ziyun was still examining the potion, Elder Dongfang glanced at Elder Helian and sneered. “Helian, if she were my student, I would have kicked her out of the Military Academy. Imperial College needs to be more strict with their students.”","Elder Helian blushed. He didn’t come all this way to be laughed at because of a girl.","He was disappointed in Feng Wu.","He wanted to scold Feng Wu and leave this place.","However...","Elder Dongfang was talking to Dongfang Ziyun now.","“Ziyun, have you finished?” Elder Dongfang frowned. “What’s taking you so long? What potion is it? Is it an inferior one?”","At that thought, Elder Dongfang wanted to examine the potion herself.","The crown prince was involved!","Elder Helian was also alarmed.","An inferior potion? Was she trying to kill His Royal Highness?","He glared at Feng Wu.","However, the girl wasn’t intimidated at all.","Elder Helian suddenly felt frustrated.","He was the most senior elder in the Imperial College, and there were 35 elders under him. However, this girl wasn’t scared of him at all.","Was he too approachable, or were children these days so fearless?","Dongfang Ziyun murmured something.","Even Elder Dongfang couldn’t hear her clearly.","“What? Speak up!” Elder Dongfang frowned.","Dongfang Ziyun hated the conclusion she had reached, but she had no choice. “It’s a Semi-Divine enhancement liquid...”","She was jealous of Feng Wu, but she wouldn’t lie where her profession was concerned.","She respected her profession.","What she said shocked everybody.","Elder Dongfang almost jumped to her feet. “What did you say?!”"]},{"number":2995,"title":"Chapter 2995 - The Truth","paragraphs":["Dongfang Ziyun seemed pale, and she wanted Elder Dongfang to stop talking.","She even wanted to drag her aunt away.","However, Elder Dongfang was too proud to leave like this.","She grabbed Dongfang Ziyun’s wrist. “What did you say it was?”","Dongfang Ziyun wished she could disappear.","Elder Dongfang was staring at her, so she had to tell the truth.","“It’s a Semi-Divine enhancement liquid...” Her voice still wasn’t very loud, but it was loud enough for everybody to hear her.","Elder Dongfang was the closest, so she couldn’t pretend she couldn’t hear her.","She glared at Dongfang Ziyun, and Dongfang Ziyun nodded, looking like she was going to cry.","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","The Semi-Divine enhancement liquid was much more difficult to make than the pill and potion forms.","What a...","Elder Dongfang reacted quickly.","She stared at Feng Wu and asked slowly, “Where did you get this liquid? Who gave it to you? Was it His Majesty?”","That was right!","Dongfang Ziyun suddenly felt she could breathe again.","No one could say for sure that Feng Wu had made that liquid herself.","Feng Wu glanced at Elder Dongfang. “It’s mine.”","Elder Dongfang asked, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “I made it myself.”","Elder Dongfang smirked. “You? How old are you? Are you a Semi-Divine medicine refiner? Do you have a certificate? Show us.”","Feng Wu couldn’t show her because she hadn’t become a Semi-Divine medicine refiner until the night before.","Seeing that Feng Wu didn’t answer her question, Elder Dongfang smirked. “In Imperial College, even the elders in charge of medicine refinement aren’t Semi-Divine ones yet.”","She glanced at Elder Helian.","Elder Helian snapped. “Do you have such elders?”","Elder Dongfang said, “We don’t, and that makes Ziyun, a Supreme Level medicine refiner, the most senior medicine refiner here.”","If Feng Wu could prove she was what she claimed to be, Elder Dongfang would be utterly humiliated.","Therefore, she was trying her best to prove otherwise.","She stared at Feng Wu. “You’re not a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, are you? You’ve been lying!”","Feng Wu couldn’t stand her anymore.","She frowned and waved her off. “Whatever you say.”","She headed back in.","She needed to keep an eye on Jun Linyuan and had no time to chat with this hostile old lady.","“Stop right there!”","Elder Dongfang wouldn’t be ignored.","Feng Wu stopped and looked over her shoulder.","“If you can’t prove it, you’re lying! Do you know the consequences of doing that?”","Before she could go on, Feng Wu waved her hand, and a small cauldron appeared."]},{"number":2996,"title":"Chapter 2996 - Greed","paragraphs":["Elder Dongfang frowned. “What are you doing?”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “I’m making my medicine.”","She had found the cauldron in the imperial apothecary when she went there with Emperor Wu’s token.","It was a portable instrument, and it had been collecting dust in the palace, so she took it without hesitation.","Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Had the girl lost her mind?","Making medicine?","Does she think I haven’t seen this process before?","I’ve seen Ziyun making her pills!","It has to be in a refinement room, and there mustn’t be any noise!","The girl was going to do that in front of so many people.","Who was she trying to fool?","“I can tell you know nothing about medicine refinement.” Elder Dongfang smirked. “A real medicine refiner doesn’t work like this.”","Elder Dongfang glanced at Dongfang Ziyun, feeling proud of the girl.","Dongfang Ziyun nodded at her aunt.","She then told Feng Wu, “Feng Wu, don’t humiliate yourself. That’s not how you make pills. You don’t know a thing.”","She was relieved.","For a moment, she really thought Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner because the girl was so calm.","When Feng Wu took out the cauldron, Dongfeng Ziyun thought she had revealed the fact that she was only as capable as a student could be.","“What do you mean she doesn’t know a thing? Xiao Wu has been a Supreme Level medicine refiner for a long time!”","Feng Xun finally broke free. He pulled the rag out of his mouth and shouted at Dongfang Ziyun.","Dongfang Ziyun only shook her head. “Feng Xun, stop bragging. I’m a genius, and I only became a Supreme Level medicine refiner at 20. As for her...”","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu is only 14!”","Dongfang Ziyun smirked. “A 14-year-old is a Semi-Divine medicine refiner? Can it get more ridiculous than that? I’m done talking to you!”","Dongfang Ziyun wanted to chase Feng Wu away.","However, she was shocked by what she saw.","That small cauldron was floating in the air and burning on its own.","No, it wasn’t like that.","A small colorful bird was breathing fire at it.","Dongfang Ziyun was dumbfounded.","When she looked at Feng Wu, she saw her putting materials into the cauldron.","Dongfang Ziyun recognized several of them.","Where did Feng Wu get those materials from?","She then saw a storage pouch hanging on Feng Wu’s belt.","That pouch contained a storage space; even Dongfang Ziyun’s own sect didn’t have something like that.","Her aunt, who was the most senior elder of the Military Academy, didn’t have such a treasure either.","How could Feng Wu have such a thing?","Dongfang Ziyun was so jealous.","It would be so convenient if she had one of her own.","She was so jealous, and she wanted to take it from Feng Wu."]},{"number":2997,"title":"Chapter 2997 - The Pill","paragraphs":["Dongfang Ziyun wasn’t the only one who felt that way.","Many people stared at Feng Wu’s storage pouch in jealousy.","Feng Xun smirked. “That’s from Boss Jun, and it has his personal inscriptions on it. Do you want to take it by force?”","Dongfang Ziyun stared at Feng Xun in disbelief.","If the pouch had the crown prince’s personal inscriptions on it, he would know when the pouch was taken by force.","Dongfang Ziyun was even more jealous.","She stared at Feng Wu. “What’s your relationship with His Royal Highness?!”","Feng Wu ignored her.","She was concentrating on her refinement process.","The Semi-Divine enhancement liquid wasn’t that easy to make, but the process had been shortened significantly after her improvement the night before.","Little Phoenix breathed fire at the cauldron, and Feng Wu adjusted the materials. Their work was in perfect harmony.","Dongfang Ziyun couldn’t watch anymore.","“You look the part.” She smirked at Feng Wu. “Unfortunately, you can’t pretend forever.”","The others were going to leave at first because they didn’t want to waste their time watching Feng Wu.","However, Dongfang Ziyun decided to stay because of His Royal Highness.","It was common knowledge in the fortress that she was in love with the crown prince.","When Dongfang Ziyun learned of Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan’s relationship, all she wanted was to defeat Feng Wu.","She wanted to destroy Feng Wu forever.","Dongfang Ziyun stopped her aunt. “If she’s bold enough to make her medicine, let’s give her a chance.”","She then whispered in her aunt’s ear, “She’s so pretty that it makes me uneasy. Please help me.","“She’s obviously bluffing.","“If we leave now, we’ll look like we’re afraid of her, as if she really is a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","“Aunt, we can’t leave. Let’s stay here and see what she can make.","“Once we have proof that she’s bluffing, we can laugh at her and spread the news. Her reputation will be ruined!","“Aunt, please help me!”","Dongfang Ziyun held her aunt’s arm and pleaded.","Elder Dongfang knew what Dongfang Ziyun wanted and that she was in love with the crown prince. She would like to help her niece.","If Dongfang Ziyun could marry the crown prince, it would benefit the Shadowless Sect greatly.","At that thought, Elder Dongfang nodded. “Alright. Let’s wait and see.”","Somebody had fetched two chairs for the two elders.","Since Elder Dongfang wasn’t leaving, nor would Elder Helian. He didn’t want to seem weaker than the Military Academy.","Deep down, he wished he were somewhere else.","Elder Dongfang would sneer at him from time to time, making him rather embarrassed.","Elder Helian had just sat down, when Feng Wu said, “It’s done.”","With a wave of her hand, the aroma of medicine filled the air."]},{"number":2998,"title":"Chapter 2998 - Can’t Be Real","paragraphs":["“It’s done?”","Dongfang Ziyun was resting her head on her aunt’s knees and yawned. She had been about to take a nap, when she heard those baffling words.","What did she mean?","Who was she trying to fool?","She looked at Feng Wu in annoyance.","“If I’m not a Supreme Level medicine refiner, she might actually...","“What’s that smell?”","Dongfang Ziyun took a deep breath, and her nostrils were filled with the aroma.","That was...","The Shadowless Sect might not be a treasure trove, but they had accumulated some Semi-Divine pills.","Her master had shown them to her once, and their aroma was very similar to what she was smelling now.","Dongfang Ziyun thought, “Can she even mimic the smell?”","“Ziyun?” Elder Dongfang also noticed the scent. She nudged her niece, telling her to check it out.","Dongfang Ziyun’s stomach lurched. She had a bad feeling about this.","She told herself, “No, it can’t be...","“How can a 14-year-old make a Semi-Divine enhancement pill in such a short time?","“Even my master can’t do that!”","She rushed toward Feng Wu, trying to see what was going on.","She arrived just in time to see the round pill.","The Semi-Divine pills had special marks and a golden glow. They couldn’t be faked.","Hence...","Dongfang Ziyun felt she would lose her mind when she saw it.","She stared at the pill in the cauldron.","“You...","“What...","“No...","“Gosh...”","She was so shocked that she couldn’t form a coherent sentence.","She tried several times before she could say, “You played a trick, didn’t you? You put a pill in the cauldron when we weren’t looking!”","Dongfang Ziyun shrieked like a crazy person.","It couldn’t be real!","It had to be a trick!","If Feng Wu had really made that pill, Dongfang Ziyun and her aunt would look like idiots.","Dongfang Ziyun glared at Feng Wu, hoping to hear that it was a joke.","But...","Feng Wu never even looked at her.","Smack!","Dongfang Ziyun felt as if she had been slapped.","She was so scared that she had lost control, but her opponent didn’t even look at her.","She felt like a clown.","“Ziyun, what’s going on?” Elder Dongfang rose to her feet. She didn’t seem too happy.","Seeing her niece’s reaction, Elder Dongfang knew something was wrong.","“Aunt, it can’t be real! It can’t be!” Dongfang Ziyun waved her hands in the air, unable to form a full sentence. Nobody knew what she was talking about.","Elder Dongfang didn’t know what Dongfang Ziyun was trying to say. She slammed her staff down and glared at Dongfang Ziyun. “Speak like a normal person!”"]},{"number":2999,"title":"Chapter 2999 - Stop","paragraphs":["“It’s a Semi-Divine enhancement pill!” Dongfang Ziyun ground her teeth. “There’s a Semi-Divine enhancement pill in that cauldron!”","WHAT?!","Elder Dongfang finally realized how serious it was.","She rushed toward Feng Wu and stopped a few steps away from the cauldron.","She stared at the little cauldron and saw a pill floating out.","That was...","“It’s a Semi-Divine enhancement pill. It really is...”","Elder Dongfang felt like she had been punched in the face, and her temples throbbed.","Elder Helian followed her. His eyes widened when he saw the pill.","How crazy had this world become?","Dongfang Ziyun wouldn’t believe it. “She switched it. Think about what you saw. She switched this Semi-Divine pill with what she made, right?”","She would rather die than believe a 14-year-old could do that.","Switch pills?","Elder Helian searched his memory and realized he hadn’t been paying attention to the process, so he didn’t see if Feng Wu had done that.","He turned to Elder Wu. “Did you see it?”","Elder Wu shook his head. “No, she didn’t switch pills. I was watching her the whole time.”","Dongfang said, “No, she must have! I’m sure of it!”","Elder Dongfang wasn’t paying attention either.","No one paid attention to Feng Wu, who was supposed to be useless.","Elder Dongfang couldn’t give an answer either.","“You people are unbelievable.” Feng Xun smirked because he had seen the process and knew that Feng Wu had made it on her own.","He hadn’t said anything because he was also shocked.","Finally, he could think again.","Feng Xun gloated at Dongfang Ziyun. “Xiao Wu made a Semi-Divine enhancement pill in front of everybody, but you’re saying she switched the pills. Do you hear how ridiculous you sound?”","Dongfang Ziyun ground her teeth but couldn’t think of anything to say.","Her aunt blushed, but she still chose to believe Dongfang Ziyun.","“I think she probably switched the pills,” Elder Dongfang told Elder Helian.","Elder Helian also hesitated.","However, at that moment —","“What are you doing?!” Dongfang Ziyun stared at Feng Wu because Feng Wu was melting the Semi-Divine enhancement pill.","Everybody stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Elder Helian cried out, “Stop it! We believe you! Don’t ruin the pill! It’s more important than your life!”","Feng Wu gave him a baffled look before continuing her work.","Elder Helian wanted to take the pill from her, but the fire was so hot that even he couldn’t withstand it.","Moreover, taking the pill by force might damage it."]},{"number":3000,"title":"Chapter 3000 - Frustration","paragraphs":["Elder Helian had no choice but to watch Feng Wu melt the pill.","“You —”","Elder Helian wanted to shout at Feng Wu for being so wasteful.","The girl didn’t know what she was doing!","How could she destroy such a precious pill?","Dongfang Ziyun glared at Feng Wu angrily. “You’re destroying evidence, aren’t you? You’re covering up your tracks! Tell me I’m right!”","“You’re so loud.”","Feng Wu finally had enough and said impatiently, “Are you really a Supreme Level medicine refiner? Can’t you see I’m making the Semi-Divine enhancement liquid?”","She didn’t want to show off, but these people wouldn’t stop nagging, and she had to say something.","It wasn’t like she had another choice.","It wouldn’t make any difference whether she made the pill in public or behind closed doors. She still needed to give Jun Linyuan the injection later tonight.","Feng Wu said those words in the most casual tone, but the others wouldn’t believe her.","Who would believe that a 14-year-old could make a Semi-Divine enhancement pill, which would take other medicine refiners decades to make?","Therefore, Dongfang Ziyun, Elder Dongfang and even Elder Helian didn’t believe her.","Dongfang Ziyun wanted to shout at Feng Wu, but she already began to panic.","Her worst nightmare was coming true.","She glared at the cauldron and murmured, “She can’t make it. She can’t...”","If Feng Wu successfully made the liquid, it would mean she was even more than a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Dongfang Ziyun and her aunt would be utterly humiliated.","Moreover, it would crush Dongfang Ziyun’s confidence and break her!","The last thing she wanted was to see Feng Wu succeed.","However!","Dongfang Ziyun watched as the pill melted. Gradually, the brown liquid became transparent.","No!!!","Dongfang Ziyun screamed in her head.","Her eyes were wide open, and she had bitten through her lower lip.","However, she couldn’t stop Feng Wu.","The liquid was poured into a small transparent vial.","That was the Semi-Divine enhancement liquid.","The real thing!","Dongfang Ziyun swayed, and her knees buckled.","Elder Dongfang’s maid had to use all her strength to pull the girl up.","“Miss?” Xuelan was shocked.","Dongfang Ziyun looked awful. She was covered in cold sweat, and her face was drained of all color. She was shaking from head to toe.","“Ziyun?” Elder Dongfang shouted furiously.","Dongfang Ziyun grabbed Elder Dongfang’s hand. She thought she was going to collapse."]}]);
